<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="DEU" style="id">unfoldingWord Literal Text</book>
  <para style="ide">UTF-8</para>
  <para style="h">Hezaidung</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hezaidung Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hezaidung</para>
  <para style="toc3">Hez.</para>
  <para style="mt">Deuteronomy</para>
  <para style="mt">Hezaidung Laisiukwak</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Hezaidung pelane “hezai kenabe.” Mmi riakdai cai Israelme Sampetkebeu Canaan Deu ga nlüt lai bamdi. Dede ciciu kecudwa Moses penuide penui rasam rangnsung kegai teineu di, Tinggwang penui ziemne teikegai leune nah Tinggwang ne kedetkelu minadung tei eh penui mzai jüja la kera zaidungde.</para>
  <para style="ip">Pe sam keraibe cai mbeu kah kegwang gade Tinggwang penui dede pe zai keyi nah penuide Canaan deu kepeude rangnsung kegai tei. Moses sam kenabe cai Tinggwang zaidung rangndui kegai sam kerei de si eh Moses au penuide Rampaube n Tinggwang de “mlung pelane nah n keringria pelane nah n kengkieng pelane teu eh ku lulo” rangbeu Tinggwang samlam teu eh kehega jüja lalu kerane. Moses au Tinggwang de ngngwa eh lungh lalu kerane, minadungde Rampaube de kulu nah pe samdung mzailu kera ledeu beu kera ranglia gai.</para>
  <para style="ip">Hezaidung laisiukwak de Israelme de Tinggwang penuide samkak kelude (pedum 29), Joshua depeu muiteu kehecibe tei kera kedetkelu de (pedum 31), nah Moses tsit (pedum 34) ha de nsung keheci dai beu. Mina kekie le Moses ne Hezaidung laisiukwak de raugai lie eh luu kelu teila pe tsit ha rau de gwale.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses samrang keraibe: Israel reha (1:1-4:43)</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses samrang kenabe: hezai piecaili kegai (1:44-11:32)</para>
  <para style="io1">Tingba ramsang ziemne hezaidung (12:1-26:19)</para>
  <para style="io1">Samzaiketei nah samzai teikemak caineu (27:1-28:68)</para>
  <para style="io1">Samkak kelude teihecikelu (29:1-30:20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Moses Israelme de samlam kebeu nah pe tsit (31:1-34:12)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="DEU 1" />
  <para style="s">Horeb püt dilo samkai kebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 1:1" />Sam aidungde Moses ne Israelme Jordan kahpetlwe hetaideu ga, Jordan Reuki langkam langkie ga Suph de ncwa kebam, Paran, Tophel, Laban, Hazeroth, nah Dizahab kakga kebam pelane dage ranggai. <verse eid="DEU 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 1:2" />Horeb<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Horeb: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">zi keda ge lie cai Mount Sinai.</char></note> gade Seir Deutu lampui gade Kadesh Barnea<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kadesh Barnea: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hangdeu kecai ga malung keyi heni ge</char></note> ga kegwang ziangreieket ketet beuh ge. <verse eid="DEU 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 1:3" />Israelme Egypt gi kedicai mmi riakdai bekum, kei kereieket bekei, tingbazie raitu benai, Moses Israelme dage ranggai, penui dage penui ziemne RAMPAUBE pecu ranglo aja kai kebeu pelane rangbeu. <verse eid="DEU 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 1:4" />Aide RAMPAUBE Amorme gwangpei Sihon, Heshbon namceu ga lungh kebam, nah Bashan gwangpei Og, Ashtaroth namceu ga lungh kebamde Edrei namceu gade ngamkedi caine. <verse eid="DEU 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 1:5" />Jordan kahpetlwe, Moab deu gade, Moses keledeu sam aidungde rangmci lia cuh, rang eh, <verse eid="DEU 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 1:6" />“RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang Horeb gade anui dage rang, ‘Nnui aipau lamlwatu pi ga lungh tietau dida. <verse eid="DEU 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 1:7" />Nreulwe tetgai cu, nah Amorme hangdeutu deudi ga miecu nah cide taiga kebam heni pelane ga Jordan Reuki langkam langkie ga, hangdeutu deudi ga, hangdeu kehenahdung ga, Negev ga, nah jaadikung gadung, Canaanme deu ga, nah Lebanon ga kereuki kedi, Euphrate ga kecang. <verse eid="DEU 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 1:8" />Pielo, Ih nnui dwaga hangdeu mteipwa bamda; mielu delwe hangdeu de gumlu RAMPAUBE ne sampet kebeu nnui peime da, Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob dage, penuide nah penui leuhme penui cai lungh kegwangme de peu kerade.’<verse eid="DEU 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muiteu kedetkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 1:9" />Cidau Ih nnui dage rangbeu, ‘Ih akatei nnuide pung pa gailak. <verse eid="DEU 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 1:10" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide tei ngkiee beuda, nah, pielo, nnui henai au tinggim ga hegidung kieege dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 11:12">Heb. 11:12</ref> </char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 1:11" />Peu RAMPAUBE, nnui peimedung Tinggwang de, nnui cu kebam swade nnuide cangcang kieege teingkiee si beulu, nah nnuide samlam beulu, pa nnui dage pe sampet kebeu nzwa! <verse eid="DEU 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 1:12" />Dede dainzwa eh Ih akatei pung pa lulai nnui pütdung, nnui reidung, nah nnui kehebwakdung? <verse eid="DEU 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 1:13" />Makecime de, macetkeyi minadung de, nah rütlu kebui minadung de heleuh ramsang gade kedetlu, nah Ih penuide nnui reu peu keteume tei beuzie.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 1:14" />Nnui acu keligai nah rang, ‘Nang rang kebeude tei kera ma keyige delie anui ziemne.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 1:15" />Cine Ih luu luda nnui leuhme pe peu keteume de, makecime de, nah rütlu kebui minadung de, nah penuide nnui reu pe peu keteume tei luda, cangge muibedung, hai muibedung, riakngei muibedung, kerei muibedung, nah kedime, heleuh pelane ga. <verse eid="DEU 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 1:16" />Cidau Ih nnui gu tutiakmedung dage aja kaibeu, ‘Nnui sinamedung kakga kehebwakdung de kingnei lulo, nah makesang gage hetu tiak siakte lulo mige nah pe sinapei kakga, nah sangme pecu ngngwa kelabe de de.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 7:51">Jhn. 7:51</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 1:17" />Nnui kehebwak kecuga migede de heneu herüt tei diso; nnui keceu gede nah kedi gede kingnei lu. Nnui migede de hing dilak, kedanemene tiak kelude au Tinggwang dade lu. Kehebwak tiak kera nnui ziemne hungham kedibe, nnui a da teugwang zie, nah Ih cide kingnei luzie.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 2:9">Jas. 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 1:18" />Ih cidau nnui tei kerabe pelane nnui dage aja kaibeu dida.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Num 13:1-33 </char></note><verse eid="DEU 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reketme langkegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 1:19" />Anui Horeb gade tetdi nah kedi nah kengngi hetaideu pelane nnui kengaude kahgwang da, Amorme gu hangdeutu deudi ga gwang keladau, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang ne aja kai kebeu nzwa; nah anui Kadesh Barnea ga gwang canglu. <verse eid="DEU 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 1:20" />Ih nnui dage rang, ‘Nnui Amorme gu hangdeutu deudi ga gwang luda, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang ne anuide peu lai eh kebamde. <verse eid="DEU 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 1:21" />Pielo, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui dwaga hangdeu mteipwa bamda; nghang cu, delwe gumlu, RAMPAUBE, nnui peime Tinggwang, nnui dage rang kebeu nzwa; ngngi diso, mede lunghau diso.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 1:22" />Nnui pelane a da gwang eh rang, ‘Anui midungge de anui dwa langnswa gaigo, ciude penui anui ziemne hangdeu peei beulu kerane, nah anui daipau lampui gade gwaketang ziebi kecu sam teugwang beulu kera, nah anui daipau namdi ga gwang ziebi kecu.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 1:23" />Cipau kecet de asui di; Ih nnui mina kereiekena de kedetlu, hangge heleuh ramsang gade. <verse eid="DEU 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 1:24" />Mina hangkereiekena aidungde tetpwa hangdeutu deudi ga nghang di, delwe Eshkol langkam ga gwanglu, nah cide galu. <verse eid="DEU 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 1:25" />Penui hangdeu cikade ngaukelu ginia kesa penui ba gage pwagwang nah anui da pwa nghung beu. Penui anuida sam teugwang si nah rang, ‘Hangdeu keyi gelie RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide peulai eh kebamde.’<verse eid="DEU 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube de renia kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 1:26" />Dede nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang aja kai kebeude de reniadi, delwe mie regi raudi. <verse eid="DEU 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 1:27" />Nnui nnui paikidung gade ncamdi eh rangdi, “Aide kedanemene RAMPAUBE anuide ngkau kecune pa anuide Egypt deu gade ngngwa mpetlu, anuide Amoritme ba gage kaibeu eh anuide teingkap dilu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 1:28" />Anui cu daiga mie lulai? Anui siname hangkereiekena ne anui mlung tei nceu dida, rang eh, ‘Cika minadung au anui swade di nah tieki lie; penui namdidung de kedige nah riepwa tinggimdung tungcang lie; cipau reude, anui Anakimme napeidung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:28 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anakim nah kedadungde ne hangdeu mpaube kesangbe da, penui maadi ziemne mina leune ne ci. Anakim leuhdung kengkieng kedi Anak dade lungh gwang. </char></note> de cikade ngau.’” <verse eid="DEU 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 1:29" />Pecai Ih nnui dage rangla, ‘Ngngi diso, mede cidungde de hing so. <verse eid="DEU 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 1:30" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, nnui dwaga tet kelabe, pa nnui ziemne regi beuzie, pa Egypt ga nnui miakdwa gade maleune tei kegai nzwa, <verse eid="DEU 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 1:31" />nah hetaideu gade de, nnui ngau da RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide dainzwa pungbeu bi kecu, mipei ge pe na de pungla kecunzwa, nnui kemie leuga nnui heni aika gwang cang kemaktane.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 13:18</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 1:32" />Dede sam aide caide nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nlumlu tadi, <verse eid="DEU 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 1:33" />nnui dwarai eh tet kemiebe de nnui ziemne heni ge pei kera ramzeuki tei kerane, tingmui mi pwa eh tet nah hemwa ne ting kebaadau.<verse eid="DEU 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 1:34" />RAMPAUBE nnui samdung kwa siulu nah pe rata di; pa sampet nah rang, <verse eid="DEU 1:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 1:35" />‘Ceheu kemau aika migede Ih nnui paumedung de peu zielie a sampet kaikebeu hangdeu keyi de ngau lak, <verse eid="DEU 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 1:36" />Jephunneh napei Caleb rünne gwale; pa cide ngau zie. Pecu Ih pa hangdeu mie ga kelude peuzie, nah pe namedung de, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE caisui cangsiak kelune.’ <verse eid="DEU 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 1:37" />Nnui ziemne RAMPAUBE acude pe rata di, rang eh, ‘Nang de cika lüt lak; <verse eid="DEU 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 1:38" />Nun napei Joshua, nnui dwa sap kebambe, pa cika lüt zie; pecu teingkuu lu, kedanemene pa Israelme de teuswa eh cide gumlu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 1:39" />Cipau reude, nnui name henamedung, tuiteu dizie lie nnui rang kecudung de, henai keyi kesia cigai kelakdung, penui cika lüt zie. Ih penuide peuzie, nah penui cide gum luzie. <verse eid="DEU 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 1:40" />Dede nnui ziemne au, nreulu nah caili tetgai cu hetaideu gage Jaaidi Kegie le ge tet gailu.’<verse eid="DEU 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 1:41" />Pecai nnui keligai nah a da rang, ‘Anui RAMPAUBE de mcau eh kemau tei dida; anui nghanglwe regi zieda, nah RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide tei lulo eh aja kai kebeu leu caisui zieda.’ Mina leune nnui kakga kebam keregi kera niadung kailu, nah hangdeutu deudi de ketang kera nnui mtei lu. <verse eid="DEU 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 1:42" />RAMPAUBE a dage rang, ‘Penuide rang beulo, “Gwaketang nah regi lak, kedanemene Ih nnuide ngngwala lakta, nah nnui ngaurau medung ne nnuide ngamdi zie lu.’ ” <verse eid="DEU 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 1:43" />Ih nnui dage ainzwa rang beuda, dede nnui kingnei ma. Nnui RAMPAUBE aja kai kebeu dungde de renia di; nnui mnei ma nah hangdeutu deudi de gwaketang. <verse eid="DEU 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 1:44" />Dede Amormedung, hangdeutu deudi ga kelunghme, nnuide mmaudi nah tegeine nzwa nnuide gwapet, nah nnuide Seir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seir: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Seir de Edom da, Esau leuhmedung ne gumkelu cuikui.</char></note> gade ngamlu, Hormah namdi ga kecang. <verse eid="DEU 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 1:45" />Nnui cailigwang nah RAMPAUBE dage hapgai kengha kie eh; dede RAMPAUBE nnui kwa kingnei ma, nah pa nnui dage pelung kaiswa tadi. <verse eid="DEU 1:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 1:46" />Cine nnui Kadesh ga tingbazie ketiege bamdi, nnui cika bam kecu tingbazie pelane.<verse eid="DEU 1:46" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="DEU 2" />
  <para style="s">Hetaideu ga rwalakedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 2:1" />Pecai anui nreulwe Jaadi Kegie lampui lebie de hetaideu gage anui tet gaidi, RAMPAUBE a dage rangkebeu nzwa; anui Sier Deutu ga tingbazie kekiee ge rwa ladi. <verse eid="DEU 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 2:2" />RAMPAUBE a dage mpau eh, ranggai, <verse eid="DEU 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 2:3" />‘Nnui lamlwatu cika huila tiesüt dida; tingpeule ge nreu gailu. <verse eid="DEU 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 2:4" />Minadung dage aja kai beulo eh, ranggai, Seir ga lungh kebam, Esau leuhme, nnui kibaume deudi nam de nnui kahgwang lauda; penui nnuide hing zie. Ciziemne sünne lu <verse eid="DEU 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 2:5" />penuide ngngwa regi dilak kerane, kedanemene Ih nnuide penui deu kette peu lau ma, ma, mi pi gede saplu kerade halau ma; kedanemene Ih Sier Deutu Esau de pegu tei kera peu dida.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Bat. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 2:6" />Nnui rangkang le penui dade taktyei lui zie, ciude nnui tyeilu kerane; nnui rangkang le penui dade dui de lui zie, cinzwa eh nnui saklu kerane.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 2:7" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui ba le teikegai pelane ga nnuide samlam beuda; pa nnui hetaideu kedi aide ga tetgwang kecu cibam. Kedanemene mmi riakdai aide ga RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide ngngwa la, nah nnui magede gah ma. <verse eid="DEU 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 2:8" />Cine anui tetkahgwang anui kibaume, Esau leuhme de, Sier ga kelunghme, Arabah lampui gade nreudi eh, Elath nah Ezion Geber namceu gade kenghang de. Pecai anui nreu eh Moab hetaideu lampui gade kahgwang. <verse eid="DEU 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 2:9" />RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, ‘Moab de teikeherei so, nah penuide ngngwa regi so. Kedanemene Ih pe deu nnuide nnui gu teikera peu lau ma, kedanemene Ih Lot leuhme de Ar peu dida, penui gu teilu kerane.’ <verse eid="DEU 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 2:10" />(Pedwa cika Emimmedung lungh, penui kedi, kekiee, nah ketie Anakimme nzwa; <verse eid="DEU 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 2:11" />Penuide de Rephaim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rephaim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina kengkieng kedi.</char></note> lie qula, Anakimme de qu kelanzwa; dede Moabme au penuide Emimme de qula. <verse eid="DEU 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 2:12" />Pedwa Horitme de Sier ga lungh da, dede Esau leuhme ne penuide ngamdi. Penui ne penui dwagade penuide ngkapdi delwe penui cika lunghdi, Israelme RAMPAUBE penuide kepeu deu de gage teikegai nzwa.) <verse eid="DEU 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 2:13" />“‘Cu cuhlu delwe Zered reuki ga kahmie cu.’ Cine anui Zered reuki kahmie lu. <verse eid="DEU 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 2:14" />Cu anui Kadesh Barnea gade kegwang ting kecudau Zered reuki de kah kemak kecang, mmi camreieheset di. Cipau tingdau hereu keregilu kera ceheu pelane tsai ciaudi, RAMPAUBE penui dage sampet kai kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 2:15" />Cipau reude, penui pelane de ngkap ciaudi kemaktane RAMPAUBE ceheu cide de renia eh bamdi.<verse eid="DEU 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 2:16" />Cine cinzwadi, hereu keregilu keramedung tsai ciaudi eh minadung kakgade tet kedidau, <verse eid="DEU 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 2:17" />RAMPAUBE a dage mpau eh, rang, <verse eid="DEU 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 2:18" />‘Henai nang Ar namdi, Moabme deurai kahgwang zie. <verse eid="DEU 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 2:19" />Nang Ammonme taiga mcwa gwang nna kecudau, penuide teikeherei so mede penuide ngngwa regi so; kedanemene Ih Ammonme deu kette nnuide nnui gu teikera peu lau ma; kedanemene Ih cide Lot leuhme de penui gu teikera peu dida.’” <verse eid="DEU 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 2:20" />(Cipau deude de Rephaim deu lie la. Pedwa Rephaime cika lungh da, dede Ammonme penuide Zamzummim lie qula, <verse eid="DEU 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 2:21" />penui kedi, kekiee, nah Anakimme hu ge nzwa. Dede RAMPAUBE penuide ngkapdi Ammonme dwagade, nah penui penuide ngamlu eh penui bam ga lunghdi. <verse eid="DEU 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 2:22" />Ainzwa RAMPAUBE teigai Esau minadung ziemne, Sier ga kelunghme dage de, pa Horitme de penui dwagade ngkapdi kecudau, nah Esau leuhme penuide ngamlu eh henai kecangde penui bam ga lungh bamdi. <verse eid="DEU 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 2:23" />Avvimme renam gade Gaza namdi kemdei ga kecang kelunghme de au, Caphtorme, Caphtor gade gwang kelame, penuide teingkapdi nah penui bam ga lunghdi.)<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Caphtorim nah Caphtor, aidungde de Philistinme lie rangla, Crete deu gade kegwangme. (Amo. 9:7 gade ngau lubui).</char></note><verse eid="DEU 2:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Heshbon gwangpei Sihon de ngamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 2:24" />“Cu cuhlu, tetpet cu, nah Arnon langkam de kahlu; pielo, Ih nnui ba gage Amoritme Sihon, Heshbon gwangpei, nah pe deu kai beu dida. Gumlu kera mtei cu, nah pecu ngngwa hereu gade regi cu. <verse eid="DEU 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 2:25" />Henai gade Ih tingkam pelane kangga mina kebam leune da nnuide ngngi nah hinglu kera teidi zieda; penui nnui ha siulu eh mbeu dizie nah keherei dizie nnui ziemne.”<verse eid="DEU 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 2:26" />Ih samgwamedung de Kedemoth hetaideu gade Sihon, Heshbon namceu gwangpei dage langgai, kezuyi samdung si eh, peu aide rang eh, <verse eid="DEU 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 2:27" />“Peu acu n deu kahgwang lo; Ih puidiki lebie tet dizie; Ih hile mede zetle de nreu lak. <verse eid="DEU 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 2:28" />Nnui pemi tei eh acu taktyei ketyei zwa beuzie, ciude Ih tyeilu kerane; pemi tei eh acu dui peuzie, cinzwa eh Ih saklu kerane; acu peu a pi le n deu kahgwang lo; <verse eid="DEU 2:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 2:29" />Sier ga kelungh Esau leuhme, nah Ar ga kelungh Moabme, a ziemne tei kebeu nzwa; Ih Jordan de kahpwa RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide peula kebam deu dega lütlu kemaktane.” <verse eid="DEU 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 2:30" />Dede Sihon, Heshbon gwangpei, peu anuide pe deu tetkah gwang ma; kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang pe lung tei takdi nah pe mlung tei hungdi, pa nnui kengkieng le pecu ngamlu kerane, pa henai teikegai nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 2:31" />RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Pielo, Ih Sihon nah pe deu nnui dwagade nnuide pwapeu lauda; keu kera mteilu, ciude nnui pe deu gumlu kerane.” <verse eid="DEU 2:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 2:32" />Pecai Sihon anuide ncaudi, pa nah pe reugwame pelane, Jahaz namceu ga regi kera pet. <verse eid="DEU 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 2:33" />RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang pecu pwa anui kang gage kaibeu eh anui pecu nah pe name nah pe minadung pelane de ngamlu. <verse eid="DEU 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 2:34" />Anui cidau pe namdidung pelane keulu nah namdi leune teingkap ciaudi, mipeimedung nah mipuimedung nah henamedung; anui migede de bangnzeu beuma. <verse eid="DEU 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 2:35" />Anui anui ziemne sütkelu hetum rünne gwale keuma, anui namdidung gade sütkelu madung si eh keulu. <verse eid="DEU 2:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 2:36" />Aroer gade, Arnon langkam tu ga kebamde, nah namdi langkam sum ga kebam gade, Gilead cuikui ga kecang, namdi ge de anui ziemne hu hamdi kecu gah. RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang penuide anui ba gage pwa peuda. <verse eid="DEU 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 2:37" />Nnui au Ammon leuhme deu ga rünne, Jabbok Reuki kung pelane de si eh, nah namdidung hangdeutu deudi ga kebam ga mie ma, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide mie helo kebeu leune ga.<verse eid="DEU 2:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="DEU 3" />
  <para style="s">Bashan gwangpei Og de ngamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 3:1" />Pecai anui nreulwe Bashan lambie nghang. Og, Bashan gwangpei, gwang eh anuide regidi, pa nah pe reugwame pelane, Edrei gade regi kerane. <verse eid="DEU 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 3:2" />RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Pecu hing so; kedanemene Ih pecu ngamlu kera ncu kengkieng peu dida nah pe minadung pelane nah pe deu n kengkieng kang gage kaibeu dida. Nang Sihon dage teikegai nzwa pe dage teigai zie, Amoritme gwangpei, Heshbon ga kelunghbe de dage teikegai nzwa.” <verse eid="DEU 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 3:3" />Cine RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang Bashan gwangpei Og de ngamlu kera anuide kengkieng peuda, nah pe minadung pelane de anui kang gage kai beuda. Anui pe minadung de teitset ciaudi kemaktane teidi. <verse eid="DEU 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 3:4" />Anui cidau pe namdidung pelane keulu cipauting ga. Namdidung riakherok ge kebam gade anui nam kette keu tadi kecu teima, Argob cuikui pelane, Bashan ga Og hegwangram. <verse eid="DEU 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 3:5" />Aidungde renei kwakelu namdidung pelane kiriedung husüt kecu, herieki kikamdung, nah hegeudung le teipwa kebam da; aide au renamdung kirie teikemak kekiee ge si mene. <verse eid="DEU 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 3:6" />Anui penuide ngkap ciaudi, anui Heshbon gwangpei Sihon dage teikegai nzwa, namdi pelane ngkap ciaudi, mipeidung nah mipuidung nah henamedung. <verse eid="DEU 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 3:7" />Dede hetum nah namdidung gade swet keludung pelane, anuikatei anui ziemne keulu swet keludung nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 3:8" />Cidau anui Amoritme gwangpei kena dade Jordan gwale kebamme deu de keulu, Arnon langkam gade Hermon Deutu ga kecang. <verse eid="DEU 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 3:9" />(Hermon Deutu de Sidonme Sirion lie qula, nah Amoritme Senir de qula) <verse eid="DEU 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 3:10" />nah langkie ga namdidung pelane, Gilead pelane, Bashan pelane, Salekah nah Edrei ga kecang, Bashan ga Og hegwangram gu namdidung pelane. <verse eid="DEU 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 3:11" />(Bang kebam Rephaime, Bashan gwangpei Og rünne dida. Pielo! Pe zeu au hegeu zeu ge. Rabbah ga bam meni, Ammon leuhme kelungh ga? Cide petie cubit hekui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit hekui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">4.1 metre.</char></note> nah pedi cubit mdai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:11 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Cubit mdai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1.8 metre.</char></note>, minadung mdetla kecunzwa gade.)<verse eid="DEU 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kideube kemzi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 3:12" />“Cidau aipau hangdeu anui keu kelude, Aroer dade, Arnon Langkam ga kebam gade, hangdeutu deudi Gilead pempie, nah pe namdidung, Ih Reubenme nah Gaditme de peudi. <verse eid="DEU 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 3:13" />Gilead deu kebangbe nah Bashan pelane, Og hegwangram, Ih Manasseh leuhme pempie gede peudi. (Argob cuikui pelane, nah Bashan pelane. Aide de Rephaime deu lie qula. <verse eid="DEU 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 3:14" />Jair, Manasseh leuhme ge, Argob cuikui pelane luulu Geshurme nah Maakathiteme deugumrai ga kecang. Pa cuikui de, Bashan de si eh, pekatei pezi gade qula, Havvoth Jair de, henai kecang.) <verse eid="DEU 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 3:15" />Ih Gilead Machir de peu dida. <verse eid="DEU 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 3:16" />Ih Reubenme nah Gaditme de Gilead gade Arnon langkam kecang deugumrai de peudi, langkam sum dene hedeu herai, nah Jabbok reuki ga kecang, Ammon leuhme de ngngwa herai kecuga. <verse eid="DEU 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 3:17" />Penui rai kedage cai Jordan Reuki langkam langkie de si, Kinnereth gade Arabah jaaidi (cide, Ketsai Jaaidi) gade petle Pisgah Deutu pi ga kecang.<verse eid="DEU 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 3:18" />Cidau Ih nnuide aja kai beuda, rang eh, “RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu gumlu kera hangdeu aide peuda; nnui, reugwame pelane, reunet teulwe kahgwang zie nnui sinamedung, Israelme dwa gade. <verse eid="DEU 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 3:19" />Dede nnui naudung, nnui namedung, nah nnui gu hetumdung (Ih cibam nnui hetum kekiee ge bam kecu), Ih nnuide kepeu nnui namdidung dega bamzie, <verse eid="DEU 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 3:20" />RAMPAUBE nnui sinamedung de mtak kera peu kemaktane, pa nnuide kepeu nzwa, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang penuide peu zielie kebam deu Jordan gwale kebamde gumlu kemaktane; pecai nnuide kepeube deu dega, nnui mina keheibede, nnui cailigwang luzie.”<verse eid="DEU 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moses de Jordan kahkecu kaamkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 3:21" />Cidau Ih Joshua de aja kai, rang eh, “N miak le pelane ngauda RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang aipau hegwangpei kena da teikegai; RAMPAUBE cinzwa nang kelüt hegwangram pelane dage teigai zie. <verse eid="DEU 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 3:22" />Nang penuide hing dilak, kedanemene RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang pane n ziemne regi beuzie.”<verse eid="DEU 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 3:23" />Cidau Ih RAMPAUBE dade kie sünne gai, <verse eid="DEU 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 3:24" />“O RAMPAUBO Tinggwang, nang n kilabe de miswakegah n kedi nah n kengking lia kecu bangdwa dwa bam dida; nang teikegai batadung kenzwa de teilu kebui tinggim mede kideu ga hera keda ge da bam no, nah miswakega batadung de gapte? <verse eid="DEU 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 3:25" />Peu acu cide kahlo eh, Ih n dade kiela, nah hangdeu keyi Jordan gwale de peu ngaulo, cipau hangdeutu deudi keyi de, nah Lebanon de si eh.” <verse eid="DEU 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 3:26" />Dede RAMPAUBE acu pe rata di nziemne; pa a kwa kingnei tadi. RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Peu aide n ziemne mtak dilu, aipau ha de a dage rangdai tadi: <verse eid="DEU 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 3:27" />Pisgah twang ga nghang cuh delwe naimiak kenlütle, tingpeule, tingbangle, nah naimiak kepetle piegai lu n miak le; n miak le pie gailu, kedanemene nang Jordan kahpet laklu. <verse eid="DEU 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 3:28" />Meliene, Joshua de ma ranglia nah teingkuu nah pecu teingkieng beulu, kedanemene pa mina dungde teuswa eh ngngwa kahpet zielu, nah nang kengau deu de peu penuide gum kera pa tei zielu.” <verse eid="DEU 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 3:29" />Cine anui Beth Peor langkam kencwa ga bamdi.<verse eid="DEU 3:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="DEU 4" />
  <para style="s">Samzai Ketei Aja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 4:1" />Cu, Israel, Ih nnuide hezaidung nah zaisiedung ledeu beulai eh kebam cidungde teilu kerane, kingnei lu; ciude nnui ring luzie nah lütlwe RAMPAUBE, nnui paume Tinggwang, nnuide peulai eh kebam deu de gum luzie. <verse eid="DEU 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 4:2" />Ih nnuide aja kaikebeu samdungde ga kaisi delak, mede nnui cidungde keugidi delak, ciude nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ajadung Ih nnui dage aja kaibeu lai eh kebamde mzailu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:18">Keu. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 4:3" />RAMPAUBE Baal Peor ziemne daipai teigai bi nnui miak le ngauda; kedanemene mina pelane Baal Peor caisui kedime de, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui kakgade teingkap dida. <verse eid="DEU 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 4:4" />Dede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang da samsang la kecume au henai de ringbam, nnui pelane de. <verse eid="DEU 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 4:5" />Pielo, Ih hezaidung nah zaisiedung nnuide ledeu beu dida, RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang acu aja kaikebeu nzwa, cide nnui gum lai eh nnui lüt kela deu gade mzailu kera. <verse eid="DEU 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 4:6" />Ciziemne cidungde teimzai jüja lu; kedanemene hezai aidungde pelane siukelu minadung dwagade aide nnui gu maci nah nnui kecikecet zie nah penui rangzie, ‘Kesangda aipau heleuh kedi de au maci nah kecikecet medung da.’ <verse eid="DEU 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 4:7" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang keheidaude anui pecu qu kegaidau nzwa, heleuh kedi keda da daipai tinggwang penuide nnasüt kecuge bamno?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 3:2">Rom. 3:2</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 4:8" />Daipai heleuh kedi keda masangsüt kecu hezaidung nah zaisiedung tei pwa bamno nnui dwa gage Ih henai hezai aidung pelane kaibeu kecudungde nzwa?<verse eid="DEU 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 4:9" />Mriaklu nah nnuikatei nnuide regum sünne lalu, iciu eh nnui miak le ngaukelu dungde nnui nsungtadi melu kerane, iciu eh cidungde nnui teilung kebam tane nnui mlung gade mpetdi melu kerane. Meliene, nnui namedung nah nnui tsamedung dage cidungde peu cilu. <verse eid="DEU 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 4:10" />Nnui Horeb ga RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwaga kesap benai, RAMPAUBE a dage kerangdau, “Minadungde a ziemne qu hekwalu beulo, nah Ih penuide peu a samdung siu zie, ciude penui kideu ga kelungh tane acu hing eh lungh kera peu cilu kerane, nah cide penui penui namedung de ledeu beulu kerane.” <verse eid="DEU 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 4:11" />Nnui lüt nna eh lamlwatu pi ga sapdi. Lamlwatu cika mi heu eh tinggim ga heucuh bam, hemwa de tiak, nah muiting eh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:18">Heb. 12:18</ref>,<ref loc="HEB 12:19">19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 4:12" />RAMPAUBE mi gade nnui dage rang; nnui pe kwa pe samdung de si eh siu da, dede nnui pe rehi ngau ma; nnui pe kwa rünne siu. <verse eid="DEU 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 4:13" />Pa nnuide teimzai lulo aja kaikebeu pe samkak kelude nnuida rang beuda, ajadung kerei de. Pa cide tangtsukwak kena gage raubeu. <verse eid="DEU 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 4:14" />RAMPAUBE cidau a dage nnuide hezaidung nah zaisiedung ledeu beulo aja kai beuda, ciude nnui kahpetlwe gum lai eh kebam deu de gade tei mzailu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mamie kereca kekaam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 4:15" />Cine mriak eh cisiaktelu nnuikatei ziemne, kedanemene nnui marehi gede ngau ma RAMPAUBE nnui dage mi gade Horeb gade marang kecudau,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 1:23">Rom. 1:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 4:16" />ciu eh nnui nnuikatei de tei mmaudi melu kerane mamie tei eh nah marehi gage, mipei nah mipui kenzwa gage, <verse eid="DEU 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 4:17" />makaune gede kideu ga kebam kenzwa gage, nruine pe hesiu pung eh tinggim ga limkela keheibe kenzwa gage, <verse eid="DEU 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 4:18" />hangdeu ga bwa kela kaune keheibe kenzwa gage, mede kideu ga heka dui ga kebam keheibe kenzwa gage tei eh. <verse eid="DEU 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 4:19" />Nnui tinggim ga ngang cuh eh tingnaimiak, hekei, mede hegidung de pie lak, tinggim ga kebam pelane, iciu eh nnuide kemeu teu eh penuide reca nah herüt peu ladi melu kerane, cidungde RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ting kangga lung kebam mina pelane de mzi eh peu dida. <verse eid="DEU 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 4:20" />Dede RAMPAUBE nnuide kelilu eh hegeu heukebam gade nnuide ngngwa mpet beuda, Egypt gade, nnuide pe minadung tei kerane, henai gade nnui pegu teikedi nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 4:21" />RAMPAUBE acu pe rata di nnui ziemne; pa deiga eh rangdi acu peu Jordan kahpet laklie kecu, nah hangdeu keyi, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum kera peulai eh kebam deu dega peu acu lütlak lie di. <verse eid="DEU 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 4:22" />Meliene, Ih hangdeu aika de tsai bizie; Ih Jordan kahpet tadi bi maisia da; dede nnui kahpet zie nah cipau hangdeu keyi de gum luzie. <verse eid="DEU 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 4:23" />Cisiakte lu nnuikatei nnui ziemne, ciude nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang samkak kelude nsungtadi melu kerane, pa nnuide ngngwa samkakkelu de, nah nnuikatei nnui ziemne mamie gede tei eh marehi keheibe de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kaam kedi de teiso. <verse eid="DEU 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 4:24" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang au tei ngkapdi kela miheu ge, periak ketei Tinggwang gelie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Heb. 12:29</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 4:25" />Nnui nnui namedung nah nnui tsamedung lungh dide, nnui hangdeube ga lungh kedi ketiege di liede, nah magade nnuikatei nnuide tei mmau nah mamie ma rehi gede teicai, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade kemau tei, pe rata teicai, <verse eid="DEU 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 4:26" />Ih henai tinggim nah kideu de nnuide kemmau zierang lie qula nah matie mene nnui Jordan kahpet gumlai kebam deu gade gah dizie; nnui kelungh ting cika tielak, dede nnuide ngkap ciau dizie. <verse eid="DEU 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 4:27" />RAMPAUBE nnuide minadung kakgage teizang dizie, nah nnui heleuh kakgade mina kecam nage dizie, RAMPAUBE nnuide teuzang kegai ga. <verse eid="DEU 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 4:28" />Cika nnui keda rabedung ta teizie, mina badung tei keludung, tsing nah tangtsu, mangau liede, masiu, matyei, mede manghui gai kelakdung. <verse eid="DEU 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 4:29" />Dede cikade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de peei zie, nah nnui pecu ngau luzie, nnui nnui mlung nah nnui rabe pekiene le pwa pecu peei kecudau. <verse eid="DEU 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 4:30" />Nnui kengngi ga la kedidau, nah ma aidung pelane nnuida gwang kecudau, pecai nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang da cailigwang eh pe kwa kingnei luzie. <verse eid="DEU 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 4:31" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang au mide ngaunggia kela Tinggwang; pa nnuide gi dilak mede nnuide ngkap dilak, mede pa nnui paume de sampet kebeu samkak kelude nsungta dilak.<verse eid="DEU 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube au Tinggwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 4:32" />Cu gwangkedi lebie ha keteu lulo, nnuide mna kemakdwa, Tinggwang kideureu gage mina de damkegai ting de, tinggim tu ge lamde keda tu de keteu lulo, aikenzwa lang ge magede bam mi gah bi kecu, mede aikenzwabe siu mi siu mebi kecu? <verse eid="DEU 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 4:33" />Madaugede minadung mi gade Tinggwang marang kegai, nnui siu kecunzwa, siulu eh ringlu dini? <verse eid="DEU 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 4:34" />Mede Tinggwang mie delwe heleuh gede heleuh keda kakgade keupwa pegu kera madaugede teini, kehedeidung, marehidung, nah mimakecangh batadung, nah hereu, nah kengkieng ba, nah nzang kepet ba, nah ngau kehingdung ne, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang Egypt ga nnui miakdwa gade nnui ziemne teikegai pekiene nzwa? <verse eid="DEU 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 4:35" />Nnuide ma aidungde liada, ciude nnui RAMPAUBE au Tinggwang kecu cilu kerane, nah pa gwale mi kedage de gah lie kecu. <verse eid="DEU 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 4:36" />Pa tinggim gade peu nnuide pe kwa siu kera teigai, ciu eh pa nnuide ledeu beulu kerane; kideu ga pa pe mi kedide peu nnuide ngauda; nnui mi gade pe samdung siuda. <verse eid="DEU 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 4:37" />Kedanemene pa nnui paume de keku ne, pa penuicai penui leuhme de kedetlu, nah pa kebam nnuide Egypt gade ngngwa mpetlu, pe kengkieng kedi le; <verse eid="DEU 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 4:38" />heleuh diki nah nnui swa ngkieng kecudung de nnui dwagade gwa mpetdi kerane, nnuide ngngwa lütlwe, henai gade penui deu nnuide gum kera peulu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 4:39" />Cine henai tingba gade cilu, nah nnui mlung gage kailu, RAMPAUBE au tinggim nreule nah ngkangle kideu gu Tinggwang lie kecu; mi keda gede gah. <verse eid="DEU 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 4:40" />Nnui pe zaidung nah pe ajadung Ih nnuide henai aja kaikebeu dungde mzailu, ciude nnui nah nnui cai nnui leuhme yilu kerane, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kelungta nnui gu tei kera kepeu deu de ga lungh tielu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemsiu namdidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 4:41" />Pecai Moses Jordan naimiak kepetle tu namdi kecum kedetlu, <verse eid="DEU 4:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 4:42" />ciude cipau nam ket ga keheibede nsiulu kerane magade pa teimaudi eh mi kedame, pe ngauraume kemakme de teitset dicai. Namdi aidungde ket gage pakgai lucai, pa ring de lubui. <verse eid="DEU 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 4:43" />Cidungde cai: hetaideu ga kebam Bezer, langkie deudi de, Reubenme ziemne; Ramoth Gilead deu ga, Gad leuhme ziemne; nah Golan Bashan deu ga, Manasseh leuhme ziemne.<verse eid="DEU 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezai ziemne mraisam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 4:44" />Aide Moses hezaidung Israelme dwa gage kaikebeu deda; <verse eid="DEU 4:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 4:45" />aidungde samkakkelu zaisiedung, hezaidung, nah keda zaidung pa Israelme penui Egypt gade kempet dau penui dage rang kecude da, <verse eid="DEU 4:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 4:46" />penui Jordan naimiak kepetle ga kebamdau, Beth Peor de kemcwa langkam ga, Sihon deu ga, Amorme gwangpei, Heshbon ga kelunghbe, Moses nah Israelme penui Egypt gade mpet keladau pecu ngamlu. <verse eid="DEU 4:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 4:47" />Penui pe deu gumkera keu pwadi, nah Bashan gwangpei Og deu de, aidungde, Amoritme gwangpei kena, Jordan gwale naimiak kepetle ga kebam. <verse eid="DEU 4:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 4:48" />Deugumrai aide Aroer gade gwang, Arnon langkam tu ga kebam gade, Siyon Deutu (mede Hermon Deutu) kecang, <verse eid="DEU 4:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 4:49" />nah Jordan Reuki langkam gu langkie pelane de si eh, Jordan kahpet eh naimiak kepetle, Arabah Jaaidi ga, Pisgah Deutu pi ga kecang.<verse eid="DEU 4:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="DEU 5" />
  <para style="s">Hezai kereidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 5:1" />Moses Israelme pelane de qu hekwalu delwe penui dage rangdi, “Kingnei lulo, Israel, hezaidung nah ajadung Ih nnui kwen gage henai ranggai kerade, nnuide peu cide cilu nah cidungde kainzeulu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 5:2" />Horeb gade RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang anuide samkakkelu ge teilu. <verse eid="DEU 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 5:3" />RAMPAUBE samting samkak aide anui paume de ngngwa teima, dede anuide, nah anui peciakne henai ringkebamme ngngwa teilu. <verse eid="DEU 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 5:4" />Kideutu gade mi sum gade RAMPAUBE nnuide kezungau eh resiu<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:38">Bat. 7:38</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 5:5" />(Ih cidau RAMPAUBE nah nnui kakga saplu, nnui dage pe sam paubeu kerane; kedanemene nnui miheu ziemne ngngi eh bam, nah nnui lamlwa ga nghang ma). RAMPAUBE rangdi,<verse eid="DEU 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 5:6" />‘Ih au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, Egyptme deu gade hebaang teikebam gade, nnuide ngngwa kempetbe.<verse eid="DEU 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 5:7" />Nnui a dwagade hera keda de bamlak.<verse eid="DEU 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 5:8" />Nnuikatei nnui ziemne magede hebale teikelu mie teilak, mede tinggim kehu ga kebam kenzwadung, mede kideu kangga kebamdung nzwa, mede dui kangga kebamdung. <verse eid="DEU 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 5:9" />Nnui penuida keumie lak mede penui gwa teilak, kedanemene Ih, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, periak ketei Tinggwang. Ih paupai zaisiet de saja peula pe name da saja punggwang eh, ceheu kecum nah mdai da acu ngaurau kelame da, <verse eid="DEU 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 5:10" />nah samkakkelu samsang de pecang dage, acu hung kelame da nah ajadung mzai kelame da liagai.<verse eid="DEU 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 5:11" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang zi kemta gade keulak, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe zi kemta gade keu kelame de au mau melie delak.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat. 5:33</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 5:12" />Sabbath tingba de mneilu eh cide teimci lu, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide rang kebeu nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 2:27">Mrk. 2:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 5:13" />Tingbazie lang herokne ge nnui nri eh nnui ta leune teilu;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 13:14">Luk. 13:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 5:14" />dede lang henane benai au Sabbath RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne. Cipaunai nnui mata gede teilak, nang de, mede n napei de, mede n napui de, mede nnui kilame mipei, mede nnui kilame mipui, mede nnui tumseu, mede nnui gada, mede nnui kauhau keheibedung, mede sangme nnui kiriedung ga kebamdung. Aide pekie nnui kilame mipei nah nnui kilame mipui mtaklu kerane nang de si eh. <verse eid="DEU 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 5:15" />Nnui Egyptme deu ga kilame ge teigwang kecu nsung luzie, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang cikade heba kengkieng le nnuide ngngwampet beu nah heba nzangpet pwa. Cine RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui dage Sabbath tingba mnei kera sam kaibeu.<verse eid="DEU 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 5:16" />Nnui pei nah nnui pui de herüt peulu, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide aja kai kebeunzwa, iciu eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peulai kebam deu dega nnui peting ketie ge lungh lu kerane, nah iciu eh nnui ziemne yi luzie.<verse eid="DEU 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 5:17" />Nnui mide daptset so.<verse eid="DEU 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 5:18" />Nnui kemmha ta teiso.<verse eid="DEU 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 5:19" />Nnui rega so.<verse eid="DEU 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 5:20" />Nnui kemret zierang tei eh n kidabe de mmau so.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 18:20">Luk. 18:20</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 5:21" />Nnui n kidabe nau de hengin so, nnui n kidabe ki hengin so, pe luh, mede pe kila pei, mede pe kila pui, pe tumseu, mede pe gada, mede n kidabe gu mabam maheidung pelane.’<verse eid="DEU 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 5:22" />Sam aidungde RAMPAUBE pe kwa sahbak eh ranggai n ngkwa kebam pelane dage lamlwa gade miheu sum gwalede, hemwa ga, nah muiting kecu gade; pa samdung kette kaisi ma. Pa cidungde tangtsu kwak kena gage raulu nah acu cide peu. <verse eid="DEU 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 5:23" />Aide aiciu gwang, nnui makwa cide muiting kecu sum gade siu kecudau, lamlwa heu kebamdau, nnui hangkiamedung peciakne nah nnui heleuhdung peu keteume, nnui a taiga nna gwang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:19">Heb. 12:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 5:24" />Nnui rangdi, “Pielu, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang pe kemdu nah pe kedi anuide keulia da, nah anui pekwa siu luda miheu sum gade; anui henai ngauda Tinggwang minade resiu kecudau, penui ringlu kera.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 19:19">Tet. 19:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 5:25" />Dede daiziemne anui tsai zieno? Kedanemene miheu kedi aide anuide mnwa dizie; magade anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang kwa siu tie dicai, anui tsai si dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:19">Heb. 12:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 5:26" />Kedanemene caugamme anui kakga pumteih pung eh bam no ringkela Tinggwang miheu sum gade sam rang kepet siulu eh ring luno, anui tei kelunzwa?<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:33">Hez. 4:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 5:27" />Nziemne au, nang mie delwe kingnei lulo ma pelane RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang rang kecu; anui dage rangdai gailo maleune RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang n dage rang kecudung; anui cide kingnei zie nah cide mzai zie.”<verse eid="DEU 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 5:28" />RAMPAUBE n samdung kingnei luda nang a dage ranggai kecudau. Pa a dage rangdi, ‘Ih mina aidungde sam siu luda, penui n dage dai ranggai bi kecu. Penui kerang dungde petau. <verse eid="DEU 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 5:29" />Oh, penuida cikenzwa mlung penuida bam kecu, iciu eh penui acu rüt mui nah a sam pelane mzai lucai, kelungta ainzwa penui ziemne de nah penui namedung ziemne de yilu kerane! <verse eid="DEU 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 5:30" />Mie penuida ranglo, “Nnui paikidung ga cailigwang dailu.” <verse eid="DEU 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 5:31" />Dede nziemne au, a taiga saplu, nah Ih ncu ajadung pelane ranglia zie, hezaidung, nah teimai kesiadung nang penuide ledeu kera, iciu eh penuide Ih peu kera nah penui gumlu kera deu ga penui cidungde kainzeulu kerane.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GAL 3:19">Gal. 3:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 5:32" />Ciziemne, nnui kainzeu luzie, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide teilo kebeube; nnui zetle ba gade mede hile de cide keu keli dilak. <verse eid="DEU 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 5:33" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide rang kebeu leune lampui ga tetzie, iciu lucai nnui ring luzie, iciu eh n ziemne yi luzie, nah nnui gumlu kera deu dega nnui nnui kelungh ting tie luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:6">Luk. 1:6</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="DEU 6" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube n Tinggwang de kulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 6:1" />Cu aidungde ajadung da, hezaidung, nah teimai kesiadung RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide ledeu kerane acu rangkebeu, iciude nnui cidungde kainzeulu kerane hangdeu nnui Jordan tetkahgwang gum kera dega; <verse eid="DEU 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 6:2" />iciude nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de herüt peulu kerane, iciu eh pegu hezaidung nah ajadung pelane Ih nnui dage rang kebeu kainzeulu kera, nang, n napeime, nah n napei name, nnui kelunghta, iciude n tingbaziedung tielu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 6:3" />Ciziemne penui sam kingnei lulo, Israelmedung, nah cidungde kainzeulu, iciude cide nnui ziemne yi luzie, ciu eh nnui lungh hingsüt luzie, tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu ga<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu ga: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mahei nah ma lungh yisüt kecu deudi.</char></note>, RAMPAUBE, nnui peime Tinggwang, nnuide teibeu zielie pe sam kai kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 6:4" />Kingneilu, Israel: RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang au ket.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:29-33">Mrk. 12:29-33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 6:5" />Nnui Rampaube nnui Tinggwang de hung zie nnui mlung pekiene teu, nnui keringria pekiene teu, nah nnui kengkieng pekiene teu eh. <verse eid="DEU 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 6:6" />Samdung Ih henai nnuida kai kegaide nnui mlung ga lazie; <verse eid="DEU 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 6:7" />nah cide nnui lung kai eh nnui name de ledeu zie; nnui cide ha rangzie nnui nnui kiga ntum kebam daude, nnui lampui kiga tetkela daude, nnui zeu kebam daude, nah nnui cuh kecu daude.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Eph. 6:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 6:8" />Nnui cide kang luzie marehi ge nzwa nnui ba gage, nah cide nnui miak kakga hezu keyi nia nzwa kai luzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:5">Mat. 23:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 6:9" />Nnui cide nnui ki ga kikam hetsiadung gage nah nnui kirieki gage rauzie.<verse eid="DEU 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 6:10" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide hangdeu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:10 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hangdeu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Canaan deudi.</char></note> ga nggwa gwang keludau pa nnui peime dage, Abraham, Isaac nah Jacob da, pa nnuide pwapeu zielie eh pe sampet kelude, nang ne teilu kemakbe namdidung di nah yisüt kecudung, <verse eid="DEU 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 6:11" />nah kidung cika makeyi leune le puidi eh nnuine teilu kemakbe, tekwa nnuine kuilu kemakbe, kubetsi luh nah olive bangdung nnui ne linglu kemakdung, nnui cide tyeizie nah mnung luzie, <verse eid="DEU 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 6:12" />pecai sünne lu iciu eh nnui RAMPAUBE de nsungtadi kelakne, nnuide Egyptme deu gade ngngwampet kebeube, hebaang ketei ki gade. <verse eid="DEU 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 6:13" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de herüt peuzie; nnui pecu reca zie, nah nnui pe zi teu sampet teizie. <verse eid="DEU 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 6:14" />Nnui hera keda caisui lak, minadung nnui tai lungh pui kebamme gu rabedung,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mina rabedung aide caige rabedung Canaanme, Moabme, Edomme, nah keda mina maadung ne reca kela rabedung.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 6:15" />kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui kakga kebamde au periak ketei Tinggwang, magade nnui teicai, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang rata de nnuida heupet zie nah pa nnuide kideube reu gade ngkap dizie.<verse eid="DEU 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 6:16" />Nnui Massah gade pecu kedei kecunzwa nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de kedei lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 17:1-7</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 6:17" />Nnui lung nrisüt eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ajadung kainzeu zie, kemlang pe ajadung, nah pe zaidung, pa nnuide teilo kebeudung. <verse eid="DEU 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 6:18" />Nnui dai petaubi kecube teizie nah RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade keyibe, ciude cide nnui ziemne yi luzie, nah cinzwa eh nnui lüt luzie nah hangdeu keyi RAMPAUBE nnui peime da sampet kebeude gum luzie, <verse eid="DEU 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 6:19" />nnui ngauraume de nnui dwagade gwagi dilu kerane, RAMPAUBE rangkebeu nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 6:20" />N napei nnuide keteu kecu ting ge gwang kecudau, rang eh, “Samting samkakkelu hezaidung, hezai rau keludung, nah RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang nnuide rang kebeudung keda zaidung daidung deno?”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 6:4">Eph. 6:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 6:21" />cidau nnui napei dage nnui rangzie, “Anui au Egypt ga Pharaoh kilame ge tei; RAMPAUBE ne anuide Egypt gade kengkieng bale ngngwa mpet beu, <verse eid="DEU 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 6:22" />nah pa marengei nah mimakecang batadung, kedige nah ngaukehing, Egyptme dage, Pharaoh<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pharaoh: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Egyptme Gwangpei.</char></note> dage, nah pe kilungme pelane dage, anui miakdwa gade keulia; <verse eid="DEU 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 6:23" />nah pa cikade anuide ngngwampet beu, iciu eh pa anuide ngngwa nlütlu kerane, hangdeu anuide peu kera pa anui peime da sampet kebeude. <verse eid="DEU 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 6:24" />RAMPAUBE anuide hezai aidung pelane mzai lamui lulo aja kai, RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang de hing lulo anui ziuyi ziemne, iciude pa anuide peu ring bamlu kerane, pa henai kecang anuida tei kebam nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 6:25" />Magade anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dwade aja aidung pelane kainzeu lucai, pa pe sam anuide kaikebeu nzwa, anui masang kecume ge dizie.”<verse eid="DEU 6:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="DEU 7" />
  <para style="s">Heleuh dungde gwakempet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 7:1" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui mie gumlai eh kebam deu de gage nnuide ngngwa gwang kebeudau, pa heleuhdung kekieege de nnui dwagade gwagi dizie, Hittitme, Girgashitme, Amoritme, Canaanme, Perizzitme, Hivitme, nah Jebusitme, heleuhdung kedi hena nnui swade ngkiengki and diki kecudung.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 13:19">Bat. 13:19</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 7:2" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne penuide nnui kang gage kaibeu nah nnui penuide ngam keludau, nnui penuide teingkap ciaudi maisia. Nnui penuide ngngwa samting samkakkelu teilak, nah penuide ngaugia gede keulia lak. <verse eid="DEU 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 7:3" />Pecaide nnui penuide ngngwa kelak ketei kette teilak. Nnui nnui napuidung de penui napeidung de pwapeu lak, nah nnui penui napuidungde de nnui napeidung ziemne keulak. <verse eid="DEU 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 7:4" />Kedanemene a caisui kecu gade penui nnui napei dungde teunreu dizie, ciu eh penui hera keda de recadi kera. Cine RAMPAUBE nnuida pe rata heupet zie, nah pa nnuide teingkap zette dizie. <verse eid="DEU 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 7:5" />Ainzwa eh nnui penuide tei beulu maisia: Nnui penui racabamdung de teukau dizie, penui tangtsu tsiadung de teipang dizie, penui Asherah rabepui miedung bi ngkau dizie, nah penui rabe miedung ru dizi.<verse eid="DEU 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 7:6" />Kedanemene nnui au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne keuntsam kelu heleuh ge. Kedamedung kideu reu lung kebamme kakga swade, pa nnuide peu pe minadung pegu teilu kerane kedetlu. <verse eid="DEU 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 7:7" />RAMPAUBE au pe keku de nnui reu gage kai ma mede nnui mi kedame swade kieeki kecune nnuide kedet ma, kedanemene nnui minadung kakgade camtu kecume ziemne, <verse eid="DEU 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 7:8" />dede pa nnuide keku ziemne, nah pa reset de nnui paume dage pa sampet kebeude teicang neula. Aide ziemne RAMPAUBE pe ba kengkieng le nnuide ngngwampet beu nah Egyptme gwangpei Pharaoh ba gade, hebaang teikela ki gade nnuide kelilu. <verse eid="DEU 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 7:9" />Ciziemne cilu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, pa au Tinggwang lie kecu, kesamsang Tinggwang, pa samkakkelu nah samsang ceheu pecangdung ziemne pe sam mzai kelame nah pecu hung kelame da kainzeu la, <verse eid="DEU 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 7:10" />dede pecu ngaurau kecume de saja peula, penuide ngkapdi kerane; pa pecu ngaurau kecume de pe zai keyi lia lak; pa penui dage saja peuzie. <verse eid="DEU 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 7:11" />Nnui cine pe samdung kainzeu lu, hezaidung, nah ajadung Ih n dage henai kai kebeude, iciu eh nnui cide teilu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 7:12" />Magade nnui ajadung de kingnei, nah kainzeu nah cidungde tei lucai, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui paume da samkakkelu nah pa pe samsang sampet kebeude nnui dage kaipwa teicang beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 7:13" />Pa nnuide ku zie, nnuide samlam beuzie, nah nnuide teingkiee beuzie; pa n pum gade lungh kegwang tsi nah n deu gade lungh kegwang tsi, n mei, n zau keheci, nah ngu maca, n kauhaudung nah n hetumnadung kekiee ge peu eh, pa nnuide peuzie lie eh n paume dage pe sampet teikelu deu gade nnuide samlam beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 7:14" />Nnuide mi kedame swade samlam kiee beuzie; mipei pe na kegah bamlak mede nnui kakga mipui pe na lunghgai kelak bamlak mede nnui kauhaudung kakgade. <verse eid="DEU 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 7:15" />RAMPAUBE n dade keteei keneei pelane keunzia dizie; Egypt gade rapia kesia nnui ci kebamde pa magede nnui reuga kailak, dede pa nnuide ngau keraume dage cidungde kai beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 7:16" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuida pwapeu kecume leune de nnui ngkap dizie, nah nnui miak gade penuide kenggia dau gailak. Nnui penui rabedung de reca lak, kedanemene cide nnui ziemne hetak ge zie.<verse eid="DEU 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 7:17" />Magade nnui mlung gade nnui, ‘Heleuh aidungde a swa digwa; dainzwa Ih penuide gwagi lulai?’ de eh rangcai, <verse eid="DEU 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 7:18" />penuide hing so; nnui nsung lulo RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang Pharaoh nah Egyptme pelane dage tei kegaidung; <verse eid="DEU 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 7:19" />kehereisüt kedi nnui miak gade ngau da, marengeidung, mimakecang batadung, kengkieng ba, nah RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang ba nzangpet eh nnuide ngngwampet kebeube de. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui hing kelame mina pelane dage cide nzwa teigai zie. <verse eid="DEU 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 7:20" />Cipau reude, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang tangkuidung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tangkuidung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mateei.</char></note> penui kakgage langgai zie, bang eh kebamme de nah nnui dade mbai kelame de nnui dwagade ngkapdi kemaktane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:20 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:28, Jos. 24:12</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 7:21" />Nnui penuide hing lak, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui kakga lalu, di nah hinglu kebui Tinggwang ge. <verse eid="DEU 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 7:22" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui dwa gade heleuhdung miet miet eh gwa dizie. Nnui piage gage penuide ngamdi gailak, mecai renaam kaunedung nnui taiga kieesüt dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:29-30</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 7:23" />Dede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui penuide hereu ga redau kecudau nnuide penui reu kengkieng pwapeu zie; pa penuide teimang dizie penui de teingkapdi kemaktane. <verse eid="DEU 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 7:24" />Pa penui hegwangme de nnui kengkieng kang gage kai dizie, nah nnui penui zi tinggim kang gade teinggah dizie. Migede nnui dwa sap gailak, nnui penuide teingkap cangdi kemaktane. <verse eid="DEU 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 7:25" />Nnui penui rabe miedung ru dizie, penui gu hengin so rangkanggeu mede kecak penuide gum kelabe nah nnuikatei ziemne keuso, kedanemene nnui cinzwacai, nnuide cide ne kang luzie, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne cide kengkau ta ge lu. <verse eid="DEU 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 7:26" />Nnui kengkau gede nnui kidung ga pung gwanglak nah reca teicuh dilak. Nnui cidungde ngaurau eh keugi dizie, kedanemene cide au kengkap ziemne teutsam pwa bam lu.<verse eid="DEU 7:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="DEU 8" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube de nsungta diso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 8:1" />Ih henai nnuide peu kebam ajadung pelane kainzeu lu, iciude nnui ring luzie nah hingpet luzie, nah lüt luzie nah nnui peime dage RAMPAUBE sampet kebeu hangdeu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:1 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hangdeu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Canaan deudi</char></note> de gum luzie. <verse eid="DEU 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 8:2" />Nnui nsung luzie RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide hetaideu gade mmi riakdai aidungde nnuide teuswa la kecu, pa nnuide peu henah mielu kerane, iciu eh pa nnuide kedakpie kerane nnui lung ga dai labi kecu cilu kerane, nnui pe sam kainzeu ziemi lakbi kecu. <verse eid="DEU 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 8:3" />Pa nnuide teihenah beu, nah nnuide tei nzeu gai, nah manna le nnui pok teibeu,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 16, Pum. 11:7-8</char></note> cide nnui nah nnui peime daibi kecu cima. Pa cide tei kegaide au peu nnuide mina tangku rünne teu eh lungh gailak kecude cilu kerane; dede, RAMPAUBE mui gade kepet leune gade mina ring lubui.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 4:4, Luk. 4:4, 1 Cor. 10:3</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 8:4" />Mmi riakdai cidau ting dega nnui paini hegwa dima nah nnui dade nghai dima, nah nnui pi mma dima. <verse eid="DEU 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 8:5" />Nnui nnui mlung gage kai luzie, dainzwa, mige pe na de ledeu labi kecunzwa, cinzwa RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide ledeu lala.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:7">Heb. 12:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 8:6" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ajadung mzai zie, iciu eh nnui pe lampui ga tetlu kerane nah pecu herüt peuzie. <verse eid="DEU 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 8:7" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide hangdeu keyi gage ngngwa gwangla, dui lwa kebam hangdeu, duirwakdung nah duilet, langkamdung nah hangdeutudung kakga lwagai kebam gage; <verse eid="DEU 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 8:8" />hangdeu wheat nah barley kebam, kubetsi bangdung, tangzüttsi bangdung, nah kuraletsidung; olive bangdung nah heliadui deudung. <verse eid="DEU 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 8:9" />Cipau deu dega nnui tangku tyei kedui tei dilak, nah nnui cika magede dui di kecu tei dilak; hangdeu aika tangtsudung hegeu le teikelube, nah hangdeutu cikade nnui copper geu kuimpet lubui. <verse eid="DEU 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 8:10" />Nnui matyei zie nah nggei luzie, nnuide hangdeu keyi peu kebeude ziemne nnui RAMPAUBE, nnui Tinggwang de samlam beuzie.<verse eid="DEU 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 8:11" />Pe ajadung nah pa tei lulo kebeudung, nah pe zaidung Ih nnui dage henai rangkebam dungde teilu tadi eh, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nsungtadi kera gade mriaklu. <verse eid="DEU 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 8:12" />Iciu mecai, nnui tyeilu eh pui kebamdau, nah nnui ki keyi teilu nah cika lungh kecudau, nnui mlung di dizie. <verse eid="DEU 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 8:13" />Mriaklulo nnui kaunehaudung nah kauruine hingpet keludau nah nnui rangkanggeu nah kecak kiee reureu keludau, nah nnuida kebamdung hingpet lude, <verse eid="DEU 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 8:14" />cidau nnui mlung ngang dila nah nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nsungta di, Egyptme deu gade nnuide ngngwampet kebeube de, hebaang ketei ki gade. <verse eid="DEU 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 8:15" />Pecu nsungta diso hetaideu kedi nah kengngi gade nnuide nzang gwang kebeube de, henei kerabedung nah heruingapuidung kebam gade nah hangdeu cangh eh dui de kegah gade, tsura gade nnuide dui punggwang kebeube de.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 20:2-13</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 8:16" />Pa hetaideu gade nnui paume madaude cikemakbe manna le nnui pok teibeu, iciu eh pa nnuide tei henah nah nnuide kedeilu kerane, nnuide kekamle keyibe tei beulu kerane, <verse eid="DEU 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 8:17" />dede nnui mlung ga nnui rang lubui bam, ‘A kengkieng nah a pumci le mabam aidung pelane teilu.’ <verse eid="DEU 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 8:18" />Dede nnui nsungla lu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de, kedanemene pa ne nnuide mahei ngaulu kera kengkieng peu; iciu eh pa samkakkelu de tei canglu kerane pa nnui peime dage sampet kebeude, henai nzwa kelade nzwa eh. <verse eid="DEU 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 8:19" />Ainzwa gwang zie, magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nsung tadi eh nah hera keda caisui, penuide reca, nah penuide herüt peu dicai, Ih nnui dage henai a sam pet gaila nnui kap eh gah dizie. <verse eid="DEU 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 8:20" />RAMPAUBE nnui dwade heleuhdung de ngkapdi kebam nzwa, cinzwa nnuide de ngkap dizie, kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingneilu melu.<verse eid="DEU 8:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="DEU 9" />
  <para style="s">Israel masang ziemne ma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 9:1" />Kingneilu, Israel; henai nnui Jordan reu de kah lauda, nnui swa diki nah ngkingki kecu heleuhdung de ngkapdi kerane, nah namdi kedidung nah tinggim ga kecang tsukwa kwa keludungde de, <verse eid="DEU 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 9:2" />minadung di nah tie, Anakim napeidung, nang ci kebamme, nah minadung rangkela nang siu, ‘Cau Anak napeime dwa saplu lai?’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anakim au mina ketie kedime ge, ketie kedi kemlang Anak leuhme.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 9:3" />Cilu cine henai RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang au pa nnui dwaga kengkap miheu nzwa tet kelabe; pa penuide ngkap dizie, nah pa nnui dwa gade penuide ngam dizie; cine nnui penuide gwampet dizie nah nzet süt eh penuide ngkap dizie, RAMPAUBE nnui dage kerangde nzwa eh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:29">Heb. 12:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 9:4" />RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang penuide nnui dwa gade gwa mpet kedicai, nnui mlung gade rang diso, ‘RAMPAUBE aipau deu de acu gumlu kera ngngwa gwang beu a kesamsang de ziemne,’ kedanemene heleuh aidungde nlien kedide ziemne RAMPAUBE penuide nnui dwa gade gwampet dilai zeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6">Rom. 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 9:5" />Cide nnui keyi ziemne ma mede nnui petau te kela ziemne penui deu nnui gum lulai eh bam ma, dede heleuh aidungde nlien kedine nnui RAMPAUBE penuide nnui dwa gade gwampet dilai zeu, nah iciu eh pa nnui paumedung, Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob dage sampet kai kebeude teicang beu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 9:6" />Ciziemne cilu, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui samsang kecu ziemne hangdeu keyi aide peu lai eh bam ma, kedanemene nnui au nnui lung hung kecume lu.<verse eid="DEU 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kecak tumna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 9:7" />Nnui hetaideu ga keladau dainzwa delwe RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang rata teidi bi kecude cetlu nah nsungta diso; nnui Egypt deu de pütdi eh tet kedi benai gade nnui aipau ni ga gwang canglu cu kecang, nnui RAMPAUBE de renia gwang.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 1:33-34</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 9:8" />Horeb gade de nnui RAMPAUBE rata tei, nah RAMPAUBE nnuide ngkapdi lubui kera kecang pe rata di. <verse eid="DEU 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 9:9" />Ih lamlwa ga tangtsukwak pwa kera nghang kecudau, RAMPAUBE nnuide ngngwa samkak teikelu tangtsukwak, Ih lamlwa ga tingbazie riakdai nah tingmui riakdai bamdi; Ih tangku tyei ma mede dui de sak ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 9:10" />RAMPAUBE acu pe zurang le rau kenzeu tangtsu kwak kenade pwapeu; cika samdung pelane RAMPAUBE ne nnui dage lamlwa ga ngkwa kecu benai nnui dage miheu sumkak gade rang mdukegai dungde kesiakte raunzeu pwabam.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 7:38, 2 Cor. 3:3</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 9:11" />Cipau tingmui tingbazie riakdai cang luge RAMPAUBE acu tangtsukwak kenade pwapeu, samkakkelu tangtsukwak de. <verse eid="DEU 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 9:12" />RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, ‘Cuhlu, aikade nzet nghung cu, kedanemene n minadung, nang Egypt gade ngngwampet kelumedung, hera dida nah kemau tei dida. Ih aja kaikebeu lampui de gade penui nzetsüt eh nreutet dida. Penui katei penui ziemne mamie ge tei luda.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 9:13" />Cipau reude, RAMPAUBE acu resiu delwe rangsi gai, ‘Ih mina aidungde de ngau da; penui au mina pe lung hung kecume. <verse eid="DEU 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 9:14" />Acu kaam diso, iciude Ih penuide teingkap di nah penui zi tinggim kang gade kemaidi kerane, nah Ih nnuide penui swade heleuh ngkiengki nah diki kecuge tei beuzie.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 9:15" />Cine Ih nreu caililwe lamlwa gade nghung di, nah lamlwa heu bamdi. Samkakkelu tangtsukwak kenade a ba gala. <verse eid="DEU 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 9:16" />Ih piegai, nah ainie, nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage kemau teigai dida. Nnuikatei nnui ziemne hetumna ge tei luda. Nnui RAMPAUBE ne aja kaikebeu lampui de gade nnui nzetsüt eh nreutet dida. <verse eid="DEU 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 9:17" />Ih keu kela tangtsukwak kenade a ba gade keliengi di. Ih cipau kenade nnui miak dwade teipang di. <verse eid="DEU 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 9:18" />Pecai Ih tingmui tingbazie riakdai ge RAMPAUBE dwaga taksu pung eh bamdai; Ih magede tyei ma mede sak ma, kedanemene nnui teikedi nnui mau pelane ziemne, RAMPAUBE dwa gade kemau keteine, iciu eh nnui pe kemei tei eh pe rata teidi kerane. <verse eid="DEU 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 9:19" />Ih rata de hing kedi ziemne nah RAMPAUBE nnui dage pe ratasüt eh nnuide ngkapdi rauta kedine. Dede RAMPAUBE cipau ting daude a kwa kingnei daibeu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 12:21">Heb. 12:21</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 9:20" />RAMPAUBE Aaron de pe ratasüt kedine pecu ngkapdi laidi; Ih Aaron ziemnede cipau tingdau kekie tei. <verse eid="DEU 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 9:21" />Ih nnui kemau pwalu, hetumna nnui ne tei kelude, delwe rudi, dapdi, nah tei kecaidi, cide rebui ge nzwadi kemaktane. Ih rebui cide lamlwa ga reunaki lwamie kebamde gage kelien gaidi.<verse eid="DEU 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 9:22" />Taberah ga, Massah ga, nah Kibroth Hattaavah ga, nnui RAMPAUBE kemei tei eh pe lunghop gage teugai.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 11:1-3, Tet. 17:1-7, Pum. 11:31-34</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 9:23" />RAMPAUBE nnuide Kadesh Barnea gade langgai nah kerang dau, ‘Nghang delwe hangdeu Ih nnuide peu kedide gumlu,’ cidau nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang aja de mlaidi, nah nnui pecu nlum ma mede pe kwa kingnei ma. <verse eid="DEU 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 9:24" />Ih nnuide ci kelu tingba benai gade nnui RAMPAUBE de mlai ladi da. <verse eid="DEU 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 9:25" />Cine Ih RAMPAUBE dwaga tingmui tingbazie riakdai a zu nkum pung bamdi, kedanemene pa nnuide teingkapdi kera rang kegaine. <verse eid="DEU 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 9:26" />Ih RAMPAUBE dage kie eh ranggai, “O RAMPAUBE Tinggwang, n minadungde ngkap diso mede n mapwame n kedi de gade rikelube de, n ba kengkieng de teu Egypt gade ngngwampet kelude. <verse eid="DEU 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 9:27" />N kilame Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob penuide nsung gailo; penui lung hung kecude, nah penui kenlien de, nah penui kemaudung de pie helo, <verse eid="DEU 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 9:28" />iciu eh nang anuide ngngwa kempet deu de gade rangdi lubui, ‘RAMPAUBE penuide sampet kebeu deu de ga pa penuide ngngwa gwang luma, nah pa penuide ngkau kecune, pa penuide hetaideu gage teitsetdi kera ngngwa mpet gaida.’ <verse eid="DEU 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 9:29" />Ciciude penui au n minadung nah n mapwame, nang penuide n ba kedi nah kengkieng keulia eh Egypt gade ngngwa mpetlu.”<verse eid="DEU 9:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="DEU 10" />
  <para style="s">Tangtsukwak keraibe kenade kenzwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 10:1" />Cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Keraibe nzwa tangtsukwak kena panglu, nah lamlwa ga a da nghanglu, nah tsingbung ge teilu. <verse eid="DEU 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 10:2" />Ih tangtsukwak gage samdung raugai beuzie tangtsukwak keraibe ga kebamde nang ne rütpang kedide, nah nang ci kenade tsingbung gage kai luzie.” <verse eid="DEU 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 10:3" />Cine Ih acacia tsing le tsingbung ge teilu, nah Ih tangtsukwak keraibe kenade nzwa panglu, nah Ih lamlwa ga nghang, tangtsukwak kenade a ba ga pwabam eh.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 9:4">Heb. 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 10:4" />Pa tangtsukwak kena gage rau, keraide rau kecunzwa, nnui lamlwa gade ngkwa kelu benai de RAMPAUBE mi sum gade marang eh nnuide Ajadung Kerei de kepeu; pecai RAMPAUBE tangtsukwak kenade acu peu. <verse eid="DEU 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 10:5" />Ih nreucaili lu nah lamlwatu gade nghung lu, nah tangtsukwak de tsingbung Ih ne tei kelude gage kailu; ci kenade cika ladi da, RAMPAUBE acu rang kebeude nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 10:6" />(Cipaucai Israelmedung Beeroth Bene Jaakan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Beeroth Bene Jaakan: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aide pekie Jaakanme tekwadung.</char></note> gade Moserah ga hebeuh tei mie. Cikade Aaron tsaidi, nah pecu cika ge kungdi; Eleazar, pe napei, pe keleu tei eh cingkupei teidi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 20:22-28</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 10:7" />Cikade penui Gudgodah gage hebeuh teigai, nah Gudgodah gade heni dui keyi deu, Jotbathah ga kecang. <verse eid="DEU 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 10:8" />Cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE Levi leuhme depeu RAMPAUBE Samkakbung de pwa kera kedetlu, RAMPAUBE dwaga sap eh pe gwatei kera, nah pe zi ziemne henai nzwa, pe mina de samlam beu kera.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 32:25-39</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 10:9" />Cine Levi au pe qwa gah mede pe siname de ngngwa hangdeu gum kerade gah; pa gumlu kerabe au RAMPAUBE da, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang pecu rang kebeude nzwa.) <verse eid="DEU 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 10:10" />Ih lamlwa ga kerai tingdau nzwa bamdi, tingbazie riakdai nah tingmuizie riakdai. RAMPAUBE cipau ting daude a kekie kingnei daibeu; RAMPAUBE nnuide ngkapdi kera pe lungning ma. <verse eid="DEU 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 10:11" />Pecai RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, ‘Cuhlu, minadung dwa tetcu penui beuh teuswa beu kera; penui tetlüt nah hangdeu gum luzie Ih penui paume dage penuide peu zie lie eh sampet tei kedide nzwa.’<verse eid="DEU 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube miekehing</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 10:12" />Cu, Israel, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui dade dai luuneu lano? RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de kehing de rünne, pe lampui pelane ga tet kera, pecu hung kera, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nnui mlung pelane teu nah nnui keringria pelane teu eh reca kerade da,<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 10:27">Luk. 10:27</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 10:13" />RAMPAUBE aja dungde mzailu kera, nah pe zaidung, Ih nnui ziuyi ziemne henai tei lulo eh aja kai gaila. <verse eid="DEU 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 10:14" />Ainie, tinggim hutubedung kecangde, kideu, nah cika kebam leune de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang gu. <verse eid="DEU 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 10:15" />RAMPAUBE rünne nnui paume de pesui yi iciu eh penuide hunglu kerane, nah pa penui leuhmedung de, penui caime de, mina keda keheibe swade nnuide kedetlu, henai pa tei kebam nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1PE 2:9">1 Pet. 2:9</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 10:16" />Ciziemne nnui mlung hegeurum di<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:16 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Nnui mlung hegeurum di: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nnui mlung nreulu</char></note>, nah nnui mlung tak sita dilu. <verse eid="DEU 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 10:17" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, pa au heradung reu Tinggwang, nah mpaubedung reu Rampaube, Tinggwang ditube, ngkiengtube nah ngau kehing ge, migede de pesui ntwa lama nah hetau henimdung luu lama.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lei. 136:2-3</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 10:18" />Pa pe pei kegahme nah hemipui ziemne kemzuibe tei beula, nah pa sangme de taktyei nah paini peu eh keku keulia la. <verse eid="DEU 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 10:19" />Cine sangme de kulu; nnui de Egyptme deu ga sangme ge tei kecune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 19:34, Tet. 22:21, 23:9</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 10:20" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hing zie; nnui pecu reca zie. Nnui pe dage ngngei bi maisia, nah pe zi rünne ga nnui sampet zie. <verse eid="DEU 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 10:21" />Nnui pecu twalu, nah pa nnui Tinggwang da, nnui ziemne ma kedi nah kehingdung tei kebeube, nnui miak le ngau kelude. <verse eid="DEU 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 10:22" />Nnui paume Canaan gade mina riakhena ge Egypt ga nghung; cu au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide tinggimdung ga hegidung kebam kiee ge tei beuda.<verse eid="DEU 10:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="DEU 11" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube de Ku nah Samzai teilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 11:1" />Ciziemne nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hung zie nah pe zaidung, teilo kebeu be, nah pe ajadung pa kerangdung de kai nzeu muilu. <verse eid="DEU 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 11:2" />Ih nnui namedung de resiu bam kemak cilu, penui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de cima mede pe saja gede ngau kemakme, pe kedi, pe ba kengkieng, mede pe ba hetwakepet de, <verse eid="DEU 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 11:3" />Egyptme kakgade, Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh da, nah pe deu leune gage, pa marengei nah hetadung teigai. <verse eid="DEU 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 11:4" />Penui pa Egypt reugwame dage keteide de ngau ma, penui kwendung dage, mede penui bagidung dage, dai nzwa eh pa dui Kegie Jaaidi de penuide tei puinlim gai bi penui nnui cai zui kela dau, nah dai nzwa eh RAMPAUBE henai kecang penuide tei ngkapdi bi, <verse eid="DEU 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 11:5" />mede pa nnui ziemne hetaideu gade dai tei beu bi nnui heni aika gwang kemakne.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 7:5">Bat. 7:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 11:6" />Penui RAMPAUBE ne Dathan nah Abiram dage tei kegai de ngau ma, Eliab napei Reuben napei, dai nzwa eh kideu be ngkei gaibeu nah penai kilungmedung, penai paiki, nah penai caisui kela keringria pelane, Israelme pelane kakgade penaide nnwalu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 16</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 11:7" />Dede nnui miak le RAMPAUBE pa tei kegai heta kedi leune ngau da. <verse eid="DEU 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 11:8" />Cine Ih henai nnuide teilo kebeu be aja pelane mzailu, ciude nnui ngkieng lu kerane, nah lütlu delwe hangdeu de gumlu nnui mie eh gum lai eh kebam ga, <verse eid="DEU 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 11:9" />nah ciu eh RAMPAUBE ne penuide nnui peime de nah penui leuhme de peu zielie eh sampet kebeu deu de ga, tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu de nnui nnui teilung tielu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 11:10" />Kedanemene nnui gumlu lai eh kebam deu de, au Egyptme deu nzwa ma, nnui kegwang gade, nnui nnui heleuh gi kegai nah nnui pi le dui ketau kegai de ga, cehei bangdung gurie nzwa; <verse eid="DEU 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 11:11" />dede nnui mie eh gumlu kera, hangdeu de, au hangdeutu nah langkamdung, nah tinggimdung tingrui dui sak kela deu ge, <verse eid="DEU 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 11:12" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang hung kela deu de; RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang miak au cide ga bam muila, mmi raitu gade mmi kamtu kecang de.<verse eid="DEU 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 11:13" />Cinzwa eh, Ih henai sam kai kebeu ajadung de nnui kingnei sünne lucai, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hung nah nnui mlung pelane teu nah nnui keringria pelane le pe gwa teilu cai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aidungde Tinggwang ajadung; Moses ne minadung dage kai kebam da.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 11:14" />Ih nnui deu gage tingrui pe hi leune dau peu zie, tingrui keraibe nah tingrui kekambe, ciude nnui nnui meitsi ga, nnui zau keheci, nah nnui maca hekwalu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:7">Jas. 5:7</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 11:15" />Ih nnui kaune ziemne nnui luh ga cehei peu zie, nah nnui tyei nah nggei luzie. <verse eid="DEU 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 11:16" />Nnuikatei nnuide teimriak bamlu ciude nnui mlungbe de cwa di melu kerane, nah nnui nreu tet nah hera kedadung de reca nah penui dage keumie di melu kerane; <verse eid="DEU 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 11:17" />ciciu de RAMPAUBE rata nnui dage heu gai di melu kerane; nah ciu eh pa tinggimdung nkui di eh tingrui gah di melu kerane, nah hangdeube petsi bui tadi melu kerane, nah ciciu eh RAMPAUBE nnuide hangdeu keyi peu kebam cikade nnui tsai zette dizie.<verse eid="DEU 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 11:18" />Ciziemne a sam aidungde nnui mlung nah keringria gage hekwalu, cidungde nnui ba gage marehi ge nzwa kanglu, nah cidungde peu nnui miak kena kakga kehezuria de nzwalu. <verse eid="DEU 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 11:19" />Nnui nnui name de cidungde ledeu beuzie nah nnui nnui ki ga kebam dau, nnui lampui ga tet kela dau, nnui zeu kemie dau, nah nnui cuh kelu dau cidung ha ledeu beulo. <verse eid="DEU 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 11:20" />Nnui cidungde nnui ki kimui tsiadung gage rau luzie nah nnui namdibe riekidung ga, <verse eid="DEU 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 11:21" />ciu eh nnui tingbadung nah nnui name tingbadung tei ngkie beuzie RAMPAUBE nnui paumedung dage penuide peu zielie sampet kebeube deu de ga kideu reu ga tinggimdung kebam tane. <verse eid="DEU 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 11:22" />Kedanemene nnui aja aidung pelane Ih nnuide tei lulo kebeu de mzai sünne lucai, ciciu eh cidung tei lucai, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hung lucai, pe lampui leune ga tet lucai, nah pecu nggei lucai, <verse eid="DEU 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 11:23" />ciude RAMPAUBE heleuh aidung pelane nnui dwa de gwa mpet dizie, nah nnui swa heleuh di nah ngkiengki kecume deu de nnui gum luzie. <verse eid="DEU 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 11:24" />Heni pelane nnui pideu dau kegwang deu leune nnui gu dizie; hetaideu gade Lebanon kecang, hereuki de gade, Euphrate Reuki de, naimiak kenlütle jaaidi kecang de nnui rai luzie. <verse eid="DEU 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 11:25" />Migede nnui dwa sap gai lak. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang peu minadung de nnuide hing dizie nah nnui tet kegwang hangdeu leune ga nnuide keheu dizie, pa nnuide sampet kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 11:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 11:26" />Pielu, Ih henai nnui dwa gage samlam nah reset ge peu gaila: <verse eid="DEU 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 11:27" />samlam ge, magade Ih henai nnui dage rang kebeu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ajadung de nnui mzailu cai, <verse eid="DEU 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 11:28" />nah reset ge, magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ajadung mzailu mecai, dede Ih henai nnui dage rang kebeu de gade tet nreu di cai, nnui ci kemak hera kedadung cai nreu gai di cai. <verse eid="DEU 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 11:29" />Cinzwa eh, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui mie gum lai kebam deu ga nnuide ngngwa gwang keludau, nnui Gerizim Deutu gade samlam sah zie, nah Ebal Deutu gade reset sah zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:20">Jhn. 4:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 11:30" />Lamlwa ai kena de Jordan reuki gwale, naimiak kenlütle ga kenlütle lampui, Canaanme deu Arabah ga kelunghme, Gilgal namceu reu lebie, Moreh ga mhubangdung taiga meni? <verse eid="DEU 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 11:31" />Kedanemene nnui Jordan tet kahlwe RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu kebam deu de ga mie gumlu kerane, nah cide nnui gum luzie nah cika lungh zie. <verse eid="DEU 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 11:32" />Henai Ih nnui dwa hezai kai kebeu pelane nah teimzai lulo kepeu de mzai zie.<verse eid="DEU 11:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="DEU 12" />
  <para style="s">Kereca Ni Ket de</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 12:1" />Hezai kai kebeu nah hezaidung aidungde da, RAMPAUBE nnui paume Tinggwang ne, nnuide hangdeu gum kera kepeu deu de ga tei mzai kera, nnui kideu ga lungh kebam tingbazie pelane. <verse eid="DEU 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 12:2" />Nnui ngkap kedi heleuhdung penui rabedung de reca kela henidung de, lamlwatudung kecehu ga, kideutuhdung ga, nah tsingbang kemdiak kebam heni pelane de teimsia bi dizie. <verse eid="DEU 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 12:3" />Nnui penui recabamdung tei msiadi maisia, penui tsusumdung teipang kecaidi, delwe penui gu Asherah mie rudi. Nnui penui rabedung mie heri keludung de dum tüt kecai dilu maisia, nah cipau bam gade penui zi mai gidi. <verse eid="DEU 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 12:4" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de cinzwa reca lak. <verse eid="DEU 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 12:5" />Dede nnui leuhme pelane deu kakgade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang heni ge kedetlu zie pezi peu bam kera, cika pa kebam heni ge zie, delwe cide ga nnui mie zie. <verse eid="DEU 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 12:6" />Cipau bam ga nnui keru recadung, nnui ratakdung, nnui kereizige, nah nnui ba le reca mapeu pwa kepeu, nnui sampet kelu reca mapeudung, nnui mta reca mapeudung, nah nnui kauruine nah hekaune mciu kelu raitubedung nnui cide pwa gwang zie. <verse eid="DEU 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 12:7" />Cikade nnui nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade matyei zie nah nnui heta tei kegai leune gade suiyi ngau luzie, nnui nah nnui kelakdung, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide samlam kebeu gade. <verse eid="DEU 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 12:8" />Anui henai aika tei kebam ma pelane nnui tei lak da; cu au mi leune de pe miak gade dai petau bi tei bam dida; <verse eid="DEU 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 12:9" />kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum kera pwa peu kebam ga, nnui gwang mtak cang mereu kecune. <verse eid="DEU 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 12:10" />Dede nnui Jordan kahpet eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide pwa kepeu hangdeu de gumlu eh cika lungh dizie, nah pa nnuide nnui ngauraume pelane twagwapung kebam gade peu kwak luzie, iciu eh nnui lungh ziune eh lungh luzie. <verse eid="DEU 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 12:11" />Cidau RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang heni ge kedet luzie cika de pecu herüt peulu kerane, cika Ih nnuide aja kai kebeu ma pelane teu gwang zie: nnui keru recadung, nnui ratakdung, nnui kereizige, nah nnui ba le reca mapeu pwa kepeu, nah nnui gu recadung yitube sampet ziemne RAMPAUBE dage nnui sampet kera de. <verse eid="DEU 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 12:12" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade n suiyi luzie, nang, n napeime, n napuime, n kila peimedung, n kila puimedung, nah Levime n herie lungga kebammedung, kedanemene pa au nnui kakga hema mede mapwa gumlu kera gah. <verse eid="DEU 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 12:13" />Nnui heni kengau leune ga nnui keru reca tei lak lie kecu de nnuikatei nnuide teu mriaklu;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:20">Jhn. 4:20</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 12:14" />dede nnui RAMPAUBE ne nnui heleuhdung kakgade kedet kelu heni de gage nnui keru recadung peu zie, nah nnui cika Ih aja kai kegai ma pelane tei zie.<verse eid="DEU 12:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 12:15" />Cinzwa liede, nnui nnui herie lungga kebam makaunedung pelane teitset lwe tyei lubui, nnui suira tei eh, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide ma pelane pwa samlam kebeu gade; mci kemakbe nah kemcime hang nana cide tyei lubui, makaunedung helung nah heti kenzwabe. <verse eid="DEU 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 12:16" />Dede nnui hejai tyei lak; nnui kideu gage dui nzwa rui mpet gai dizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 9:3-4, Lev. 17:10-14, Hez. 12:23</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 12:17" />Nnui lungh kebam herieki gade nnui meiciu kereizige gade nnui tyei lak, nnui zau kehecibe, nnui maca, mede nnui tumdung mede meuründung mciu raitube; nah nnui sampet kebeu keheibe de nnui ratak tei kegai heteih nnui tyei lak, mede mta reca mapeudung, mede nnui nnui ba gade reca mapeu kepeu dungde. <verse eid="DEU 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 12:18" />Meliene, nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade cidungde tyei zie RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kelu heni gade, nnui, nnui napeidung, nnui napuidung, nnui kila peimedung, nnui kila puimedung, nah Levime nnui herieki ga lungh kebammedung de si eh; nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade nnui heta tei kegai leune gade suiyi ngau luzie. <verse eid="DEU 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 12:19" />Ciu eh nnui nnui deu ga lungh kebam tane Levime de mlai melu kerane nnuikatei cet sünne lu.<verse eid="DEU 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 12:20" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang pa nnui dage sampet kebeu nzwa, nnui deurai tei mdi kecudau, nnui rang eh, “Ih teihring tyei zie,” kedanemene nnui hetei tyei neu kecune, nnui hetei tyei lubui, nnui keringria tyei keneu de nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 12:21" />Magade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang pecu herüt peulu kerane kedet kelu heni de nnui dade dei zu di cai, ge nnui RAMPAUBE ne nnuide pwa kepeu nnui tumdung nah nnui meuründung kesa nnui teitset zie, Ih nnuide aja kai kebeu de nzwa; nnui nnui lungh kebam herieki gade tyei lubui, nnui keringria tei keneu de nzwa.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 14:24">Lev. 14:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 12:22" />Helung nah heti tyei kela nzwa, nnui cide tyei zie; cide nzwa mci kemakme nah kemcimedung de cide tyei lubui. <verse eid="DEU 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 12:23" />Hejaidung tyei di lak kerane nnui ci bi lu maisia, kedanemene hejai ga keringria lalu; nnui hetei de si eh keringria tyei kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 12:24" />Nnui cide tyei so; dui nzwa nnui hangdeu ga cide ruigai zie. <verse eid="DEU 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 12:25" />Nnui cide tyei lak, iciu eh nnui ziemne yilu kerane, nah nnui cai nnui namedung de, RAMPAUBE miakngau gade nnui petau be tei keludau. <verse eid="DEU 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 12:26" />Dede nnui da kebam RAMPAUBE gu niadung nah nnui sampet kebeu reca mapeudung, nnui aidungde keulu delwe RAMPAUBE ne kedet kelu bam ga gwanglu. <verse eid="DEU 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 12:27" />Cika nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang recabam ga, hetei nah hejai, nnui keru reca mapeudung peu zie; nnui ratak tei kegai hejaidung RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang recabam gage ruigai zie, nah nnui hetei be tyei luzie. <verse eid="DEU 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 12:28" />Ih nnui dage aja kai kebeu aipau samdung leune pie eh kingnei lulo, iciu eh nnui nah nnui namedung de nnui cai kelungta yilu kerane, cidau nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang miak gade dai yi bi nah petau be teilu.<verse eid="DEU 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 12:29" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui dwa gade heleuhdung de ngkap kedi dau, nnui penuide keugi kera nlüt, nah nnui penuide keugi keludau, nah penui deu ga lungh kelu dau, <verse eid="DEU 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 12:30" />nnui penui renet zaidung mzui kelak nnuikatei cet bilu, penuide nnui dwa gade ngkap kedi cai, penui rabedung de dainzwa reca zeu bikecu peilu eh, keteu, ‘Aipau leuhmedung de penui rabedung de dainzwa reca lano? Ih de cinzwa tei zie.’ <verse eid="DEU 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 12:31" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de cinzwa reca kerabe ma, kedanemene cidung pelane RAMPAUBE ziemne pa ngau ngkaukela kemneu be lu, penui aidungde penui rabedung da tei gai; penui rabedung ziemne penui penui napeidung nah penui napuidung de de mi ga ru gaila.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:31 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 7:25-26</char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 12:32" />Ih nnuide rang kebeu leune, cide tei mneilu. Cika ge magede kaisi so mede keu gi diso.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:18">Keu. 22:18</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 12:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="DEU 13" />
  <para style="s">Hera Kedadung Kereca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 13:1" />Magade nnui kakgade caihakecime mede hemang kemmi medung cuhdi, nah pa marehi ge mede miswakegah ge nnuide peu cai,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 24:24, Mrk. 13:22</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 13:2" />nah magade ma rehi mede miswakegah pa ncu kerang de gwang eh rang cai, ‘Anui rabe kedadung cai tet go, nnui ci kemakbe, nah anui penuide reca go,’ <verse eid="DEU 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 13:3" />cipau caihakecibe sam de kingnei so, mede cipau hemang kemmibe dungde de; kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kedakpie bam nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nnui mlung pelane teu nah nnui keringria pelane teu pecu ku bam mi kecu ci kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 13:3, 1 Cor. 11:19</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 13:4" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang cai tet zie, pecu herüt peulu, pe aja kai kebeudung de tei mzailu, nah pesam mzailu, nah nnui pecu reca zie nah pecu nggei lalu. <verse eid="DEU 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 13:5" />Cipau caihakecibe mede cipau hemang kemmibe de ketsai ga kai dizie, kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de rang mlai kecune, Egyptme deu gade nnuide ngngwa mpet kebeu be de, nah kilame ki<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ki: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">nnui mi kilame tei kela deudi.</char></note> gade nnuide teu mpet kebeu be. Cipau caihakecibe RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide aja kai eh tet lulo kebeu gade teu mpetdi neu la. Cine nnui kakgade herakesia keu mzia dilu.<verse eid="DEU 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 13:6" />Magade n sinabepei, n pui napei, mede n napei, mede n napui, mede nang hung kela n nau de, mede n dade n zangpei n keringria nzwa kelabe de, ncu ngkim kecung eh rang, ‘Anui mie delwe hera keda dungde reca go nnui ci kemak be de, nnui mede nnui paumedung liede,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">13:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 17:2, Ken. 16:5</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 13:7" />mina rabedung keheibe nnuide twagwa eh kebam dung, n taiga kebam, mede n dade mdei kebam, kideu ket lambie tu penli gade gwang kideu keda lambie tu penli ga kecang.’ <verse eid="DEU 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 13:8" />Nang pecu peudi kerabe ma mede pe kwa kingnei kerabe ma, nah nang n miak de peu pecu ngaunggia di kerabe ma, nah nang pecu püt kerabe ma mede pecu gum kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 13:9" />Meliene, nang pecu teitset bi di kerabe; pecu ketsai ga kai kera n ba peda raitu kerabe, nah cipaucai mina pelane ba gade.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:14">Lev. 24:14</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 13:10" />Nang pecu tangtsudung le samtset zie, kedanemene pa nnuide RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dade teu mdei di kera ciem ketei ne, Egyptme deu gade nnuide teu mpet kebeu be dade, hebaang tei kela ki gade. <verse eid="DEU 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 13:11" />Israelme pelane siu lwe ngngi dizie, nah nnui kakgade kemau ci kenzwa gede teisi dai lak.<verse eid="DEU 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 13:12" />Magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide lungh kera kepeu ga, keheibe de nnui namdidung ket ha rang eh nnui siu cai: <verse eid="DEU 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 13:13" />Kemaume midung ge nnui kakgade tet mpet nah penui namdi ga lungh kebammedung de teu mpet eh rangdi, ‘Anui mie delwe nnui ci kemak rabe kedadung de reca cugo.’ <verse eid="DEU 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 13:14" />Cipaucai nang makesangbe pie zie, peei eh, nah cide peei ncwak zie. Nang cide kesang nah cinzwa delie kecu ngau kelu dau, cikenzwa makesia nnui kakgade tei gai kecu, pecai nang n ta tei gaizie. <verse eid="DEU 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 13:15" />Nang namdi cika lungkebamme de kingtie tün le gwaketang bizie, ma pelane tei ngkap dizie nah cika mina lungh kebam pelane de de, penui kauruine pelane de si eh, kingtie tün le. <verse eid="DEU 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 13:16" />Nnui mania tuikelu pelane lampui sum ga hekwa luzie, nah namdi de ru dizie, mania tuikelu pelane de si eh, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne. Namdi kelungta ziemne ngkap kedi ge dizie; cide madaude tei ncuh dai lak. <verse eid="DEU 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 13:17" />Ma cidungde ngkap di kera ziemne keu ntsam kelu n ba ga peu bam kerabe ma. Aide ainzwa kerabe, iciude RAMPAUBE pe lunghop gade nreu tetlu kerane, ncu ngaugia keulia eh, ncu ngaukenggia kecu, nah ncu heleuh tei kiee beuzie, pa n paumedung da pe sampet kegai de nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 13:18" />Pa aidungde tei beuzie kedanemene nang RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang sam kingnei kebam ne, Ih henai nnuide pe aja kai kebeu pelane mzai lulo eh rang kebeu de, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang miakngau gade dai petau bi teilu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 13:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="DEU 14" />
  <para style="s">Mci nah Mcikemak Taktyeipuk</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 14:1" />Nnui au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang gu minadung. Nnuikatei nnuide rezam diso, mede ketsaime ziemne nnui zu keheiga de tai diso.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:4">Rom. 9:4</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 14:2" />Kedanemene nnui au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne keu ntsam kelu leuh ge, nah kideu ga kelung mina pelane swa de, RAMPAUBE nnuide peu pegu mina tei kera kedetlu.<verse eid="DEU 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 14:3" />Nnui ngkaukela ma keheibe de tyei so. <verse eid="DEU 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 14:4" />Nnui makaune aidung de tyei lubui: hetumseu, meurün, nah hemeu, <verse eid="DEU 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 14:5" />heti, helung, hetiseu, renaam meu, nah lamlwa meu, nah hetidung, nah renaam meurün. <verse eid="DEU 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 14:6" />Makaunedung keheibe de cide cai, pengienglwak pang kena keteibe nah tanglit tyei kelabe nnui tyei lubui. <verse eid="DEU 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 14:7" />Iciuliede, makaunedung kesabe tanglit tyeila mede pengienglwak pang kena tei kelabe de nnui tyei kerabe ma: ut, rabbit, nah baktwak tyeilak; kedanemene penui tanglit tyeila dede pengienglwak de pang lama, cidungde nnui ziemne mci ma. <verse eid="DEU 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 14:8" />Hebak de nnui ziemne de mci ma kedanemene pa pengienglwak pang dede tanglit tyeila kemakbe; pa nnui ziemne mci ma. Hebak tei tyei so, nah penui ketsaipau tung so.<verse eid="DEU 14:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 14:9" />Dui ga kebam ma aidung nnui tyei lubui: penlangdung nah peliepdung kebam leune. <verse eid="DEU 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 14:10" />Dede penlangdung nah peliepdung kegahbe leune nnui tyei so; penui au nnui ziemne mci ma.<verse eid="DEU 14:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 14:11" />Nnui nruine kemcibe leune tyei lubui. <verse eid="DEU 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 14:12" />Dede aipau nruinedung nnui tyei so: helie, herarui, dui liengrie, <verse eid="DEU 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 14:13" />liengcingna kegiebe nah liengcingna ketiakbe, keta keheibe helie. <verse eid="DEU 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 14:14" />Nnui keta keheibe hegak tyei so, <verse eid="DEU 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 14:15" />nah ruitie, nah tingmui biangkang, duiruine, liengrie keheibe, <verse eid="DEU 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 14:16" />biangkang keceube, biangkang kedibe, biangkang kehabe, <verse eid="DEU 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 14:17" />pelican, dui liengrie, cormorant. <verse eid="DEU 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 14:18" />Nnui duirui, heron ruine keheibe, regwabentwa nah takla tyei so. <verse eid="DEU 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 14:19" />Kaucitna pe hesiu kepungbe leune nnui ziemne mci ma; penuide tyei kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 14:20" />Nnui lim keladung kemcibe leune tyei lubui.<verse eid="DEU 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 14:21" />Nnui makeheibe pekatei tsai kebambe tyei so; nnui cide sangme nnui namceu ga kebamme de peu lubui, iciu eh pa cide tyei lubui; mede nnui cide sangme dage zwa beu lubui. Kedanemene nnui au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne keuntsam kelu leuh lu. Nnui hemeuna de pepui tungdui gage lang diso.<verse eid="DEU 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kereizige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 14:22" />Nnui nnui luh meitsi buikebeu pelane gade kereizige kai bi maisia, nnui luh gade mmi ramsang gwang lu kela gade. <verse eid="DEU 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 14:23" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade tyei zie, pane kedet kelu pe kemci bam gade, nnui mei, nnui zau keheci, nah nnui olive ca, nah nnui tumdung nah nnui meuründung mciu raitube gu kereizige; ciude nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de herüt peu bam muilu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 14:24" />Magade hebeuh de nnui ziemne dei hamdi eh nnui cide punglu tadi cai, kedanemene cipau ni de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kelu pe kemci bam de nnui dade dei hamdi cai, ciude, RAMPAUBE Tinggwang nnuide samlam süt kebeu dau, <verse eid="DEU 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 14:25" />nnui makai cidungde tei kedet pwa rangkang teilu, rangkang cide nnui ba gage herak ntiplu, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kenzeu bam ga mielu. <verse eid="DEU 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 14:26" />Cikade nnui rangkang mpetgai keneube keheibe gage mpetlu: hetumseu ziemne, mede meurün ziemne, mede zau ziemne, mede kengkieng zau ziemne, mede keheibe nnui keneube ziemne; nnui cika RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade tyei zie, nah nnui renga zie, nnui nah nnui kelak de. <verse eid="DEU 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 14:27" />Levime nnui namdi lungga kebamme, pecu gi diso, kedanemene pa au nnuide ngngwa peqwa mede gumlu kera gahlu.<verse eid="DEU 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 14:28" />Mmi kecum cang kedi ramsang cipau kum de nnui ngau kelu leune gu kereizige pwa gwang zie, nah nnui cide nnui namdidung gage hekwa luzie; <verse eid="DEU 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 14:29" />Nah Levime, pa au nnuide ngngwa peqwa mede gumlu kera kegahne, nah sangme, nah nggiana nah hemipui cika nnui namdidung ga kebam medung, gwang zie nah tyei zie nah mnung luzie. Aide teilu iciude RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui ba le nnui heta tei kegai leune gage nnuide samlam beu zie.<verse eid="DEU 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="DEU 15" />
  <para style="s">Hepau Nggakebeu Mmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 15:1" />Mmi hena ramsangne gwang cang keludau, nnui hepaudung nggadi maisia. <verse eid="DEU 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 15:2" />Aide nzwa eh tei zie: Releu kebeume keheibe pa pe kidabe de releu kebeu pau de nggah dizie; pa pe kidabe dade mede pe sinabe dade kie dai lak kedanemene RAMPAUBE ne hepaudung nggah di delie rang dida. <verse eid="DEU 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 15:3" />Nnui sangme dade cide kie lubui; dede ngu ma keheibede nnui sinabe da kelade nnui nggah bidi maisia. <verse eid="DEU 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 15:4" />Ciciuliede, nnui kakga migede ma gah bam lak (kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnuide peu nnui gu tei eh gum lai kebam deu de ga pa nnuide samlam beu bi zie), <verse eid="DEU 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 15:5" />Nnui sünne eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingnei lucai, Ih henai nnuide tei lulo ajadung kai kebeu de pelane tei mzailu. <verse eid="DEU 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 15:6" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide samlam beuzie, pa nnuide sampet kebeu nzwa; nnui heleuh kekiee gede releu beuzie, dede nnui au hepwak lak; nnui heleuh kekiee reu kedi tei zie, dede penui nnui reu kedi tei lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 28:12-13</char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 15:7" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu lai eh kebam nnui deu ga nnui herieki lung kehei ga, magade mina nnui kakga kegahme ge, nnui sinamedung ge bam cai, nnui nnui mlung tak ti kerabe ma mede nnui sinabe kegahbe de ngha raudi kerabe ma;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 3:17">Jhn. 3:17</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 15:8" />dede nnui pecu ngha beulu nah pa teumaikesia kieege pecu releu bi lulo. <verse eid="DEU 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 15:9" />Nnui nnui mlung gade kemau lungcet teu eh, “Mmi henabe, hepau nggah beudi kera mmi de, nna di zeuda,” de eh cetdi melu kerane sünne lu, iciude nnui nnui sinabe kegahbe de peuku di melu kerane nah pecu magede peu tadi melu kerane; pa RAMPAUBE dage hap gaizie ncu mmau eh, nah cide n ziemne kemau ge dizie. <verse eid="DEU 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 15:10" />Nang pecu pwapeu bi maisia, nah nang pecu pwapeu kecudau n mlungbe nggia di kerabe ma, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang aide ziemne nnui bata tei kegai leune ga nah nnui ba kai kegai leune ga nnuide samlam beu zielu. <verse eid="DEU 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 15:11" />Kedanemene hangdeu ga madaude kegahme gah lak; cine Ih ncu aja kai eh rangla, ‘Nang Israelme de ngha lamui maisia, keumai kesiame nah n deu ga kegahme de.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 26:11, Mrk. 14:7, Jhn. 12:8</char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kilame de Lungkempet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 15:12" />Israelme kedage, Hebrewme pei de, mede Hebrewme pui de, n dage zwa beu nah mmi herok ge n kila tei di cai, pecai nang pecu mmi pehena bekum n dade lung mpet beu di maisia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 21:1-11</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 15:13" />Nang pecu n dade lung mpet kebeu dau, nang pecu peu mta tet so. <verse eid="DEU 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 15:14" />Nang nsuinga eh n gu meurün hau gade, n hecaipung gade nah n zauniakbam gade pecu pwapeu maisia. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ncu samlam kebeu nzwa, nang pecu pwa peu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 15:15" />Nnui Egypt deu ga kilame tei kecu nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide lung mpet kebeu nnui nsunglu maisia; ciziemne Ih henai nnui dage aide tei kera aja kaibeula. <verse eid="DEU 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 15:16" />Pa n dage rang cai, ‘Ih n dade tetdi laklie,’ kedanemene pa ncu nah n ki de whung, nah pa ncu ngngwa lungh kehega kebam de pesui kecune, <verse eid="DEU 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 15:17" />ciciucai nang kebung tie keulu delwe n ki kimuiki ga ngngwa gwang lwe cikade pekwen bunglu maisia, nah pa kelungta n kila teila luzie. Nang n kilapuide de cide nzwa teibi lu maisia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 21:5-6</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 15:18" />Nang n kilabe de lung mpet kecudau cide n ziemne teipa di kerabe ma, kedanemene pa mmi herokge n kila teibeu da nah li kelume zie swa kena kieege teintwa beu. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nang tei kecu leune gade ncu samlam beuzie.<verse eid="DEU 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hekaune Mciulu Raitube</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 15:19" />N tumdung nah n meuründung mciulu raitube pelane RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne keu ntsam lu maisia. Nang n tum mciulu raitube teu mata teiso, mede n meurün mciulu raitube mai biet so.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 27:26,27, Pum. 18:15-18</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 15:20" />Mmi ramsang kum RAMPAUBE ne pebam kedet kelu gade, nang nah n kilungme mciulu raitube RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade tyei zie. <verse eid="DEU 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 15:21" />Dede magade nnui kauruine zamra di cai, pepi telwa mede pemiak ciet, mede keda zamra msiadi cai, nnui cidungde RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage ratak tei kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 15:22" />Nnui nnui herieki lung gade tyei zie; nnui pelane renet gade mci nah mci kemakbe de, cidungde tyei lubui, nnui heti mede helung tyei kecu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 15:23" />Dede nnui pe jai be tyei so; nnui pe jai dui nzwa hangdeu gage ruigai dilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 9:3-4, Lev. 17:10-14, Hez. 12:23</char></note><verse eid="DEU 15:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="DEU 16" />
  <para style="s">Kahkegwangngyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 16:1" />Abib be kei de mnei lu, nah Kahkegwang de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne mneilu, kedanemene Aviv be kei RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide tingmui Egypt gade ngngwa mpet beu kecune. <verse eid="DEU 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 16:2" />Nnui Kahkegwang ratak de tei gaizie RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage meuründung nah ketumdung le RAMPAUBE ne pe recabam kedet kelu gage. <verse eid="DEU 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 16:3" />Nnui cide Cehi kaikelu tangku de ncüt eh tyei so, nnui lang hena ne cide tsehi kaikemak tangku de kaincüt eh tyei zie, lungrei tangku; kedanemene nnui Egyptme deu gade kelwa eh mpetlu. Aide nnui teilung tingba zie pelane ga teilu iciude nnui Egypt gade kempet benai de nsung lalu kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:14-15; 34:18</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 16:4" />Nnui kakga nnui deurai leune ga lang henane tingkak ga tsehi kette peu ngau so; mede raitu benai tinghegi tingdau nnui ratak tei kecu hetei kette tingcang kecang kai nzeu kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 16:5" />Nnui kahkegwang ratak de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne peu lai eh kebam namdi heriekidung lung gade tei kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 16:6" />Meliene, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kelu pe recaki gade ratak teilu. Cika nnui tinghegi tingnaimiak kenlüt tingdau kahkegwang ratak tei zie, nnui Egypt gade kempet mmi tingdau.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 12:31</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 16:7" />Nnui hetei de rulwe tyeilu maisia RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kebeu bam gade; pecaibe nai tingcang nnui nreu lwe nnui gu ramzeukidung ga gwang dizie. <verse eid="DEU 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 16:8" />Lang herokne ziemne nnui Cehi kaikemak tangku tyei zie; lang henane benai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne reca ngkwa<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Reca ngkwa: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 12:6-kemci ngkwa de qu la.</char></note> ge bamzie; cipau benai nnui bata tei kerabe ma.<verse eid="DEU 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtakkak Ngyidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 16:9" />Nnui nnuikatei ziemne mtakkak hena pei zie; nnui herei sap kebam de tangkane le get kecu benai gade mtakkak hena pei ndeu di maisia. <verse eid="DEU 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 16:10" />Nnui nnui ba gade kepeu mta mapeudung de teu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne Mtakkakdung Ngyi de hengyi lu maisia, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide samlam beu kecu rehi gade. <verse eid="DEU 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 16:11" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade nnui suiyi zie, nnui, nnui napei, nnui napui, nnui kila pei, nnui kila pui, Levime nnui namdi kiriedung lungga kebamme, nah sangme, pepei kegahme, nah hemipui nnui kakga kebamme, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne pe kerecaki kera ziemne kedet kelu ni gade. <verse eid="DEU 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 16:12" />Nnui Egypt ga hebaangme ge lie cu nsunglu; nnui hezai aidungde mneilu nah teilu maisia.<verse eid="DEU 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paiki Ngyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 16:13" />Nnui gu zauniakbam nah nnui gu hecaipung gade nnui luhlüt de hekwa nlüt kelu cai nnui Paiki Ngyi de lang henane hengyilu maisia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 23:42, Neh. 8:14,17</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 16:14" />Nnui hengyi tingdau nnui suiyi zie, nnui, nnui napei, nnui napui, nnui kila pei, nnui kila pui, Levime, nah sangme, nah pepei kegahme nah hemipui nnui heriekidung lungga kebamme. <verse eid="DEU 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 16:15" />Lang henane ziemne RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne nnui hengyi mnei bi lu maisia RAMPAUBE ne kedet kera ni de gade, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ncu n luhlüt leune ga nah n batadung leune ga samlam beu zielu, nah nnui sui yisütlu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 16:16" />Mmi ge gade pia cum n mipeidung leune RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa ga gwang maisia pa ne kedet kera ni de ga: Cehikaikemak Tangku ngyi ga, Mtakkak Ngyi ga, nah Paiki Ngyi ga. Migede peba-mta RAMPAUBE dwaga gwang lak;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">16:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:17; 34:23</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 16:17" />Meliene, mipeidung keheibe de pa teilu kebui gade peuzie, iciu eh nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu kebeu samlam de cilu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tutiakmedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 16:18" />Nnui namdi heriekidung lungga RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne peu kebam dega nnui tutiakme nah kedime kedetlu maisia; penuide nnui leuh riep gade kedet zie, nah penui mina tutiak masang eh tiak maisia. <verse eid="DEU 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 16:19" />Nnui kemzuibe telai keu gidi kerabe ma; nnui keneu kerüt teilak mede hetau henim luu lak, kedanemene hetau henim makecime miak tei ciet dila nah makesangme samdung de tei maudi lalu. <verse eid="DEU 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 16:20" />Nnui kemzuibe caisui lu maisia, kemzuibe cai rünne, iciude RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide peu kera deu de ga lungh nah gumlu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 16:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hera Kedadung de Kereca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 16:21" />Nnuikatei nnui ziemne Asherah mie ge tei ncuh kerabe ma, hetsia ketaheibe de, nnuikatei nnui ziemne tei kelu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang recabam taiga. <verse eid="DEU 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 16:22" />Nnuikatei ziemne ketaheibe kenlum tangtsu mie gede tei ncuh kerabe ma, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ngkau kelabe.<verse eid="DEU 16:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="DEU 17" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 17:1" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage hetum mede meurün zamra kedi be mede ma kesiabedung le ratak tei so, kedanemene cide RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ngkaula.<verse eid="DEU 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 17:2" />Magade nnui kakgade ngau cai, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide peu kebam nnui namdi rieki keheibe lungga de, mipei mede mipui keheibede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang miakngau gade kemau tei kela nah pe samkakkelu de gi kah eh, <verse eid="DEU 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 17:3" />keheibe de cau mie eh hera kedadung de reca nah penui da keu mie, tingnaimiak, hekei, mede tinggim ga kebam hegidung gede, magede Ih ne aja kai kemak de, <verse eid="DEU 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 17:4" />nah nnuide maha aide ranglia cai, mede nnui aide siulu cai, ciude nnui pie gapte eh tei teune maisia. Magade aide kesang cai, nah cinzwa kemau Israel ga tei kebam de kesang cai, nnui ainzwa tei kerabe. <verse eid="DEU 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 17:5" />Nnui cipau mipei mede mipui de de ngngwa gwang maisia, kemau aide tei kedime de, nnui namdi herieki ga, cipau mipei de mede mipui de de, nah nnui cipau medungde tangtsu le samtset dilu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jos. 20:6, Rut. 4:1</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 17:6" />Mi hangna mede hangcum kemau zierang tei kedi caine tsai bi kerabe de teitsetdi lubui, dede hangge zierang rünne cai pecu teitsetdi kerabe ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Jhn. 8:17, 1 Tim. 5:19, Heb. 10:28</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 17:7" />Zierangme ne keraibe tei eh pecu teitset kerabe, nah pecai mina pelane heba kai zie, nah nnui kakgade kemau keugi dizie.<verse eid="DEU 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tutiak Zai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 17:8" />Magade maha n ziemne tiak kera pa ham kecu gwang cai, daptset kedi tu mede teimau eh teitset kedi, mige mjeu nah kedage mjeu pei, mede mide tei rezam kedi ha tudung, mede ma keda ha ge, nnui namdi rieki lungga kehebwak tudung, ciucai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kelu pe kereca ni ga hanglu maisia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">17:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 21:12-14</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 17:9" />Nnui cingkume da mie maisia, Levi leuhme da, nah tutiakme cau cipau tingdau heta tei bam kela da; nnui penui dade ma keteulu, nah penuine nnui tutiak tei beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 17:10" />Pecai nnui penuine nnuide tei lulo rang kebeu siakte tei zie, RAMPAUBE ne kedet kera heni gade. Penui nnuide ledeu kebeu leune mriak eh teilu. <verse eid="DEU 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 17:11" />Penui nnuide ledeu kebeu hezai de mzailu, nah penui nnuide rang kebeu leune teilu. Penui nnuide rang kebeu de gade nreu tet diso, nzet le mede hile ge. <verse eid="DEU 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 17:12" />Keheibede pezai di eh, cingkupei RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwaga sap kebam peta tei lai kebam sam kingnei mecai, mede tutiakpe sam kingnei mecai, cipau peide tsai dizie; nnui ma kesiabe Israelme dade keu gidi zie. <verse eid="DEU 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 17:13" />Mina leune siu nah ngngi zie, nah pezai kedi teisi lak.<verse eid="DEU 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hegwangpei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 17:14" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kepeu deu ga nnui gwang keludau, nah nnui cide gumlu de nah nnui cika lungh ndeu lude, pecai nnui rang eh, ‘Ih hegwang ge akatei a ziemne kedet luzie, twagwapung kebam heleuh pelane nzwa,’ <verse eid="DEU 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 17:15" />pecai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kerabe de nnuikatei ziemne hegwang kedet bilu. Nnuikatei nnui ziemne hegwang kedetlu nnui leuhme kakgade. Nnui reuga, sangme, nnui leuhme kemakme de kai so. <verse eid="DEU 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 17:16" />Dede pa pekatei peziemne hekwen tei ngkiee lak, mede mina de peu Egypt ga cailigwang dilak iciu eh pa hekwen nküt kieelu kerane, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui dage ranggai, ‘Nnui lampui cide ga madaude cailimie dai lak.’ <verse eid="DEU 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 17:17" />Pa pekatei ziemne pe nau tei kiee lak, iciude pe mlung nreu tetdi melu kerane. Pa rangkang geu nah kecak hekwa kiee lak.<verse eid="DEU 17:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 17:18" />Pa pe hegwangbam ga bam keludau, Levime cingkumedung dwa ga kebam hezai de gade, pekatei ziemne laisiudum ge gage aipau hezai de raulu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 17:19" />Laisiudum aide pe taiga bam maisia, nah pa cide pe teilung zie tane pei zie, iciu eh pa RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang de rütlu kerane, iciulu eh aja kai kebeudung nah hezai sam aidungde pelane mneilu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 17:20" />Pa aide tei maisia iciu eh pe mlungbe pe sinamedung reu hegie helia di melu kerane, nah ciu eh pa nzetle mede hile de, hezai kai kebeudung gade nreu dilak; kedanemene riem pwa kebam pa pe teilung mmi kekiee ge hegwang teilu kerane, pa nah pe name, Israel kakga.<verse eid="DEU 17:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="DEU 18" />
  <para style="s">Cingkume nah Levime ziemne Recadung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 18:1" />Levime cingkumedung, nah Levi leuh pelane, Israelme deu ga pe qwa mede pe magum bam lak; penui RAMPAUBE de kepeu recadung mi le tei kelube de penui magum delie de eh tyeilu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 18:2" />Penui sinamedung kakga penui magum bamlak; RAMPAUBE au penui magum, pa penui dage rang kebeu nzwa.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 10:9</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 18:3" />Mzi aide cingkumedung de peula, ratak tei kegai minadung ne penuide peula, cide hetumseu ge mede meurünna ge lubui: pe bakwak, pe bia kenana, nah pe lungnetdung. <verse eid="DEU 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 18:4" />Nnui gu meitsi raitube, nnui gu zau keheci, nah nnui gu maca, nah meurün mai pet raitube, nnui pecu peu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 18:5" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui leuhme pelane kakgade pecu nah pe namedung de peu RAMPAUBE zi gade sap eh kelungta pe gwa tei kerane kedetlu.<verse eid="DEU 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 18:6" />Magade Levime ge Israel ga pa lungh kebam ni nnui namceudung gade gwang cai, nah pa pe keringria pelane teu RAMPAUBE ne kedet lai kebam ga reca kerane gwang neu lacai, <verse eid="DEU 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 18:7" />iciu cai pa RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang zi gade hegwa tei zie Levime pe siname pelane tei kebam nzwa, RAMPAUBE dwa ga sap kebamme. <verse eid="DEU 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 18:8" />Penui tyei kera qwadung nsam maisia, pe kilungme magum zwa kelu gade ngaukelu de si eh.<verse eid="DEU 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemneu Tadung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 18:9" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu lai eh kebam deu ga gwang lude, nnui cika kebam heleuhdung zai kengkaube mnei so. <verse eid="DEU 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 18:10" />Nnui kakga mi keheibe de pe napei mede pe napui de mi gage ratak tei kecume bam kerabe ma, mi keheibe de reka tah tei mede caiha kerangme, mede hepiak ga marengei kebam de pei lia kelame, mede kehemeu ta keteime, <verse eid="DEU 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 18:11" />hekuhei keteume, keheibe rabedung de qu kelame, mede kehemeu tah tei kelame, mede ketsai rabedung de mpau kelame. <verse eid="DEU 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 18:12" />Kedanemene caugame ma aidungde tei labi penuide RAMPAUBE ngkaula; ma kengkau aidungde ziemne RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui dwa gade penuide gwa gidi zeu da. <verse eid="DEU 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 18:13" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade nnui mci cangsiak kerabe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:48">Mat. 5:48</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Caihakecibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 18:14" />Kedanemene nnui gwadi lai eh kebam heleuhdung de kereka ta nah kereka ciem tei kelame kwa kingnei; dede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide au aide peu tei lak lie zeu.<verse eid="DEU 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 18:15" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui kakgade caihakecime ge de teu cuh beuzie, nnui siname hangge de, Ih kenzwa. Nnui pekwa kingnei bizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mat. 17:5, Mrk. 9:7, Luk. 9:35, Bat. 3:22; 7:37</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 18:16" />Nnui Horeb ga ngkwa kelu benai nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dade aide kiegai, rang eh, ‘Peu anuide RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang kwa kingnei dai tadi lulo, mede aipau miheu kedi de ngaudai tadi lulo, meliecai anui tsai dizie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 5:23-31</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 18:17" />RAMPAUBE a dage rangdi, “Penui kerang de au yi. <verse eid="DEU 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 18:18" />Ih penui ziemne penui siname kakgade caihakecime gede teu cuh luzie, nang nzwa eh. Ih a samdung pecu peu zie, nah pa penui dage Ih sam kai kebeu leune de paubeu zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">18:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bat. 3:2; 7:37</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 18:19" />Keheibe de magade pa a zi gade sam pau kebeudung de kingnei tadi zie liecai, Ih penuide saja peu zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">18:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 3:23">Bat. 3:23</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 18:20" />Dede caihakecime a zi teu ngang kela sam rang kelame, Ih ne ranglo de aja kai kemak sam, mede hera kedadung zi teurang kelabe, cipau caihakecibe de tsai zie.” <verse eid="DEU 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 18:21" />Aide nnui mlung gade rang lu maisia, ‘RAMPAUBE ne sam rang kemak de anui dainzwa cilu zie no?’ <verse eid="DEU 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 18:22" />Caihakecime ge RAMPAUBE zi teu delwe sam pau kecudau, nnui cide RAMPAUBE sam lie de ci luzie. Magade cide gwang kesang mede tei mecai ge, iciu cai cide RAMPAUBE ne rangbeu meda nah cide caihakecibe ngang eh rang dida, nah nnui pecu hing di kerabe ma.<verse eid="DEU 18:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="DEU 19" />
  <para style="s">Kemsiu Namdidung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 19:1" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang heleuhdung de ngkap kedidau, penui deu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide pwapeu lai kebam medung de, nah nnui penui cai gwang kecudau nah penui namdidung nah penui kidung ga lungh keludau, <verse eid="DEU 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 19:2" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum lulo pwapeu kebam nnui deu sum ga nnui namdidung kecum nnuikatei ziemne kedetlu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 19:3" />Nnui lampui teilu nah nnui deu raidung zicum gage nzi gailu, hangdeu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum lulo pwa kepeu de, iciude keheibe de mi kedame de teitset kedime cikage pak gailu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 19:4" />Mige mi kedame de teitsetdi nah cikade pak delwe pekatei pe teilung kelilu zielie kelame ziemne ranglia kegai, mige pe kidabe de ngaurau mene nah teitset zie lie eh mene teitset kedi tingdau ziemne aide marang kelia ge. <verse eid="DEU 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 19:5" />Saulia ge ziemne, magade mige hegung ga pe kidabe de nzang lwe tsing ria zie lie mie, nah pe nreu le tsingbang bi nkau zie lie bi, nah nreu petang gade ngkeu mpet pe kidabe de beu nah pecu teitsetdi, ciucai cipau peide aipau namdidung ket ga pak mie delwe pe teilung kelilu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 19:6" />Iciu meliecai tsai kedibe kum kepeibe teitset kedibe cai gwa mie lubui lu, nah pe rata süt kecu gade pecu gwa mie canglu, magade pe kakbe dizu dicai, pecu dapgai nah pecu teitsetdi, cipau pei de tsaibui meliede, kedanemene gwang kedile pa pe kidabe de ngaurau lama. <verse eid="DEU 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 19:7" />Cine Ih nnuide namdidung kecum nnuikatei ziemne kedet lu kera rang gaila. <verse eid="DEU 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 19:8" />Magade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui raidung de tei mdi beu cai, pa nnui paume dage teibeu zielie rang kebeu nzwa, nah pa nnui paume de peu zielie sampet kebeu hangdeu pelane nnuide peu cai; <verse eid="DEU 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 19:9" />magade nnui aipau ajadung pelane teimzai eh teilu cai, Ih nnuide henai rang kebam de, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de ku kera ajadung nah pe lampui ga tet muilu kera, pecai nnui namdi kecum nnuikatei ziemne kai si bilu, aipau kecum cai de. <verse eid="DEU 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 19:10" />Aide tei lulo iciude RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui magum tei kera nnuide pwa peu kecu hangdeu kakga mina mau kemakme tsaidi lak, iciude ketsai mau gede nnui reu ga gwangdi melu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 19:11" />Dede magade mi keheibe de pe kidabe de ngaurau cai, kenret au cipaude de kwa bam, pecu renia cuhdi, nah pecu rezam di iciu de pa tsai dizie, nah magade pa aipau namdidung ket gage pakgai dicai, <verse eid="DEU 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 19:12" />ciciu eh pe namdi ga hangkiamedung pecu ngngwa gwang kera langgai maisia nah pecu cikade ngngwa gwang daizie, nah pecu tui pwa hekum peei kela kibaume ba gage kai beu dizie, iciu eh pecu teitset di kerane. <verse eid="DEU 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 19:13" />Pecu ngau nggia so; meliene, nnui mi de dapketset aipau de de Israel gade gidi, iciude nnui ziemne ma pelane yi luzie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 35:33-34</char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 19:14" />Nnui nnui kidamedung deurai penui ndaa de kai kemzeu de keugi diso, nnui magum ga, gum lai eh kebam de, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum lulo pwa kepeu deu de ga.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">19:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 27:17, Job. 24:2, Mac. 22:28; 23:10, Hos. 5:10</char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zierangmedung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 19:15" />Mi hangge zierang le mige kemau ziemne mmau di kerabe ma, mede kemau keheibe de, ketsam tsam gade pa mau kedi; mi hangna zierang, mede mi hangcum zierang gade, keta kehei be liede ci mcilu maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 18:16">Mat. 18:16</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 19:16" />Magade migede mmau eh kenret zierang teicuh cai kemau ge pecu mmau eh zierang tei kera. <verse eid="DEU 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 19:17" />Iciucai penai hangnana de, penai kakga ma kehebwakdung kebam, RAMPAUBE dwa ga sap bi zie, cingkume nah tutiakme dwa ga cipau tingdau hegwa tei kebambe. <verse eid="DEU 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 19:18" />Tutiakme cide pekie pie siakte zie; pielo, magade zierang cide kenret zierang lie cai nah pe sinabe dage kenret zierang tei gaidi cai, <verse eid="DEU 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 19:19" />ciucai nnui pe dage tei bi maisia, pa pe sinabe dage tei gai keneu nzwa; nah nnui kemau cide nnui kakgade keu gidi luzie. <verse eid="DEU 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 19:20" />Pecai bang kebamme penui siu nah ngngi dizie, nah cipau ciale de nnui kakga cikenzwa kemau teisi ta dizie. <verse eid="DEU 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 19:21" />Ngau nggiabeu so; keringria ge ziemne keringria ge su zie, miak ge ziemne miak ge, gei ge ziemne gei ge, heba ge ziemne heba ge, hepi ge ziemne hepi ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:38">Mat. 5:38</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 19:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="DEU 20" />
  <para style="s">Hereu ga Kemie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 20:1" />Nnui nnui ngauraume de regi kera tet kepet dau, nah hekündung, bagidung nah minadung nnui swa kieeki kecu ngau keludau, nnui penuide hing diso; kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide ngngwa lalu, pa nnuide Egyptme deu gade ngngwa mpet kebeu be. <verse eid="DEU 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 20:2" />Nnui regi kera lüt lai kecu dwa, cingkupei tetpet maisia nah mina dage rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tut. 20:18-24, 1 Sam. 14:36-42, 2 Hel. 20:13-22</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 20:3" />Pa Israel reugwame dage rang zie, ‘Kingneilu, Israelme, nnui mie hereu ga nnui ngauraume de regi lauda. Nnui mlung peu ceu diso. Nnui ngngi di mede mbeu diso. Penuide hing diso. <verse eid="DEU 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 20:4" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang pane nnuide ngngwa mie zie nnui ziemne nnui ngauraume de regi nah nnuide kelibeu kera.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 20:5" />Kedimedung minadung de mpau nah rangzie, ‘Aika cau peige ki keheci teilwe bamno nah cide tei mci mene? Peu pecu mie nah pe kilung ga cailigwanglu, iciude pa hereu gade tsaidi melu kerane nah kedame ne peki tei mci lak. <verse eid="DEU 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 20:6" />Aika mige kubetsi luh tei lwe petsi rai tyei mene bam ni? Peu pecu kilung miecu, iciu eh peu pecu hereu gade tsai di kelakne nah mipei kedame de peu petsi bui tyei teu dilak kerane.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 19: 23-25</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 20:7" />Aika mige laktak tei kera mipui gede naurang tei nzeu bam dede pecu ngngwalung mene bam reu ni? Peu pecu kilung gwang dilu iciude pecu hereu gade tsai dilak nah mipei kedame ne pecu ngngwa lung teu di melu kerane.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hez. 22:23-24</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 20:8" />Kedimedung minadung de mpau si dai nah rangzie, ‘Aika mige ngngi mede helung ceu eh cau bamno? Peu pecu tetcu nah pe kilung gwang dilu, iciude pe sinamebe mlung peu pe mlung nzwa ceudi melu kerane.’ <verse eid="DEU 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 20:9" />Kedime minadung dage marang cangdi ge, penui penui reu reugwa muibe kedet bi luzie.<verse eid="DEU 20:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 20:10" />Nnui namdi ge gwaketang kera mie kecudau, cipaume de kezuyi bam kera rang beulu. <verse eid="DEU 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 20:11" />Magade penui nnui kepeu de luulu nah penui herieki nnuide ngkei beu cai, cika mina kebam pelane peu nnui ziemne kengküt ta teizie nah nnui gwa teizie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">20:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tut. 1:27-36</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 20:12" />Dede cipau kezuyi nnuide peu mecai, meliene nnuide ngngwa hereu tei neu dicai, ciucai nnui penuide twagwalu maisia, <verse eid="DEU 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 20:13" />nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kengkieng kepeu dau nah peu penuide nnui kangga keludau, nnui namceu ga mina leune de teitsetdi maisia. <verse eid="DEU 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 20:14" />Dede mipui, henamedung, hetum, nah namdi ga maleune kebam, nah penui gu rega kelu pelane, nnuikatei ziemne cidungde luu luzie. Nnui nnui ngauraume gu luulu zie, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide kepeu de. <verse eid="DEU 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 20:15" />Nnui ainzwa eh namdi pelane nnui dade mdei süt kecu cidungde dage teigai maisia, namdidung aipau heleuhdung de gu kemak namdidung. <verse eid="DEU 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 20:16" />Aipau minadung namdidung ga RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum kera pwapeu kebam, nnui ma pelane kenggi keheibe de ngkap ciak dedi. <verse eid="DEU 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 20:17" />Meliene, nnui cidungde ngkap zing dedi maisia. Hittitme, Amoritme, Canaanme, Perizzitme, Hivitme nah Jebusitme, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide aja kai kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 20:18" />Aide teilu ciude penui peu penui rabedung de kereca gade tei kela kemneudung pelane nnuide ledeu kelakne, penui penui rabedung de tei gai kecu nzwa. Magade nnui tei cai, nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage kemau tei gaizie. <verse eid="DEU 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 20:19" />Nnui namdi ge de peting ketie ge cide de tuilu kerane hereu tei eh twagwa keludau, cide nnui tsingbangdung de nreu le cidungde bi diso, nnui namdi de ketiege gwa bam di liede. Kedanemene penui ziemne nnui tyei lubui, cine nnui cidungde bi diso. Kedanemene luh tsingbang de nnui ngauraume ni nnui cidungde tui kera? <verse eid="DEU 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 20:20" />Nnui tsingbang ci kebamdung de tyei kera bangdung kemakbe, nnui ngkapdi nah bi ngkau lubui; nnuide ngngwa hereu ketei namdi dage hereu tei kera bamdung tei zie, cide kaudi kemaktane.<verse eid="DEU 20:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="DEU 21" />
  <para style="s">Dapketset Teimduilukemak ziemne Ratak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 21:1" />Magade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum kera peu kebam deu gage migede teitset nzeu, luh ga kauzeu bam, nah caune pecu teitsetdi bi ci mecai; <verse eid="DEU 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 21:2" />nnui muiteume nah nnui tutiakme tetpet maisia, nah twa kengwa namdi leune teitset kedi peide taiga kebam penui mdet zie. <verse eid="DEU 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 21:3" />Pecai namceu ga muiteume ketsaipau da mnatu medung tumlei pehau gade, ket madaude mata teila kemak ge, nah ngwanggai pungla kemak gede teu mpet luzie. <verse eid="DEU 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 21:4" />Iciu eh penui tumlei de teu langkam dui lwa kebam ga mie maisia, langkam ge luh pu nzeu kemak mede ma ling kemak deu, nah langkam cika de penui tumlei ngwang dang dizie. <verse eid="DEU 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 21:5" />Levi leuhme cingkumedung tet pet maisia, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang penuide pe gwatei kera nah RAMPAUBE zi teu samlambeu kera kedet luda nah penui ne kehebwak leune nah kesia tu tiaklu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 21:6" />Muiteume pelane namdi ketsaipau da mnatume tumlei de langkam gade pengwang dang kenzeu reu gage penui ba ntiak maisia;<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">21:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:24">Mat. 27:24</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 21:7" />nah penui hetu de samkeli eh rang maisia, ‘Anui ba au hejai aide teilwa ma, meliene anui miak ne ngau ma. <verse eid="DEU 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 21:8" />Pecai hangkiamedung kie zie, RAMPAUBO, n mina Israelme, nangne kelikebeube, mau gibeulo, nah n mina Israelme kakga kai diso kemau teikemak be de daptsetkedibe mau de.’ Iciucai penui daptsetkedi mau gi beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 21:9" />Ainzwa eh nnui RAMPAUBE miak gade petaube tei lude, nnui kakgade mide daptset kedi mau de bam tadi luzie.<verse eid="DEU 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mibaang Pui de Laktakkecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 21:10" />Nnui hereu tei kera nnui ngauraume dwaga pet kecudau nah RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang nnuide kengkieng pwapeu eh penuide nnui kang gage kai beu eh, nnui penuide tuilu eh ngngwa tet kecudau, <verse eid="DEU 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 21:11" />magade tuikelume kakgade hezu keyi pui ge la eh nnui ngau cai, nah nnui pecu luuneu eh nnui nau kera nnui lungning dicai, <verse eid="DEU 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 21:12" />ciucai nnui pecu ngngwa nnui ki ga gwanglu; pa pe peu taikwak dizie nah pezurang nceudung bit dizie. <verse eid="DEU 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 21:13" />Pecai pecu tui keludau pe paini kai kela niadung de ra di eh pa nnui ki ga bam dizie nah hekeizie pelane pe pei nah pe pui ziemne hei eh hap zie. Cipaucai nnui pecu luu lubui nah pe nahpei lu nah pa nnui nau dizie. <verse eid="DEU 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 21:14" />Dede magade nnui pecu nca tadi cai, nnui pa tet keneu kehei ga pecu peu tetdi lu. Dede nnui pecu heki rangkang le zwatyei lakzing, nah nnui kilame ge nzwa eh pecu teu lak, kedanemene nnui pecu hengam teidi delu.<verse eid="DEU 21:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 21:15" />Magade mipei ge pe nau hangna bam eh hangge debe ku nah kedage de be mneu cai, nah penai hangnana pecu hena lung beu eh, hangnana pesui kemtingbe pui nah pesui kemakbe pui, magade neraibe pesui kemakbepui na cai, <verse eid="DEU 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 21:16" />pecai cipau mipei de pe napeimedung de pema nzikebeu benai pa gum kenzeu de, pa penau pesui kemtingpui na de pe nau pesui kemakbe na dwa gade pe neraibe tei daulak, pena neraibe kecu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 21:17" />Meliene, pa pe neraibe penau pesui kemakbepui na de mdudie eh pa pema mi keda qwa kena kiee ge pecu peu maisia; kedanemene pe napei cide pepei gu kengkieng pe ndeube; cide pegu da neraibe gu pe mzeu.<verse eid="DEU 21:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kecamlai Napei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 21:18" />Magade mipei ge pena pelung hung nah pe zai kesia ge pepei kwa mede pepui kwa mzailu kemakme, nah cau, penai pecu ledeu beu liede, penai kwa kingneilu mecai; <verse eid="DEU 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 21:19" />iciucai pe pei nah pe pui pecu tuilu nah pecu pe namdi hangkiame nah pe namdi kirieki ga ngngwa gwanglu maisia.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Rut. 4:1-2,15, Amo. 5:10,12,15</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 21:20" />Penai pe namdi ga hangkiamedung dage rang zie, ‘Anai napei aide au pelung hung nah pe zai sia; pa anai sam mzai beu ma; pa ma tyei ci kemtwabe zai pung nah zaukesak kau dida.’ <verse eid="DEU 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 21:21" />Pecai pe namdi ga mipeidung tangtsu le pecu samtsetdi zie; nah nnui nnui kakgade herakesia keu gi dizie. Israel ga mina leune aide tei kedi siu nah ngngi zie.<verse eid="DEU 21:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 21:22" />Magade mipei ge kemau teidi eh ketsai ngau kera pensam dicai nah pecu teitset di, nah nnui pepau tsingbang gage gwak dicai, <verse eid="DEU 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 21:23" />iciucai pepau tsingbang ga cipauziu peu bam diso. Meliene, nnui cipau nai gage pecu kungdi bi maisia;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">21:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ketsaipau hetsia ga gwak kedibe Tinggwang reset teugwang beula kideu ga.</char></note> kedanemene keheibede gwaktset kecume de au Tinggwang reset lalu. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gumlu kera pwa peu kebam deu de tei heradi kelakne aipau aja de mzailu.<verse eid="DEU 21:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="DEU 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 22:1" />Nnui nnui ramme Israelme pei gu hetumseu mede pe meurün ge de pe lampui kemak ga peu pakla kerabe ma nah penui dade mbai di kerabe ma; nnui cidungde de peda ngngwa gwang dai bi beu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 22:2" />Magade n ramme pei Israelme nnui taiga lungh nna melie cai, mede nang pecu ci melie cai, nnui makauna cide n kilung ga ngngwa gwanglu, nah pa peimie kemaktane n taiga kai nzeulu maisia, nah iciu eh nnui cide peda pwagwang dai maisia. <verse eid="DEU 22:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 22:3" />Nnui cinzwa siakte pe gada de de teibeu maisia; nnui pe paini de cinzwa siakte teibeu maisia; nnui cinzwa siakte n ramme pei Israelme gu ma gah kedi leune teu teilu maisia, makeheibe pa tei nggah kedi nah nangne ngau kelube; nnui ngau kemak nzwa diso. <verse eid="DEU 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 22:4" />Nnui nnui ramme pei Israelme gu gada mede pe hetumseu lampuiki ga kaudi eh ngau cai, nnui ngau kemak diso; nnui makauna de peu sap dailu kera pecu ngha beu maisia.<verse eid="DEU 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 22:5" />Mipui ge mipei gu lie kecube nia teulak, nah mipei de mipuidung nia lie kecube teu kerabe ma; kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang cikenzwabe dung tei kelame de ngkau la.<verse eid="DEU 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 22:6" />Magade lampuiki ga nruine ciet nnui dwaga bam cai, tsingbang ge ga mede hangdeu ga, pe name de ngngwa bam eh mede pe bom cika bam eh, nah nruine pui pena reu ga bam mede pe bomdung gum bam cai, nnui nruine pui de pe name de si eh pwateu diso. <verse eid="DEU 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 22:7" />Nnui nruine pui de peu tetlu maisia, dede nnui nnuikatei ziemne pe nadung de pwa lubui. Hezai aide mzailu iciucai nnui lungyi luzie, nah ciude nnui kelungbeting tie luzie.<verse eid="DEU 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 22:8" />Nnui ki keheci ge tei kecudau, nnui nnui kipeu gage pe rie teilu iciu eh nnui nnui ki ga hejai teu gwang melu kerane magade mige cikade cak mie cai.<verse eid="DEU 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 22:9" />Nnui nnui kubeluh gage heleuh ketsam kena gede ling so, iciude nnui heleuh ling kemzeu de nah kubetsiluh petsi bui kebeu de tei heradi melu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 22:10" />Nnui luh puh kerane hetumseu ge penai gada gede keu ncüt so. <verse eid="DEU 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 22:11" />Nnui mamai nah langcimpai dak ncüt kelube pai ba so.<verse eid="DEU 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 22:12" />Nnui nnui nia kai kelabe gage pai kimiak petu mdai de ga nnuikatei peri teilu.<verse eid="DEU 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Laktak Pungpang kecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 22:13" />Samnasam mi ge pe nau ge teilu, nah mipui da lüt nauhepeizai tei, nah cipaucai mipui de ngkaudi, <verse eid="DEU 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 22:14" />nah cipaucai mi kengngam be tadung le pecu mmaudi nah pezi tei kemsia pereu gage kai, nah rang, ‘Ih aipau puide de anau lu, dede Ih petaiga gwang nna kecu dau, Ih pa relei kemcipui lie kecu ngau ma.’ <verse eid="DEU 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 22:15" />Pecai releipui gu pepui nah pepei releipui de relei kemci puige lie kecu keulia kerane namdi rieki ga hangkiamedung de pwalia maisia. <verse eid="DEU 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 22:16" />Releipui pei hangkiamedung de rang maisia, “Ih a napui de aipau peide de pe nau kera ha, nah pa pecu ngkau. <verse eid="DEU 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 22:17" />Pielo, pa pecu mi kengngam tadung tei liede mmau nah rangdi, ‘Ih n napui dade relei kemcipui lie kecu peeilu melie.’ Dede aika a napui releikemcipui lie kecu keulia la.” Pecai penai pai cide namdi ga muiteume dwa gage kam gaizie. <verse eid="DEU 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 22:18" />Cipau namdi hangkiamedung mipeibe de ngngwa lu delwe pecu saja peu maisia; <verse eid="DEU 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 22:19" />nah penui pecu peu rangkanggeu shekel haige<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:19 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu shekel haige: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">renam ga mata keteime ziehi tingbazie haige gu nsam da.</char></note> su zie, nah cide pwa releipui pei de peu dizie, kedanemene mipei be Israel ga releikemci pui zi teimsia kegai ne. Mipui cide pe nau maisia; mipei be pecu langgi daulak pa lungh kela tane. <verse eid="DEU 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 22:20" />Dede ma aide kesang cai, releime ge releikemcipui lie kecu ngaulu mecai, <verse eid="DEU 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 22:21" />iciucai penui releipui de pepei ki kimuiki hegwale ngngwa mpet maisia, nah namdi ga mipeidung ne pecu tangtsu le samtsetdi maisia, kedanemene pa Israel ga hengam ketei ta tei kedine, helipui zai nzwa eh pepei ki gade tei kedine; nah nnui nnui kakgade kemau keumzia dizie. <verse eid="DEU 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 22:22" />Magade mi ge minau keda pui gede nauhepeizai tei eh tuilu cai, penai hangnana tsai bi zie, mipei be mipui be de ngngwa nauhepeizai tei kelabe nah mipui be de; nah nnui Israel gade kemau keugi di maisia.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 8:5">Jhn. 8:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 22:23" />Magade releime ge kemcipuige bam cai, minau rang kenzeu mege, nah mipei kedage pecu ngau lwe namdi ga nauhepeizai teidicai, <verse eid="DEU 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 22:24" />penai hangnana de namdi rieki ga ngngwa gwanglu, nah penaide tangtsu le samtsetdi. Nnui releime gede sam zie, kedanemene pa kengha kie gai ma, pa namdi ga bam liede. Nnui mipei de sam zie, kedanemene pa pe kidabe nau de tei msia kecu ziemne; nah nnui nnui kakgade kemau keumzia dizie.<verse eid="DEU 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 22:25" />Dede magade mi ge minau rang kenzeu relei mege heluh gade ngau cai, nah magade pa releipui de tuilu nah peda nauhepeizai tei, ciucai nauhepeizai relei me ge da tei kegai mipeibe de rünne tsai zie. <verse eid="DEU 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 22:26" />Dede releime da nang magede teilak; relei pui da kemau ziehi pwapeu kera bam ma. Kedanemene makie aide au mige pe kidame gede gwaketang eh pecu teitset kedi nzwa lie. <verse eid="DEU 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 22:27" />Kedanemene pa pecu luh gade ngaulu; minau rang kenzeu pui kengha kie eh sagai, dede migede pecu kelibeu kera bam ma.<verse eid="DEU 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 22:28" />Magade mi ge releime ge kemcipuige de ngau dede pa minau rang kenzeu puige mecai, nah magade mipeibe releipuide nimlwe nauhepeizai teidicai, nah magade penaide cilu cai, <verse eid="DEU 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 22:29" />ge pecu ngngwa nauhepeizai tei kedibe pei rangkanggeu shekel riakngei<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rangkanggeu shekel riakngei: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">renam ga mata keteime ziehi tingbazie riakngei gu nsam da.</char></note> releipui pei de peuzie, nah pa pe nau di maisia, kedanemene pa pecu tei msia di delu. Pa lungh kela tane pecu langgi gailak.<verse eid="DEU 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 22:30" />Mi ge pepei nau<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">22:30 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pepei nau: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pe pui puinu.</char></note> de pegu tei daulak; pa pepei nautak mzeudung de gikah daulak.<verse eid="DEU 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="DEU 23" />
  <para style="s">Hemaabe gade Keumpet kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 23:1" />Mi keheibede pe bom tei kedi gade mede dang mpet kedi gade rezam kedime RAMPAUBE gu mina maa ga nlüt gailak.<verse eid="DEU 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 23:2" />Hekakna RAMPAUBE gu minadung maa ga ncüt lak; pe leuhme ceheu kereibe ga kecang de, penui migede RAMPAUBE gu mina maa ga ncüt gailak.<verse eid="DEU 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 23:3" />Ammonme ge mede Moabme RAMPAUBE gu mina maa ga ncüt gailak;<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:3 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 19:30-38</char></note> pe leuhme ceheu kereibe kecang gade, penui migede RAMPAUBE gu mina maa ga ncüt gailak. <verse eid="DEU 23:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 23:4" />Aide nnui Egypt gade mpet kecudau penui tangku nah dui pwalwe nnuide lampui gade dau kemak ziemne,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Neh. 13:1-2</char></note> nah penui Beor napei Balaam de, Aram Naharaim lungga Pethor<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Pethor: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pethor namdi Mesopotamia cuikui ga.</char></note> gade nnuide reset kerane li kegai ziemne. <verse eid="DEU 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 23:5" />Dede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang Balaam kwa kingnei ma; meliene, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang reset teu nnui ziemne samlam ge teibeu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide ku kecune.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 23:7; 24:9</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 23:6" />Nnui penui kezuyi mede lungh keyi madaude peei kerabe ma, nnui lungh kebam ting pelane ga.<verse eid="DEU 23:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 23:7" />Nnui Edomme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:7 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Edomme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Esau leuh gade lunggwang, Edom de de qula (Ken. 36:1), Jacob sinabe, Israelmedung paume.</char></note> de gi diso bi, kedanemene pa nnui sinabe lu; nnui Egyptme ge de nneu so, kedanemene nang sangme ge tei eh pe deu ga lungh. <verse eid="DEU 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 23:8" />Ceheu kecumbe ga penui leuhme Edomme nah Egyptme dade hena lung kelube RAMPAUBE gu minadung maa ga ncüt lubui.<verse eid="DEU 23:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ramzeuki ga Mcikemak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 23:9" />Nnui reugwame ge tei eh nnui ngauraume de regi kera tet kepet dau, iciu kecudau nnui nnui katei de heradi kerabe leune gade ketiplu maisia. <verse eid="DEU 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 23:10" />Magade nnui kakga mi keheibe de mci kemakme ge tingmui dau tei kedi ziemne bam cai, ciucai pa reugwame ramzeuki gade mpetdi maisia; pa ramzeuki ga cailigwang dai daulak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:10 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 15:16-17</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 23:11" />Tinghegi di sangne, pa pekatei pecu duipia di maisia; tingnaimiak kenlüt dau, pa ramzeuki lung ga gwang dai luzie. <verse eid="DEU 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 23:12" />Nnui mie bam kerane ramzeuki gwale de heni ge bam maisia; <verse eid="DEU 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 23:13" />nah nnui mata keu teicu niadung kakga ma kui kera ge la zie; nnui keukei mie nnui katei de tei mcang kecudau, nnui cide le kuilu maisia nah pecai tangdei keupwa cide met dilu n dade kempet de. <verse eid="DEU 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 23:14" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu ngkienglu kerane nah ngauraume de nnui ba gage kaibeu kerane nnui ramzeuki kakga tet la. Ciziemne nnui ramzeuki mci bam lu maisia, iciude pa nnui kakga mcikemak magede de ngau melu kerane nah nnui dade nreu tetdi melu kerane.<verse eid="DEU 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezai Kedadung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 23:15" />Nnui kilame ge pe mpaube dade pak tetdi kecume ge pe mpaube da ngngwa gwang dai beu kerabe ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 23:16" />Peu pecu ntai ga lunghlu, pa ne kedet kecube namceu keheibe ga. Pecu teikeherei so.<verse eid="DEU 23:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 23:17" />Israelme mipui mede mipei kerecaki helipui mede helipei tei kerabe ma.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 Heg. 14:24, Hos. 4:14, Amo 2:7</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 23:18" />Nnui helipui gu ziehidung mede recaki helipei ziehidung keheibe sampet ziemne RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ki ga keugwang so; kedanemene aipau kena de au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ngkaula kecu ziemne.<verse eid="DEU 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 23:19" />Nnui releu beuso pekai keteibe nui zangme Israelme dage, peusa gu pekai, taktyei gu pekai, mede keheibe pekai tei eh releu beu kedi. <verse eid="DEU 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 23:20" />Nnui sangme dage pekai tei eh releu beu lubui; dede nnui zangme Israelme de au pekai tei eh releu beuso, iciu de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide samlam beu lubui n ba kekai leune ga, nang hangdeu gumlai eh kebam ga.<verse eid="DEU 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 23:21" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage sampet kecu dau, nnui pegwa tei kecu ga mneu di mene tei maisia, kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang cide n dade luu bizie; cide tei kemak au kemau ge dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:33">Mat. 5:33</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 23:22" />Dede magade nnui sampet kecu gade ketip luzie cai, cide n ziemne kemau ge ma. <verse eid="DEU 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 23:23" />Nnui muileudung gade mpet kedi au nang pie delwe teilu maisia; RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang da, nnui sampet kenzeu nzwa, keheibe de nnui nnui mui gade nzaha eh sampet gai kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 23:24" />Nnui nnui kidabe gu kubetsi luh ga lüt kecudau, nnui kubetsi tyei keneu kiee ge tyei lubui, dede nnui gu raptui gage made kaiso. <verse eid="DEU 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 23:25" />Nnui nnui kidabe gu herei meu kecu luh ga mie kecudau, nnui herei peudung nnui ba le kiak lubui, dede nnui kidabe gu herei meu kecuga tangkane le get so.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:1">Mat. 12:1</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 23:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="DEU 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 24:1" />Mipei ge mipui ge de luulu nah penau luge, pecu pa pesui tadi cai, pa pe dade ma kesa pesui kemak be ngau kedine, ciude pa nauta laisiu raulu zie, cide pe ba gage peu zie, nah pe ki gade pecu langgi dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mat. 5:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 24:2" />Pa pe ki gade mpet kecu dau, pa tet eh mi keda peige nau di lubui. <verse eid="DEU 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 24:3" />Magade pe nahpei pekenabe pecu ngkau nah pecu nauta laisiu raugai, cide pe ba gage peu, nah pe ki gade pecu langgi di cai; mede pecu pe naulu kerane ngngwa kelube, pe nahpei pekenabe pecu luulu delwe tsaidi cai, <verse eid="DEU 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 24:4" />ciucai pecu langgi kedi pe nahpei keraibe de, pecu pe nau dailu kerane luu dailak; pa hera kedi caine, kedanemene cide RAMPAUBE kengkau ge zielu. Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gumlu kera peu lai kebam deu gade nnui kemau cikenzwa be tei lak. <verse eid="DEU 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 24:5" />Mipei ge pe nau keheci tei keludau, pa reugwame de ngngwa hereu ga mie lak, mede pecu peu lang ketang kecu ta tei lak; pa mmi ge ziemne kilung ga mtak zie nah pa luu kelu pe nau suiyi tei zie.<verse eid="DEU 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 24:6" />Migede hepa mede tsuniakkang le teu bamdo diso, kedanemene cide au mige teilung teu eh bamdo ketei ge di zielu.<verse eid="DEU 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 24:7" />Magade mige Israelme kakgade pe sinamedung keheibede tui eh, nah hebaangme nzwa tei nah pecu zwa kecu ngaulu cai, cipau kerega be tsaizie; nah nnui nnui kakgade kemau de keu mpet dizie. <verse eid="DEU 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 24:8" />Kempa mateei keteei de ziemne nnui mriaksütlu, iciu eh nnuide cingkume, Levime, ne ledeu kebeu keledeu samdung leune pie sünne eh nnui teilu bi kerane; Ih penui dage rang kebeu de, nnuide tei mzai zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 13:47-59</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 24:9" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui Egypt gade gwang keladau Miriam dage daipai teigai bi nsung lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 12:10-15</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 24:10" />Nang n kidabe de ma keheibe releu kebeu dau, nang pa bamdo beu kera pai de keu kera pe ki ga lüt so. <verse eid="DEU 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 24:11" />Nang hegwale kwa luzie, nah nang ma releu kebeube de ndage bamdo de hegwale teugwang beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 24:12" />Magade pa ma gah kecume ge cai, nang pa bamdo kenzeu de n mabam gage kai eh zeu so.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nda ge ncwa de peziuziu kainzeu diso.</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 24:13" />Nang pecu bamdo kenzeu de peu caili bi dilu tingnaimiak kenlüt dau ge, ciude pa pe pai de ba eh ziplu kerane nah ncu samlam beuzie; RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade n ziemne cide petau luzie. <verse eid="DEU 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 24:14" />Nnui ma gah nah keherei eh liteu kela kilame suisiet teiso, pa nnui zangme Israelme mede sangme ge nnui namdi riekidung nnui deu ga lungh kebamme ge liede. <verse eid="DEU 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 24:15" />Nnui tingba ramsangne pecu pe ziehi peu dilu; aide tei mci mene peu tingnaimiak de nlüt diso, kedanemene pa au ma gah nah cide ngaulu kerane peei lalu. Aide teilu, ciude pa nnuide mmau eh RAMPAUBE dage hap gai lak kerane, nah ciu eh cide nnui tei kedi kemau melu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">24:15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:8">Mat. 20:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 24:16" />Pe name kemau tei kedi ziemne puipeime de teitsetdi lak, mede penui puipei kemau tei kedi ziemne penui name de de teitsetdi lak. Meliene, migede pekatei pe mau ziemne teitsetdi zie. <verse eid="DEU 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 24:17" />Sangme mede nggiana de penui qwa be mzeu de ketang eh nnui keu gidi kera bata tei so, nah hemipui ge painidung teu samkak tei so. <verse eid="DEU 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 24:18" />Meliene, nnui Egypt ga nnui hebaang tei kecu nah cika de RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide lung mpet kebeu nsung lulo. Cine Ih nnuide aja aidungde mzai lulo peula. <verse eid="DEU 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 24:19" />Nnui nnui luh gade ciu pwa hekwa kecudau nnui rumkelu mei omer ge luh gage nsungta gai dicai, nnui cide ziemne caili mie so; cide sangme ziemne, nggiana ziemne, mede hemipui ziemne gi nzeu zie, ciude RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui ma keheibe ketei leune gage samlam beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 24:20" />Nnui olive bang kecui kecudau, nnui pe kiak ga cailigwang dai so; cidungde sangme ziemne, nggiana ziemne, nah hemipuidung ziemne. <verse eid="DEU 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 24:21" />Nnui kubeluh gade kubetsi hekwa keludau, nnui mie hekwa dai so. Bang kenzeu dungde au sangme ziemne, nggiana ziemne, nah hemipui ziemne. <verse eid="DEU 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 24:22" />Nnui Egypt deudi ga hebaang tei kecu de nnui nsung bi lulo; ciziemne Ih nnuide aja aide mzai lulo ranggai la.<verse eid="DEU 24:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="DEU 25" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 25:1" />Magade mi hangna kakga ngngwa sia bam eh, penai hetuketiak bam ga gwang cai, nah tutiakme penai hetutiak cai, ciude penui kemzuibe de mzui lie zie nah kesiabe de mmau zie. <verse eid="DEU 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 25:2" />Magade kemaube pei de de dap ra tau di cai, tutiakbe pecu peu nkum luzie nah peu pe dwa gade pecu dap zie, pe mau rehi gade dap kera kieege dap zie. <verse eid="DEU 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 25:3" />Tutiakbe pecu pia riakdai kenzwa ge dap lubui, dede ci swa kiee si dilak; kedanemene tutiakbe cipau nreu kiee si dicai nah pecu dap kiee reu dicai, iciucai nnui zangme Israelme de hengam tei dizie nnui miak dwade.<verse eid="DEU 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 25:4" />Nnui hetumseu gede ngngwa mei neu kebam dau pemui kang lak.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">1 cor. 9:9</char></note><verse eid="DEU 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 25:5" />Magade sina hangna ngngwa lung ncüt bam ge hang ge pena lungh mene tsai dicai, iciucai tsai kedi be pei nau de peu pe kibaume kemak keda de luu lak. Meliene, pe nahpei sinabe pei pecu pe nau kera pe nsam da, nah pe sinabe pei tei kera nsam de pe dage tei kerabe da. <verse eid="DEU 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 25:6" />Cinzwa tei kelude peu penai neraibe peu tsai kedibe pei na teilu kerane, iciu eh Israel ga pe zi tei nggah melu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 25:7" />Dede magade mi ge pekatei ziemne pe sinabe pei nau de luu neu tadi cai, ciucai pe sinabe pei nau de hangkiame da herieki ga mie lwe rang zie, ‘A nahpei sinabe pe sinabe ziemne Israelme kakga pe leuh peu mei dida; pa adage pe sinabe tah tei kera de tei lak.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 25:8" />Pecai pe namdi ga hangkiamedung pecu qu lwe pe dage marang zie. Dede magade pa lak lie eh, ‘Ih pecu luupwa a nau neu ma,’ de eh rang di cai. <verse eid="DEU 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 25:9" />Pecai pe sinabe pei nau hangkiamedung dwa ga peda hanglwe, pe sinabe pei gu picum pe pi gade lwaklu, nah pe zu gage mcai msui lwa zie. Pa pe dage samkeli eh rang maisia, ‘Pe sinabe leuh peu rau kedibe de ainzwa eh teila da.’ <verse eid="DEU 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 25:10" />Israel ga pe zi de, ‘Pe picum lwak kedibe kime lie qu dizie.’<verse eid="DEU 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 25:11" />Magade mipei hangna nggi bam eh pecu tui kelame ba gade hangge nau pe nahpei de ngha kera pet, nah magade pa peba hwa mpet lwe keda pei bom sang herak cai, <verse eid="DEU 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 25:12" />ciucai nnui pe ba dang dilu; nnui miak gade pecu ngau nggia so.<verse eid="DEU 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 25:13" />Nnui nnui loko ma perüt ketsam tsam bam so, kedi mede keceu. <verse eid="DEU 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 25:14" />Nnui ma mdet kecu nnui kilung ga ketsamtsam bam so, kedi ge nah keceu ge. <verse eid="DEU 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 25:15" />Perüt kesangbe nnui da bamlu; pe mdet kesangbe nnui da bamlu, iciude nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu lai eh kebam deu ga teilung ketie ge lungh luzie.<verse eid="DEU 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 25:16" />Caudung ge cinzwa tei labi, samsang mene tei kela leune, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang penuide ngau ngkaula.<verse eid="DEU 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 25:17" />Nnui Egypt gade mpet keladau Amalekme nnui dage lampui ga daipai tei bi nsung lulo, <verse eid="DEU 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 25:18" />nnui dainzwa penuide lampuiki gade redau bi nah nnui cai le bie kela mede ketang, pe cai le bie kelame kemnei medung de, nnui nzeu hereu eh leu keladau; penui Tinggwang de herüt peu luma. <verse eid="DEU 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 25:19" />Ciziemne, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide nnui ngauraume pelane twagwa pung kebam gade kemtak kepeu dau, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gumlu kera pwapeu kebam deu gade, nnui Amalekme pelane de teitset dilu, iciude migede penuide nsungbam kelak ne kideu leune gade.<verse eid="DEU 25:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="DEU 26" />
  <para style="s">Meitsi Keraibe nah Kereizige</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 26:1" />Nnui hangdeu RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide gum kera peu lai eh kebam dega gwang cang keludau, nah nnui cide gumlu nah cika lungh lu keludau, <verse eid="DEU 26:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 26:2" />cidau RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide hangdeu peu kebam gade nnui mei ngau raitu kelu pelane gade kesa keulu maisia. Nnui cide raptui ge gage kailu nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne kedet kera pe kereca ni ga miecu. <verse eid="DEU 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 26:3" />Cipau tingdau cingku tei kebam be da mie maisia nah pecu rang beulu, ‘Ih henai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dage anuide peu zie lie anui paume de sampet kebeu deu ga nlüt lu delie kecu lia gaila.’ <verse eid="DEU 26:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 26:4" />Cingkupei raptui de n ba gade pwalu maisia nah cide RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang recabam dwa gage kailu zie. <verse eid="DEU 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 26:5" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gage ranglu maisia, “A paume au hui rwakela Aramme<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Hui rwakela Aramme: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">A paume au kengkap Aramme. Pa au Jacob da.</char></note> ge. Pa Egypt ga nghung lu delwe cika bamdi, nah pe leuhme mina kecam nage. Cikade pa heleuh kedi, kengkieng nah kiee pet kelu leuh ge teidi. <verse eid="DEU 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 26:6" />Egyptme anui dade sia süt nah anuide teikeherei. Penui peu anuide kilame tadung tei di.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 1:8-14</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 26:7" />Anui RAMPAUBE anui paume Tinggwang dage kengha sah gai, nah pa anui kwa kingnei lu nah anui rei kebam, anui heta tei kecu nah anui lung keherei kedi ngaulu. <verse eid="DEU 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 26:8" />RAMPAUBE pe ba kengkieng, peba hetwapet delwe, ngauhing süt kecudung, marengeidung, nah mimakecang batadung tei eh Egypt gade anui de ngngwa mpetlu; <verse eid="DEU 26:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 26:9" />nah pa anuide aipau ni gage ngngwa gwang gaibeu nah aipau deu de anuide peu, hangdeu de tungdui nah heliadui<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tungdui nah heliadui: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hangdeu kehei nah keyi.</char></note> lwa eh kebam. <verse eid="DEU 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 26:10" />Cu pielo, Ih a luhlüt kideu gade ngau kelube raitube, RAMPAUBE nang ne kepeu de teu gwangla.” Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gage kailu delwe pecu reca lu maisia; <verse eid="DEU 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 26:11" />nah nnui suiyi lu maisia makeyi pelane gade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui ziemne tei kegai ga, nnui kilungme ziemne, nang, nah Levime nah sangme nnui kakga lungh kebamme de.<verse eid="DEU 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 26:12" />Nnui luhlüt gu kereizige pelane de mmi pekecum bekum peu cang kedidau, cide kereizige kai cube mmi, ciulude nnui Levime, sangme, pepei kegahme nah hemipui dage cide peulu maisia, iciude penui nnui namdi heriekidung lung gade tyeilu nah puilu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 26:13" />Pecai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade nnui rang maisia, “Ih a kilung gade kereizige kemci mapeu keu mpet luda, nah Levime, sangme, pepei kegahme nah hemipui de peu dida, nang ajadung acu kai kebeu nzwa. Ih ngu ajadung keheibe de tei twa kedi tei ma, nah Ih cidungde de nsungta dima. <verse eid="DEU 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 26:14" />Ih hei eh hap kebam dau cide magede tyei ma, mede Ih mci kemak dau cide magage de kai dima, mede cide Ih kette teu eh ketsai de herüt peu dima. Ih RAMPAUBE a Tinggwang kwa kingnei luda; Ih nang tei lulo aja kai kebeu de mzai ciak luda.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">26:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 19:11,14</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 26:15" />Nang lungh kebam kemci ni gade pie ngkei gailo, tinggim gade, nah n mina Israelme de samlam beulo, nah nang kideu anuide kepeu de, nang anui paume dage sampet kai kebeu nzwa, hangdeu tungdui nah heliadui le lwa kebam.”<verse eid="DEU 26:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Rampaube Samdung Mzuilu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 26:16" />Henai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide aipau zaidung de nah zaisiedung mzai lulo aja kaila; ciziemne nnui cidungde mzailu zie nah nnui mlung pelane nah nnui keringria pelane teu tei luzie. <verse eid="DEU 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 26:17" />Nnui henai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang lie kecu nnui sam pet luda, nah pe lampui ga nnui tet zielie nah pe zai mzai, pe ajadung nah pegu hezaidung, nah nnui pe kwa kingnei kera. <verse eid="DEU 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 26:18" />Henai RAMPAUBE nnui mina de pwa pe mabam lie de eh rang ndugai da, pa nnui da pe sam pet kebeu nzwa eh; nah pe ajadung nnui pelane mzai kera be, <verse eid="DEU 26:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 26:19" />nah pa ne tei kegai heleuh kedadung reu nnuide tei cehu beuzie, nah nnui hetwa, kenlang nah herüt ngau luzie. Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne heleuh keu ntsam kelu ge, pa rang kebeu nzwa.”<verse eid="DEU 26:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="DEU 27" />
  <para style="s">Ebal Deutu ga Recabam</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 27:1" />Moses nah Israel ga hangkiamedung minadung dage aja kai nah rangdi, “Henai Ih nnuide tei lulo aja kai kebeudung de tei mzailu. <verse eid="DEU 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 27:2" />Cidau nnui Jordan reu kahlwe RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide peu lai eh kebam deu ga gwang kelu benai, nnui tangtsu kedige kesa sumlu nah keheniak nia le cidungde keniakdi. <verse eid="DEU 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 27:3" />Nnui tet kahkegwang dau nnui cidung reu gage aipau hezai gu samdung pelane raulu; ci nzwa eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide peu lai eh kebam deu ga mielu kerane, tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu ga, RAMPAUBE nnui paumedung Tinggwang, nnui dage sampet kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 27:4" />Nnui Jordan reu kah keludau, Ih henai nnuide tei lulo rang kebeu nzwa tangtsu aidungde sumlu, Ebal Deutu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ebal Deutu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel deudi kideutuh ga, kilometer riakdai heset Jerusalem tingpeule bie, Shechem namdi taiga.</char></note> reu gage, nah keheniak nia le cidungde keniaklu. <verse eid="DEU 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 27:5" />Cika RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ziemne nnui recabam teilu, tangtsudung le teikelu recabam; dede nnui tangtsudung hegeu nia le keu heta tei lak. <verse eid="DEU 27:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 27:6" />Nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang recabam tangtsudung pang kemak be le teilu; nnui cikage keru ratakdung RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de pwapeulu, <verse eid="DEU 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 27:7" />nah nnui kangbau ratakdung tei zie nah cikade tyei zie; nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gade nnui suiyi zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 20:30, Lev 3:1-17</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 27:8" />Nnui tangtsudung reu gage aipau hezai samdung pelane rau mcigi luzie.”<verse eid="DEU 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ebal Deutu gade Resetdung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 27:9" />Moses nah Levime cingkumedung, Israelme pelane de mpau eh rangdi, “Zing delu nah kingnei lu, Israelme: Henai nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang gu minadung tei dida. <verse eid="DEU 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 27:10" />Ciziemne nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa de mzailu nah hezai kai kebeubedung nah pe ajadung mzailu Ih henai nnui dage tei lulo rang kebeudung de.”<verse eid="DEU 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 27:11" />Moses cipau benai minadung dage aja kai eh rangdi, <verse eid="DEU 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 27:12" />“Nnui Jordan reuki kahgwang lu caine aipau leuhdung Gerizim Deutu ga saplu maisia minadung de samlam beu kerane: Simeon, Levi, Judah, Issachar, Joseph, nah Benjamin. <verse eid="DEU 27:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 27:13" />Heleuh aipaudung de Ebal Deutu ga sapzie reset samdung rangbeu kera: Reuben, Gad, Asher, Zebulun, Dan, nah Naphtali. <verse eid="DEU 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 27:14" />Levime samkeli zie nah Israel minadung leune dage sahbak eh rang zie:<verse eid="DEU 27:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 27:15" />‘Keheibe de mamie reki mede tei kegaibe, RAMPAUBE ngkau kela, hebaciem keyime badung bata, nah cide ngkim eh tei kegaibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Minadung pelane: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ebal Deutu ga heleuh herok rünne ma, Israel leuhmedung kereiekena pelane. Hez. 4:16; 9:12,16; 5:8, Tet. 20:4</char></note> samli peu eh ‘Amen’ rangzie.<verse eid="DEU 27:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 27:16" />‘Pepei mede pepui de rütla kemakme keheibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rangzie.<verse eid="DEU 27:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 27:17" />‘Keheibe de pe kidabe deurai keumzia kedibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<verse eid="DEU 27:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 27:18" />‘Keheibe de miakcitme gede lampui kemak lege ngngwa kegaibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:18 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 19:14</char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 27:19" />‘Keheibe de sangme, pepei kegahme, mede hemipui ge kecune penui mzeu tei nggah kedime de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<verse eid="DEU 27:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 27:20" />‘Keheibe de pepei nau de ngngwa ngkop kedime de reset punglu, kedanemene pane pepei nzeudung keu kedine.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<verse eid="DEU 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 27:21" />‘Mige makaune keheibe de ngngwa mmha kecume de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:21 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 18:23; 20:15</char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 27:22" />‘Keheibe de pe tipui de, pepei napui de, mede pepui napui de ngngwa ngkop kedibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 18:9; 20:17</char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 27:23" />‘Keheibe de pe nau pui de ngngwa ngkop kedibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Lev. 18:8; 20:14</char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 27:24" />‘Keheibe de ngkim eh pe kidabe de teitset kedibe de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<verse eid="DEU 27:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 27:25" />‘Keheibe de kemau tei kemakme gede teitset zie lie hetau henim luu teu kelume de peu reset punglu’. Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tet. 23:6-8</char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 27:26" />‘Keheibe de aipau hezai samdung penui cidungde mzai lu zie lie kemakme de peu reset punglu.’ Pecai minadung pelane ‘Amen’ de rang zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27:26 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Gal. 3:10</char></note><verse eid="DEU 27:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="DEU 28" />
  <para style="s">Samzai Samlamdung</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 28:1" />Magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingnei teune lu eh henai Ih nnui dage tei lulo kebeu pe ajadung mzailu liecai, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide kideu ga heleuh keda pelane reu tei cehu beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 28:2" />Samlam aidung pelane nnui da gwang zie nah nnuide gwaka luzie, magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingnei lucai. <verse eid="DEU 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 28:3" />Namdi ga nnui samlam kepungme tei zie, nah luh ga nnui samlam kepungme teizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 28:4" />Nnui pumteih tsi samlam kepungme teizie, nah nnui hangdeu tsi, nah nnui kaunedung tsi, hetum nah meuründung kiee luzie, nah nnui kauruine na liede.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:42">Luk. 1:42</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 28:5" />Nnui gu raptui nah nnui tangkwa samlam kepung tei zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 28:6" />Nnui tet nlüt kecudau samlam kepungme tei zie, nah nnui tet kempet kecudau nnui samlam kepungme tei zie.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">“kilung ga nah mata tei kela gade,” mede “teilung pelane ga liede.”</char></note><verse eid="DEU 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 28:7" />Nnui ngauraume nnuide renia cuh kecume de nnui dwa gade RAMPAUBE ne ngam dizie; penui lampui ge gade nnuide renia zie lie eh gwang zie dede nnui dwa gade lampui hena dung gage pak gai dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 28:8" />RAMPAUBE nnui reuga nnui ciukidung ga samlam beu kera rang beuzie nah nnui bata tei kegai leune ga; pa nnuide ha lai eh kebam deu gade nnuide samlam beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 28:9" />RAMPAUBE nnuide pe ziemne kedet ntsam kelu pe minadung tei luzie, pa nnui dage sampet tei kebeu nzwa, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang gu hezaidung mzai lucai nah pe lampuidung ga tet lacai. <verse eid="DEU 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 28:10" />Kideu ga heleuh pelane nnuide RAMPAUBE zi gade qu kelumedung ngau luzie, nah penui nnuide hing zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 28:11" />RAMPAUBE nnuide nalung keyi, nnui ketumhau nah meurün keyi, nnui meitsi keyi, pa nnui paumedung dage nnuide peu zie lie sampet kebeu deu de gade peu zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 28:12" />RAMPAUBE pe tinggimdung kehekwaki ngkei beuzie peting siak dau nnui deu ziemne tingrui langgai beu kera, nah nnui bata leune samlam beu kera; nnui heleuhdung kekiee dage releu beu luzie, dede nnui au hepuk lak. <verse eid="DEU 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 28:13" />RAMPAUBE nnuide mi caisuime mene muiteube tei beu zie; nnui au pesing ga mene pereu ga rünne bam zie, nnui magade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang hezaidung Ih ne henai nnui dage tei lulo rang kebeu de kingnei lucai, ci nzwa eh cidungde mnei nah tei eh, <verse eid="DEU 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 28:14" />nah magade Ih henai nnui dage sam kai kebam gade nnui nreu tetdi mecai, zetle ge mede hile ge, cinzwa eh hera kedadung caisui eh penui gwa tei kerane.<verse eid="DEU 28:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 28:15" />Dede nnui magade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingnei lu tadi cai, pe gu hezaidung pelane nah pe samdung Ih henai nnuide tei lulo rang kebeu de teilu mecai, cinzwa cai reset aidung pelane nnui da gwang zie nah nnuide gwaka dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 28:16" />Namdi ga nnuide reset zie, nah luh ga nnuide reset zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 28:17" />Nnui gu raptui nah tangkwa reset pung dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 28:18" />Nnui name reset pungzie, nnui meitsi keyi, nnui ketumhau, nah meurünhau na reset pung zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 28:19" />Nnui tet nlüt kecudau de reset pungzie, nah nnui tet kempet kecudau de reset pungzie.<verse eid="DEU 28:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 28:20" />RAMPAUBE nnui reuga resetdung langgai zie, kehebwak, nah nnui ba kekai leune ga hesiu gaizie, nnuide tei ngkap di kemaktane, nah nnui ngkap zette di kemaktane kedanemene nnui kesia tadung cidungde ziemne nnui acu mlai kedine. <verse eid="DEU 28:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 28:21" />Nnui gumlu lai eh kebam deu gade pa nnuide teingkap di kemaktane RAMPAUBE peu rapia cide nnui da bamzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 28:22" />RAMPAUBE lie kela mateeidung le nnuide ketang zie, kemra le, mma kecu le, nah herakum kum<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">28:22 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Herakum kum: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kingtie.</char></note> kecu nah tinglum süt kecu le, nah tingkai kelumdung nah hemwa mau pu kecu le. Aidungde nnui tsaidi kemaktane nnuide zui lazie. <verse eid="DEU 28:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 28:23" />Nnui peu reuga kebam tingkamdung au hetageu nzwa zie, nah nnui kangga kebam hangdeu au hegeu nzwa zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 28:24" />RAMPAUBE nnui deu ga tingrui de mamüt nah rebui tei dizie; tinggimdung gade cide nnui reu ga hung zie, nnuide tei ngkap di kemaktane.<verse eid="DEU 28:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 28:25" />RAMPAUBE peu nnui ngauraume dwa gade nnuide ngkieng lulak; nnui lampui ge gade penuide renia kera tetpet zie dede penui dwa gade lampui henadung gage pak gai zie. Nnui au kideu ga hegwangram pelane ziemne kehing ge dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 28:26" />Nnui gu ketsai paau au tinggim ruinedung nah kideu kaunedung gu taktyei dizie; penuide keheu eh gwa gidi kera migede bam lak. <verse eid="DEU 28:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 28:27" />RAMPAUBE Egyptme gu reteei de le nnuide ketang zie nah nnui geu majamdung le, mateei le, nah kencak, nnui cidungde gade yilu gailak. <verse eid="DEU 28:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 28:28" />RAMPAUBE nnuide peusui kegah le, miakcit kecu le, nah peusui kehebwak le ketang zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 28:29" />Nnui tingkeba daude kemiet la dizie miakcitme ge kemui ga kemiet kela nzwa, nah nnui lampuidung ga nnui yi eh gwang lak; nnuide teikeherei nah süt teudi muizie, nah migede nnuide kelilu kera bam lak. <verse eid="DEU 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 28:30" />Mipuige de n nau rangpwa bam zie, dede kedabe pei ne pecu nim lwe teu dizie. Nnui ki tei luzie dede nnui cika lungh lak; nnui kubetsi luh tei zie dede nnui pe tsi rai tyei lak. <verse eid="DEU 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 28:31" />Nnui tumseu de nnui miakdwa gade gi zie, dede nnui cipau tei de tyei lak; nnui dwa gade nnui gada de teu kerei tet dizie nah cide nnuide peu dai lak. Nnui meurün nnui ngauraumedung de peu dizie, nah nnuide migede ngha beu kera bam lak. <verse eid="DEU 28:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 28:32" />Nnui napeidung nah nnui napuidung de sangme de peu dizie kilame nzwa; nnui miak penuide tingba pelane peei zie, dede penuide ngaulu neu kebam de ngaulu ta dizie. Nnui ba ga kengkieng gah dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 28:33" />Nnui deu gade ta kenzeu mei nah nnui mri kegai leune, nnui ci kemak leuh ge ne cide tyei luzie; nnuide teikeherei nah hengam kecu de lamui dizie, <verse eid="DEU 28:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 28:34" />iciu de nnui da tei gwang kera de ngau eh nnui peusui gah dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 28:35" />RAMPAUBE nnui nkwakpuidung nah nnui pidung gage reteeidung teei süt kecu le tei pui beuzie cidungde gade nnui yilu gai lak, nnui pi gade nnui peu ga kecang.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">28:35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 16:2">Keu. 16:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 28:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 28:36" />RAMPAUBE nnuide nah nnui ne peu nnui reu hegwang tei kelube de nnui cikemak leuh dage ngngwa mie dizie, nnui mede nnui paumedung ci kemak; nnui cikade tsing nah tangtsu rabedung keda de reca zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 28:37" />RAMPAUBE minadung pelane da nnuide ngngwa kegai ga nnui kengngi ge zie, rang kemsia ge, nah henui ketei ge dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 28:38" />Nnui luh gage heleuh gi kieesüt gaizie, dede meitsi kecam nage hekwa luzie, kedanemene tangriemdung cidung tyei luzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 28:39" />Nnui kubetsi luhdung teizie nah cidung ta luzie, dede nnui zau kette sak lak, mede kubetsidung de hekwa gailak, kedanemene tangseudung ne cidungde tyeilu zielu. <verse eid="DEU 28:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 28:40" />Nnui deu leune ga olive bangdung bam zie, dede nnui katei nnuide kette maca neu gai lak, kedanemene nnui gu olive bangdung petsi nghai dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 28:41" />Nnui napeidung nah napuidung bamzie, dede penui nnui gu tei bam lak, kedanemene penui hebaang tei dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 28:42" />Nnui gu tsingbang leune nah nnui deu gu meitsi, tangriemdung ne cidungde ngkap dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 28:43" />Nnui kakga sangme kebamme ne nnui reu cuh reu reu dizie; nnui be henahreu reu dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 28:44" />Pa ncu releu beuzie, dede nang pecu releu beu lak; penui muiteu tei zie, nah nnui penui kangga lung zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 28:45" />Resetdung aidung leune nnui da gwang zie nah nnuide zui zie nah gwaka lu eh nnuide ngkapdi kemaktane. Ma aide gwang zie kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingnei kemakne, iciu eh pe ajadung nah teimzai keradung pa nnuide aja kai kebeu de mzailu kera. <verse eid="DEU 28:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 28:46" />Reset aidungde nnui da marengeidung nah mimakecangdung nzwa bamzie, nah nnui ceheudung da bam mui dizie.<verse eid="DEU 28:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 28:47" />Kedanemene nnui lungyi kecudau RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nnui suiyi eh nah nnui mlung sui baa eh reca kemakne, <verse eid="DEU 28:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 28:48" />ciziemne RAMPAUBE ne nnuide renia kera ngauraumedung langgai kebeume gwa tei zie nnui; nnui nzeu eh penui gwa tei zie, hereu eh de, paula eh de, nah magah eh de. Pa nnuide ngkapdi kemaktane nnui ngwang gage hegeu ngwanggai kaibeu zie. <verse eid="DEU 28:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 28:49" />RAMPAUBE kemdei ge gade nnuide renia kerane heleuh gede ngngwa gwang beuzie, kideu nlidung gade, helie matui tyei kera lim mie kela nzwa, nnui penui kwa helet cikemak leuh ge; <verse eid="DEU 28:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 28:50" />hezai sia eh kecingme de herüt peu la kemak leuh ge nah hename de nggia la kemak leuh ge. <verse eid="DEU 28:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 28:51" />Penui nnui gu kauruine na de nah nnui deu ga petsi bui kebeu de tyei zie nnuide ngkapdi kemaktane. Penui nnui ziemne meitsi bang beulak, zau keheci, mede maca, nnui gu kauruine mede nnui meuründung, penui nnuide peu tsaidi kemaktane. <verse eid="DEU 28:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 28:52" />Penui nnui namdi heriekidung leune ga nnuide tui kerane twagwa pwa dizie, nnui gu kecehu nah rie kengwa kiriedung nnui deu gade kau ciakdi kemaktane, nnui kenlum kai kezeu kiriedung de. RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide pwa kepeu deudung leune gade penui ne nnui gu namdi heriekidung leune gade nnuide tui kera twagwa luzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="DEU 28:53" />Nnui au nnuikatei nnui name de tyei luzie, nnui napeidung nah nnui napuidung teih, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang ne nnuide pwa kepeube, gwa kecudau nah nnui keherei kecudau nnui ngauraumedung ne nnui dage kaigai eh. <verse eid="DEU 28:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="DEU 28:54" />Mipei nnui kakga pezai yi nah nciep süt kelame, pa pe sinabe nah hung kela pe nau de de hengim dizie, nah pe namedung kebam kecang de de. <verse eid="DEU 28:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="DEU 28:55" />Cine pa tyei la kebam pekatei pe namedung teih mige de de peu lak, kedanemene pe da magede bang nzeu lak pekatei peziemne nnui ngauraume nnuide tuilu nah keherei nnui dage kai kecudau nnui namdi heriekidung leune ga. <verse eid="DEU 28:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="DEU 28:56" />Mipui nnui kakga nnwa nah kenciepme, kennwa nah kenciep dene magade tet mie pe pi kiet gai la kemak, pa hung kela pekatei pe nahpei de hengim dizie, pe napei de, nah pe napuina de, <verse eid="DEU 28:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="DEU 28:57" />nah pekatei pena ngiena pa ne mna kelu de de, nah pa mna kera henamedung dede. Pa zing de kecu bam gade penui de tyei zie kedanemene magede tyei kera ga kedine, nnui ngauraume nnuide gwa gwang nah keherei cide nnui namdi heriekidung gage kaigai kecudau.<verse eid="DEU 28:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="DEU 28:58" />Nnui magade aipau hezai samdung laisiukwak aika rau pwa kelade mzailu mecai, ci nzwa eh aipau kendu nah kehingbe zi, RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de rütlu mecai, <verse eid="DEU 28:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="DEU 28:59" />iciu cai RAMPAUBE nnui mateeidung ngau kehing tei dizie, nah nnui leuhmedung dage de; penui da mateei sia süt kecudung, peting ketie ge bamzie, nah nchok süt kecu mateeidung, peting ketie ge bam dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="DEU 28:60" />Pa nnui hing kela Egyptme gu mateeidung leune nnui dage keu gwang gai dai beuzie; cidung nnui da bam dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="DEU 28:61" />Aipau hezai laisiukwak ga rau nzeu kemak rapia nah mateei keheibe liede, RAMPAUBE nnuide ngkapdi kemaktane teu gwang gai beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="DEU 28:62" />Nnui ketsam nage banglu zie, nnui tinggim ga hegidung kieege nzwa bam liede, kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang kwa kingnei kemakne. <verse eid="DEU 28:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="DEU 28:63" />RAMPAUBE nnui dage makeyi tei gai kecu pesui la kecu nzwa, nah nnuide tei ngkiee kebeu, cine pa nnuide kekap nah kengkap teu gwang kebeu de pesuiyi zie. Nnui gum lu lai eh kebam deu gade nnuide pai mpet dizie. <verse eid="DEU 28:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="DEU 28:64" />RAMPAUBE nnuide minadung pelane kakgage tei zang dizie kideu tuh ge lam gade kideu tuh keda gage; cika nnui cikemak keda rabedung de reca zie, nnui mede nnui paumedung de, tsing nah tangtsu rabedung de. <verse eid="DEU 28:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="DEU 28:65" />Aipau leuhdung kakga nnui lungciep ngaulu ta dizie, nah cika nnui pideu de ntak kera gah dizie; meliene, RAMPAUBE nnuide cika helung kembeu, miakdung mangau ta kedi, nah keringria kehap peuzie. <verse eid="DEU 28:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="DEU 28:66" />Nnui dwa ga nnui teilung lunghau kecu bam zie; nnui tingmui tingba leune ga kengngi bam zie nah nnui teilung ga daipai gwang dau zie bi cilak. <verse eid="DEU 28:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="DEU 28:67" />Nnui tingcang dau rang zie, ‘Ih au peu tinghegi neu lie!’ nah nnui tinghegi dau rang zie, ‘Ih au peu tingcang neu lie!’ kedanemene nnui mlungdung ga kengngi dene nah nnui miakdung gade ngau kerabedung de ziemne. <verse eid="DEU 28:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="DEU 28:68" />RAMPAUBE nnuide limdung gade Egypt gage ngngwa gwang gai dai beuzie, Ih nnuide rang kebeu lampui gade, ‘Nnui Egypt ngausi dai lak ta.’ Cika nnuikatei nnuide nnui ngauraumedung dage kila peidung nah kila puidung tei kera zwa zie, dede migede nnuide lui beulak.”<verse eid="DEU 28:68" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="DEU 29" />
  <para style="s">Samkakkelu Teihecikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 29:1" />Aidung de RAMPAUBE ne Moses dage Moab deu gage Israelme de rang beu lulo aja kai kebeu samdung, cide pa penuide ngngwa Horeb lamlwa gade samkakkelu tei kecu gage kai si kecu samdung.<verse eid="DEU 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 29:2" />Moses Israelme pelane de qulu delwe penui dage rangdi, “Nnui RAMPAUBE ne Egypt deu gade Pharaoh dage, pe kilame leune dage, nah pe deu pelane ga nnui dwa gade tei kegai leune ngau da, <verse eid="DEU 29:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 29:3" />keherei süt kecudung nnui miak le kengau, ma rengeidung, nah miswakegah bata kedidung. <verse eid="DEU 29:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 29:4" />Dede henai kecang RAMPAUBE nnuide cilu kera mlung, ngaulu kera, mede siulu kera kwendung peu ma.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:8">Rom. 11:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 29:5" />Ih nnuide mmi riakdai ge hetaideu ga nnui mapie gwang; nnui painidung nnui kai kela gade hak dima, nah nnui picumdung nnui pi gade sia dima. <verse eid="DEU 29:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 29:6" />Nnui tangku gede tyei ma, nah nnui zau gede sak ma mede keda zaudung liede, ciu eh Ih nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang lie kecu cilu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 29:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 29:7" />Nnui aipau heni ga kegwang dau, Sihon, Heshbon gwangpei, nah Og, Bashan gwangpei, anuide regi kera pet, nah anui penaide ngamlu. <verse eid="DEU 29:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 29:8" />Anui penui deu luulu nah cide gumlu kera Reubenme, Gaditme, nah Manasseh leuh pempie de peudi. <verse eid="DEU 29:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 29:9" />Ciziemne aipau samkakkelu samdung kai nzeulu nah cidungde teilu, cinzwa lucai nnui makeheibe ketei ga kwak luzie.<verse eid="DEU 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 29:10" />Nnui pelane, nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa ga saplu; nnui muiteumedung, nnui leuhdung, nnui hangkiame, nah nnui kedimedung, Israel ga mina leune, <verse eid="DEU 29:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 29:11" />nnui namedung, nnui naudung, nah sangme nnui kakga nnui ramzeuki ga kebam, nnui tsing ria kecume gade nnui dui kepwame kecang liede. <verse eid="DEU 29:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 29:12" />Nnui aika kebam au RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang samkakkelu ga lütlu kerane nah sampet RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang henai nnuide ngngwa tei kebeu de ga lütlu kerane, <verse eid="DEU 29:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 29:13" />cinzwa lude pa henai nnuide pe minadung lie teilu kerane, nah pa nnui Tinggwang de lie kecu, pa nnuide rang kebeu nzwa, nah pa nnui paumedung, Abraham dage, Isaac dage, nah Jacob dage sampet kebeu nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 29:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 29:14" />Kedanemene Ih samkak aide nah sampet aide nnui dage rünne teigai ma, <verse eid="DEU 29:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 29:15" />henai aika RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dwa ga anuide ngngwa sap kebam pelane de si, henai anuide ngngwa bam kemakmedung de de si.<verse eid="DEU 29:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 29:16" />Anui dainzwa Egypt deu ga lungh gwang bi, nah nnui anui dainzwa heleuhdung kakgade tet kahgwang bi kecu nnui cibam. <verse eid="DEU 29:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 29:17" />Nnui penui gu mamie kemneubedung tsing nah tangtsu, rangkanggeu nah kecakdung le tei kelu penui kakga kebam ngauda. <verse eid="DEU 29:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 29:18" />Keheibe de nnui kakga mipei, mipui, pautsa, mede heleuhdung RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang dade henai penui mlung tet nreudi kelak cet bi lulo, cinzwa eh mie heleuh cidungde rabedung de reca melu kerane. Nnui kakgade peu migede tsingmah lungpwa kaa kecu nah heiring bang ge tei di kelak cet bi lulo.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 8:23">Bat. 8:23</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 29:19" />Cipau mina de aipau reset samdung siu keludau, pa pekatei pecu pe mlung gade samlam zie nah rangzie, ‘Ada kezuyi bam zie, Ih a mlung ketak de ga tet la liede.’ Aide ne kehwa nah kecangh ncüt kecu tei ngkap dizie. <verse eid="DEU 29:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 29:20" />RAMPAUBE pemau gibeu lak, dede cinzwa meliene, RAMPAUBE rata nah periak kecu cipau mina de mmau eh heucuh zie, nah reset pelane laisiukwak aide gage rau pwa keladung peda gwang zie, nah RAMPAUBE tinggim kang gade pezi mai ngga dizie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">29:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 22:18">Keu. 22:18</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 29:21" />RAMPAUBE Israel leuhdung pelane kakgade, samkakkelu resetdung pelane aipau hezai laisiukwak ga rau pwa keladung si eh makehung kai kerane pecu kai ntsam beuzie.<verse eid="DEU 29:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 29:22" />Gwang kera ceheu, nnui namedung nnui cai lung leu cuh keramedung, nah sangme deu kemdei gade kegwangme, penui rang zie mateeidung aipau deu gade ngau kecudau nah rapiadung RAMPAUBE ne peu nra kera tei kebeu, <verse eid="DEU 29:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 29:23" />nah penui hangdeu pelane sulfur nah keru cai kedi ngau keludau, cika magede ling gailak mede petsi bui kemak, cika mabangdung lung kemak, Sodom nah Gomorrah namdi, Admah nah Zeboyim de ngkap zing kedi nzwa, RAMPAUBE rata nah lunghop gade ngkap kedi,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">29:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ken. 19:24-25</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 29:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 29:24" />heleuh kedadung ngngwa ncüt le penui rang zie, ‘Daitei eh RAMPAUBE aipau deu ga cinzwa tei gai no? Aipau rata di süt kedi cui de pekie dai no?’ <verse eid="DEU 29:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 29:25" />Cipau cai mina rang zie, ‘Kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE samkak de mlai kedine, penui paumedung Tinggwang de, cide pa penuide Egyptme deu gade ngngwa mpet kecudau pa ne penuide ngngwa teilu, <verse eid="DEU 29:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 29:26" />nah kedanemene penui mie lwe hera kedadung gwa teidi nah penui da keumie, penui ci kemak rabedung dage nah pa ne penuide peu kemakbe. <verse eid="DEU 29:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 29:27" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE rata aipau deu ga heu cuh kedi teidi, cinzwa lu eh peu reset pelane Tinggwang hezai laisiukwak aipau gage rau pwa kela teugwang gai beu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 29:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 29:28" />RAMPAUBE pe rata le penuide penui deu gade penui mah pai mpet dida, lunghop, nah perata süt eh, nah penuide hangdeu keda gage kelien gai dida, henai nzwa.’ <verse eid="DEU 29:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 29:29" />Ma ngkim kecudung RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang da rünne bam; dede ma dung ge keulia gai kebeudung anui da nah anui leuhme da kelungta bam la, iciude anui aipau hezai samdung pelane teilu kerane.”<verse eid="DEU 29:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="DEU 30" />
  <para style="s">Rampaube da Cailigwang Kelucai Lungyikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 30:1" />Ih nnui dwa gage samlamdung nah resetdung kai kegai de, ma aidung pelane nnui da gwang kegai dau, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide teizanggai kedi heleuh keda leune kakga lunghla kecudau nnui cidungde nsung kelu dau, <verse eid="DEU 30:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 30:2" />nah nnui nah nnui name, nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang da cailigwang keludau, nah nnui mlung pelane teu nah nnui keringria pelane teu, Ih henai nnuide rang kebeudung de kingnei eh mzai lucai, <verse eid="DEU 30:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 30:3" />iciucai RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide peu lungh yi dai luzie nah nnuide ngau nggia beuzie; pa cailigwang nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide teizanggai kedi mina pelane dade nnuide hekwa dailu zie. <verse eid="DEU 30:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 30:4" />Magade nnui gwa kedi minadung ge kideu deitu le lacai<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">30:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kideu deitu le lacai: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">tinggim penli ga.</char></note>, cikade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide teu hekwa luzie, nah cikade nnuide ngngwa cailigwang beuzie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 24:31">Mat. 24:31</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 30:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 30:5" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui paume gumpwa kebam deu ga nnuide ngngwa cailigwang beuzie, nah nnui cide gumdai luzie; nah pa nnuide nnui paume da tei kegai swa nnuide peu lungh yi nah kieeki luzie. <verse eid="DEU 30:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 30:6" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui mlung nah nnui leuhme mlung geurum dizie, cine nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nnui mlung pelane teu nah nnui keringria pelane teu eh hunglu kera, iciu de nnui lunghlu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 2:29">Rom. 2:29</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 30:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 30:7" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang reset aidung pelane pwa nnui ngauraume de nah nnuide ngkau kelame de, nnuide teikeherei kelame de peu dizie. <verse eid="DEU 30:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 30:8" />Nnui cailigwang eh RAMPAUBE kwa kingnei luzie, nah Ih henai nnuide rang kebeu pe ajadung pelane nnui mnei luzie. <verse eid="DEU 30:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 30:9" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnui bata pelane de peu lungh yi luzie, nnui nalung keyi, nah nnui kauruine keyi kekieege ngau luzie, nah nnui luh mei kekiee ge buibeu zie; kedanemene RAMPAUBE pesuiyi dai luzie nnui ziemne peu lungh yi lu kera, pa nnui paume da suiyi kela nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 30:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 30:10" />Magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang da nnui mlung pelane nah nnui keringria pelane teu eh nreu gwangdi cai, ciu eh aipau hezai laisiukwak gage raupwa kela pe ajadung nah zaidung de mneilu eh nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang sam kingneilu cai pa aide tei beuzie.<verse eid="DEU 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kering mede Ketsai Kepeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 30:11" />Kedanemene Ih henai nnuide kepeu aja aide au teipa ham dima, mede nnui ziemne mzai canggai kelak bema.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:3">1 Jhn. 5:3</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 30:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 30:12" />Cide Tinggim ga bam ma, ciu eh nnui rang maisia, ‘Caune anui ziemne tinggim ga hang eh cide anui da pwa ngkie lai no nah anuide peu cide siulu lai, iciu eh anui cide mzailu kerane?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 30:13" />Mede cide jaaidi tu keda lam bie bam ma, cine nnui rang maisia, ‘Caune anui ziemne jaaidi kahpet eh cide anui da teu gwang beu laino nah anuide peu cide siulu lai, iciu eh anui cide mzailu kerane?’ <verse eid="DEU 30:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 30:14" />Dede sam cide nnui da nna süt bam, nnui mui ga nah nnui mlung ga, iciu eh nnui cide mzai lu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">30:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 10:6">Rom. 10:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 30:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 30:15" />Pielo, henai Ih nnui dwaga keyi nah kesia, kering nah ketsai kehedet peula. <verse eid="DEU 30:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 30:16" />Magade nnui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang hezaidung de mzailu cai, Ih henai nnuide ajadung kai kebam RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hung kera, pe puisau ga tetlu kera, nah pe ajadung mzailu kera, pe zaidung, nah pe samdung, nnui lungh yi lwe heleuh kedige tei luzie, nah nnui gumlu lai eh kebam deu gade RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang nnuide samlam beuzie. <verse eid="DEU 30:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 30:17" />Dede magade nnui mlung nreu tetdi cai, nah nnui kingnei meidi dede meliene mdei di nah hera kedadung da keumie nah cidungde reca di cai, <verse eid="DEU 30:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 30:18" />ciucai henai Ih nnui dage ranggaila nnuide ngkap bi dizie kecu; nnui gumlu lai eh kebam Jordan reuki lüt kera nnui kahpet kebam deu de ga nnui lungh tie gailak. <verse eid="DEU 30:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 30:19" />Henai Ih nnuide kering nah ketsai, samlamdung nah resetdung kedet kera de peula, Ih tinggim nah kideu de nnui dwa ga kehedet zierang tei kera qu gaila; ciziemne nnui cu kering kedet lulo, ciude nnui nah nnui leuhme ringlu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 30:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 30:20" />Aide teilu ciu eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de hunglu, pesam mzailu, nah pe da ngngeilu kerane. Kedanemene pa au nnui teilung nah nnui tingbazie tei mtie beuzie; aide teilu ciude nnui nnui paume, Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob RAMPAUBE penuide peu zie lie pa sampet kebeu deu de ga lungh luzie.<verse eid="DEU 30:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="DEU 31" />
  <para style="s">Joshua au Moses Bamleu kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 31:1" />Moses mie delwe Israelme pelane dage sam aidungde rang. <verse eid="DEU 31:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 31:2" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih au cu mmi haige ngkai dida; Ih mpet nah nlwet gailak da; RAMPAUBE ada ge rangbeu, ‘Nang Jordan reuki aide ga kahpet lak lie.’<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Pum. 20:12</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 31:3" />RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, pa nnui dwa rai gwang zie; pa nnui dwa gade heleuh aidungde de ngkapdi zie, nah nnui penui deu gum luzie. Joshua, pa nnui dwa kahpet zie, RAMPAUBE ne rang kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 31:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 31:4" />RAMPAUBE penui dage teigai zie pa Sidon dage nah Og, Amoritme gwangpei dage tei kegai nzwa, nah penui deu, pa ngkap kedide de. <verse eid="DEU 31:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 31:5" />Nnui penuide hereu ga redau keludau RAMPAUBE penui reu ngkieng kelu nnuide peu zie, nah Ih nnui dage rang kebeu leune kesiakge penui dage teizie. <verse eid="DEU 31:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 31:6" />Nnui lung ntiplu nah kuulu, ngngi so, nah penuide hing so; kedanemene RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang, pa nnuide ngngwa la delie; pa nnui dade canglu tadi mede nnuide gidi laklie.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:5">Heb. 13:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 31:7" />Moses Joshua de qu lwe Israelme pelane kebam gade peda rangdi, “N lung ntiplu nah kuulu, kedanemene nang mina aidungde de ngngwa lwe mie zie penui paume dage penuide hangdeu de peu zie lie eh RAMPAUBE pe sampet kaibeu ga; nangne penuide gumlu kera mzibeu zieda.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 4:8">Heb. 4:8</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 31:8" />RAMPAUBE, pa n dwa lampui sau kelabe delie; pa ncu ngngwa lazie; pa n dade canglu tadi mede ncu pütdi lak; ngngi so, n sui ceu diso.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 13:5">Heb. 13:5</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezai Kepei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 31:9" />Moses hezai aide rau lwe cingkume, Levime namedung, RAMPAUBE samkak Bung pwa kelame de cide pwapeu; pa Israel hangkiamedung pelane de de kwak ge ge peudi. <verse eid="DEU 31:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 31:10" />Moses penuide aja kaibeu eh rangdi, “Mmi hena cangdi de, hepau ngga kebeu ting de ga, Paiki Ngyi dau, <verse eid="DEU 31:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 31:11" />Israelme pelane RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang dwa gwang kelu dau pe kemci ni ziemne pa kedet kera heni de ga, nang Israelme pelane dwa de hezai aide pei eh penui kingnei zie. <verse eid="DEU 31:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 31:12" />Mina, mipei, mipui, nah hename, nah nnui sangme nnui namdi herieki ga lungh kebamme de qu hekwalu, ciu eh penui siulu nah ci lu kerane, nah ciude penui RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de herüt peulu kerane nah hezai aide samdung pelane mzailu kerane. <verse eid="DEU 31:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 31:13" />Aide teilu ciude penui leuhme, cila kemakme, siulu zie nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de rüt kera cilu zie, nnui Jordan reuki kahgwang gumlu kera hangdeu ga nnui lungh kelatane.”<verse eid="DEU 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Camlaikera Rangnswa kegai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 31:14" />RAMPAUBE Moses dage rangdi, “Pielo, nang tsaidi kera tingba de gwangzeu; Joshua de qu lwe nkatei kengkwa paiki gade pecu mpaulu, ciude Ih pecu aja kailu kerane.” Moses nah Joshua mie nah penaikatei kengkwa paiki gade kempau. <verse eid="DEU 31:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 31:15" />RAMPAUBE paiki ga hemwa tsia ge gade pecu peu ngau; hemwa tsia de paiki kimui reu ga sap bam. <verse eid="DEU 31:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 31:16" />RAMPAUBE Moses dage rangdi, “Pielo, nang tsai dizie nah n paume de ngngwa ncüt dizie; mina aidungde cuhlu zie nah helipuidung nzwa zie hera kedadung cai zui eh penui mie kecu deu ga penui kakga kebam. Penui acu gidi zie nah a samkak penuide ngngwa tei kelude gikah dizie. <verse eid="DEU 31:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 31:17" />Pecai, cipau tingdau, penuide a rata süt dizie nah Ih penuide pütdi zie. Ih penui dade a zu mbai dizie nah penuide ngkapdi zie. Kengkap kehing kekieege nah keherei penui da gwang zie ciude penui cipau tingdau rang zie, ‘Anui Tinggwang anuida ngngwala sita kedine anui reu ga kengkap kehing aidungde gwang meni?’ <verse eid="DEU 31:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 31:18" />Ih kesangde penui dade a zu mbai dizie cipau tingdau kedanemene penui kemau leune tei, nah penui keda rabedung de reca kedine. <verse eid="DEU 31:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 31:19" />Cu ciziemne lei aide raulu nkatei ziemne nah cide Israelme dage ledeu beulo. Cide penuide peu cilu, iciude lei aide aziemne zierang ge lubui Israelme de kemmau. <verse eid="DEU 31:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 31:20" />Kedanemene Ih penuide ngngwa gwang keludau tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">31:20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Tungdui nah heliadui lwa kebam deu: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hangdeu keyi.</char></note> de, penui paume dage peu zielie Ih sampet kaibeu kecu deu ga, nah penui taktyei eh tyei mnunglu nah puilu keludau, pecai penui keda rabedung da nreu dizie nah penui gwatei zie nah penui acu mlai dizie nah penui a samkakkelu de gileu dizie. <verse eid="DEU 31:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 31:21" />Mina aipaudung de reu ga kengngi kengkapdung nah keherei kekieege gwang kelu dau, lei aide penui dwa de zierang teila dizie (kedanemene penui leuhme mui gade cide nsungta di laklu). Kedanemene Ih penuide a sampet kebeube deu ga Ih penuide ngngwa kegwang dwa liede, Ih henai penui daipai cet labi Ih cibam.” <verse eid="DEU 31:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 31:22" />Cine cipau nai Moses lei aide raulwe cide Israelme de ledeubeu. <verse eid="DEU 31:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 31:23" />RAMPAUBE Nun napei Joshua dage aja kai nah ranggai, “Kuu nah n lung ntiplu; kedanemene nang Israelme de Ih penuide sampet kebeu deu ga ngngwa lüt zie, nah Ih ncu ngngwa lazie.” <verse eid="DEU 31:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 31:24" />Cinzwa eh Moses hezai samdung aide laisiukwak gage rau canglu ge, <verse eid="DEU 31:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 31:25" />pa Levime RAMPAUBE samkak bung pwa kelame de aja kaibeu, nah pa rangdi, <verse eid="DEU 31:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 31:26" />“Hezai laisiukwak aide pwalu delwe RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang samkak Bung dwaga ge kailu, ciude peu cide nnui reu kemmau zierang bam lu kerane.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">31:26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 5:45">Jhn. 5:45</ref></char></note> <verse eid="DEU 31:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 31:27" />Kedanemene nnui samzai tei kerau nah nnui zai dai kenzwa gede siabi Ih cibam; pielo, henai kecang de Ih nnuide ngngwa lungh bam kecu dau, nnui RAMPAUBE de ngngwa renia dida; Ih tsai kedi caide dai kiee ge zieno? <verse eid="DEU 31:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 31:28" />Nnui leuhme hangkiamedung, nah nnui kedime pelane de a dwa gage hekwalu, ciude Ih sam aidungde penui kwen gage ranggai luzie nah tinggim nah kideu de penuide kemmau zierang tei kera qu gaizie. <verse eid="DEU 31:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 31:29" />Kedanemene Ih tsai kedi cai de nnui nnuikatei de nlien dizie nah Ih nnuide rang kebeudung lampui ga nreu tet gidi kera Ih cibam; ipaucai kengkap nnui da gwang zie. Aide gwang zie kedanemene nnui RAMPAUBE miakngau gade dai mau bi kecube tei zie, nnui bata gade pe rata teigai zielu.”<verse eid="DEU 31:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moses Lei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 31:30" />Moses Israelme ngkwa kebam pelane dage lei aide samdung teigai teicanglu kemaktane.<verse eid="DEU 31:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="DEU 32" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 32:1" />Kingnei gailo, O tinggim, nah peu acu marang lo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:1">Peu kideube de a mui gade pet kegai sam kingnei lulo.<verse eid="DEU 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 32:2" />Peu a keledeusam tingrui nzwa cakmie lo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">peu a samrang hezin nzwa lwamie lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">cehei keceunadung reuga tingrui kenciepbe nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:2">nah mabangdung reuga ruikegai nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 32:3" />Kedanemene Ih RAMPAUBE zi sah zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:3">nah anui Tinggwang kedi rang zie.<verse eid="DEU 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 32:4" />Tsura be, pe ta yi cangsiak;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">kedanemene pe lampui pelane au mzui.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Pa au samsang Tinggwang be, heciem helim teima.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:4">Pa au nzuicang nah kemzuibe.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 9:14">Rom. 9:14</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 32:5" />Penui pecu renia heciem kesia teu tei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">Penui au pe name ma. Pe ngkau keteibe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:5">Penui au hezai mzai kemak nah kengkoi ceheu ge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:17">Mat. 17:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 32:6" />Nnui RAMPAUBE de ainzwa ziehi peu eh ni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">nnui kemie nah peusui kegahmedung?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Pa nnui pei Tinggwang meni, nnuide dam kegaibe?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:6">Pa nnuide teibeu nah peu nnuide mige teilu.<verse eid="DEU 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 32:7" />Nsung gai pielo ndaa hadung tingbaziedung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">cet gai pie pemmidung gwang kedi lebie kekiee mmi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">Nnui pei de keteugai nah pa nnuide keulia zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:7">nnui swakecingme de nah penui nnuide ranglia zie.<verse eid="DEU 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 32:8" />Hutube Tinggwang ne heleuhdung de penui mapwa peukegai dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">pa kideumena pelane de nzi kegai dau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">nah pa minadung heraidung kaibeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:8">ciulwe pa penui rabedung daikie ziebi riemgai beu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 17:26">Bat. 17:26</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 32:9" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE qwa au pe minadung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:9">Jacob au pane gum kelube da.<verse eid="DEU 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 32:10" />Pa pecu hangdeu ketsai gade ngaulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">nah gikedi nah mrakebam hetaideu ga;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">pa pecu gumlu nah pe ma pielu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:10">pane rekwetlu pecu pa hungtube de nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 32:11" />Helie ge peciep reket kebam</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">nah pena reu lim twagwa kebam nzwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">RAMPAUBE pe hesiu gumpet nah penuide keulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:11">nah penuide pe hesiu gage pung.<verse eid="DEU 32:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 32:12" />RAMPAUBE pekatei ne pecu teuswa;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:12">sangme rabe pecu ngngwa ma.<verse eid="DEU 32:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 32:13" />Pa pecu peu hangdeu reu heni kehu ga tet,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nah pa pecu luh matsidung peu tyei;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">pa heliadui tangtsukang gade pwa kelu le peu pecu tyei hemisüt lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:13">nah maca tsura deu gade.<verse eid="DEU 32:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 32:14" />Pa maca tumpui dade tyeilu nah meuründung dade tungdui sak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">meurünna ca de teu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">Bashan meurünseudung nah hemeudung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">wheat yitube dung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:14">nah nang zau yitube kubetsi dui le tei kelube gade sak.<verse eid="DEU 32:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 32:15" />Dede Jeshurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jeshurun</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israelme ku kela hezi ge, 33:5,26 gade bam; Isa. 44:2; Jeshurun pekie be “kesamsangbe.”</char></note> peluiyi nah pezai siadi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">nang n lui yidi, nang nlui di hamdi, nah nang n liebe tyei luda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">pa Tinggwang pecu damkegaibe de pütdi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:15">nah pa pecu kelikebeu Tsura de gidi.<verse eid="DEU 32:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 32:16" />Penui rabedung keda dene penui RAMPAUBE de tei periakdi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:16">penui kemau dene penui perata teidi.<verse eid="DEU 32:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 32:17" />Penui herakesiabe dage ratak tei, Tinggwang kemak be,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">penui cikemak rabedung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">rabedung kehecidung,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:17">nnui paume hing kemak rabedung.<verse eid="DEU 32:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 32:18" />Nnui Tsura de gidi, nnui pei tei kedi be de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:18">nah nnuide kering kepeu Tinggwang de nnui nsung tadi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HEB 1:2">Heb. 1:2</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 32:19" />RAMPAUBE aide ngaulu nah pa penuide pütdi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:19">Kedanemene pe napeime nah pe napuime perata ketei ne.<verse eid="DEU 32:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 32:20" />Pa rangdi, “Ih penui dwa de mbai dizie,”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">“nah Ih pie zie penui dainzwa di zie bi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">kedanemene penui au samzai teikemak ceheu ge lu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:20">samsang kemak henana be.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:17">Mat. 17:17</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 32:21" />Penui rabe kemakbe gene acu peu ariak kecu tei</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">nah penui gu ma kemtabedung ne a rata tei.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Ih mina kemak gede teu penuide peu periak kecu tei zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:21">Ih kemie heleuh gede teu penui rata tei zie.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ROM 11:11">Rom. 11:11</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 32:22" />Kedanemene a rata ne mi ge heu cuh dizie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">nah Sheol nkangtu le de heudi;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">kideu de nah pe meidung ngkapdi zeu;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:22">cide lamlwatu pi dung de heu hangdi.<verse eid="DEU 32:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 32:23" />Ih penui dage kengkap kepui kai zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:23">Ih penui da a lakpitsi pelane kap gaizie;<verse eid="DEU 32:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 32:24" />Penui nzeu eh keherei zie nah tinglum ne ngkap zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">nah liagai kelak kengkap;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">Ih penui dage renaamkaune langgai zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:24">hering kebamdung rebui ga liakela de si eh.<verse eid="DEU 32:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 32:25" />Hegwale kiengtie de ketsai teugang beuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">nah zeubungdung ga ngaukehing de zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">Cide rehangme nah relei kemcime de de ngkap dizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:25">ngiena de, nah petam puu kedimede de.<verse eid="DEU 32:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 32:26" />Ih rangda Ih penuide kendei gage zanggai di kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:26">Ih peu mina kakgade penuide nsung tadi kera tei.<verse eid="DEU 32:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 32:27" />Ngauraume keheu kegai Ih hingdi meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">nah penui ngauraumedung macet maudi lubui,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">nah penui ranglu zie, ‘Anui ngkieng luda,’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:27">Ih ne teilubui aide pelane de.<verse eid="DEU 32:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 32:28" />Kedanemene Israel au kemang leuh ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:28">nah penui da kecikecet gah.<verse eid="DEU 32:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 32:29" />O, penui macet ci lie cai, penui aide ci lubui ge,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:29">penuida dai gwang lai bam bi kecu penui ci lubuige!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">32:29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:42">Luk. 19:42</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="DEU 32:30" />Dainzwa hangge ne cang de gwa lulai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">nah hangna ne cang kerei de pakti kera,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">penui Tsura penuide zwadi eh lie mai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:30">nah RAMPAUBE penuide pütdi mai?<verse eid="DEU 32:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="DEU 32:31" />Kedanemene anui ngauraume tsura au anui Tsura nzwa ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:31">anui ngauraume de ci kebam nzwa.<verse eid="DEU 32:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="DEU 32:32" />Kedanemene penui kubebang au Sodom kubebang gade gwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">nah Gomorrah luhdung gade;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">penui kubetsidung au heiring kubetsidung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:32">penui petsibui kekaa ge.<verse eid="DEU 32:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="DEU 32:33" />Penui zau au heneidung gu heiring</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:33">nah henam mcai kesia ge.<verse eid="DEU 32:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="DEU 32:34" />Aide riem kegai de Ih ngkim beu meni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:34">a mabamdung kakga ge kebai eh?<verse eid="DEU 32:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="DEU 32:35" />Hekum peei kera au agu, nah ziehi peuzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">cidau penui kaudi kecudau;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">kedanemene penuide ngkapdi kera ting nna dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:35">nah penuida gwang kera dungde kelwa eh gwang dizie.”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:35 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Luk. 21:22, Rom. 12:19</char></note><verse eid="DEU 32:35" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="DEU 32:36" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe minadung de kemzui peu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">nah pa pe kilame de nggia beuzie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">Pa penui kengkieng gah kedi ngau luzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:36">nah migede bang kemak, hebaangme mede hebaang teikemakme liede.<verse eid="DEU 32:36" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="DEU 32:37" />Pecai pa rang zie, “Penui rabedung daiga bamno,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:37">penui nsiu kela tsura de?,<verse eid="DEU 32:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="DEU 32:38" />Penui ratakdung ca tyei kelu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">nah penui zau recadung zau de sakkelu rabedung de?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">Peu penuide cuh eh nnuide nghalo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:38">peu penuide nnuide gumlu.<verse eid="DEU 32:38" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="DEU 32:39" />Pielu cu Ih, Ih rünne, Tinggwang,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">nah rabe kedadung kette gah Ih gwale;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Ih teitsetdi la, nah Ih kering peula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">Ih rejamdi la, nah Ih teingkei beula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:39">nah migede a kengkieng gade nnuide kelilu kera gah.<verse eid="DEU 32:39" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="DEU 32:40" />Kedanemene Ih tinggim gage a ba hwacuh gai</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:40">nah rang, ‘Ih ringla mui kela nzwa, Ih bata teizie.<verse eid="DEU 32:40" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="DEU 32:41" />Ih a kiengtie kemzaide mui herei kecudau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nah a ba kemzui peu kera bang dwa kecudau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">Ih a ngauraume dade hekum peizie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:41">nah acu kengkaume pau ruibeu zie.<verse eid="DEU 32:41" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="DEU 32:42" />Ih a lakpitsidung hejai le peu lwa zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">nah a kiengtie pumteih de ngkap zie</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">mide teitset kedime nah hebaangme jai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:42">nah ngauraume muiteumedung peu gade.’”<verse eid="DEU 32:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="DEU 32:43" />Nnui suiyi lulo, heleuhdung, Tinggwang minadung de ngngwalwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">kedanemene pa pe kilamedung tsai kedime kum peibeu zie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">pa pe ngauraume dade hekum pei zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 32:43">nah pa kemau gibeu zie pe deu ziemne, pe minadung ziemne.<verse eid="DEU 32:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="DEU 32:44" />Moses pa, nah Nun napei Joshua gwang delwe mina dage lei aide samdung pelane siulu kerane rangbeu. <verse eid="DEU 32:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="DEU 32:45" />Pecai Moses Israelme pelane dage sam aidung pelane rang cangbeu. <verse eid="DEU 32:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="DEU 32:46" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Ih henai nnui dage samdung kai kebeu pelane de nnui kecet gage kailu, iciude nnui nnui namedung dage tei mzai kera aja kai beulu kerane, hezai aide samdung pelane. <verse eid="DEU 32:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="DEU 32:47" />Kedanemene nnui ziemne aide kemta sam ma, kedanemene aide nnui keringria, nah ma aide gade nnui Jordan reuki kahpet gumlu lai eh kebam deu de ga nnui lungh tie luzie.”<verse eid="DEU 32:47" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moses Nebo Deutu gade Tsai kera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="DEU 32:48" />RAMPAUBE cipau nai Moses de resiu nah rangdi, <verse eid="DEU 32:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="DEU 32:49" />“Abarim lamlwadung pelwa aide ga hang cuh, Nebo Deutu, Moab deu ga kebam, Jericho de mcwa eh kebam ga. Nang Canaan deu de pie gaizie, Ih Israelme de gum kera peulai kebam de. <verse eid="DEU 32:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="DEU 32:50" />Nang hang kela lamlwatu de gage tsai gaizie, nah ncu n minadung dage ngngwa gai dizie, nswa kecingbe Aaron Hor Deutu gade tsai kedi nzwa nah pe minadung dage ngngwa gai kedi nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 32:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="DEU 32:51" />Aide tei zie kedanemene nang Israelme Kadesh namceu ga kebam Meribah dui, Zin hetaideu ga kelamedung kakgade a dade masanglu melu; kedanemene nang Israelme kakgade acu hetwa nah herüt peulu tadi.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">32:51 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">pum. 27:12-14</char></note> <verse eid="DEU 32:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="DEU 32:52" />Kedanemene nang n dwaga kebam hangdeu pie gaizie, dede nang cika lüt lak, Ih Israelme de peulai eh kebam deu de ga.”<verse eid="DEU 32:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="DEU 33" />
  <para style="s">Moses Heleuhdung de Samlamkebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 33:1" />Aipau samlam de Moses Tinggwang minabe ne Israelme de pa tsai kemak dwa samlam gaibeu. <verse eid="DEU 33:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 33:2" />Pa rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">RAMPAUBE Sinai Deutu gade gwang</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">nah Seir<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Seir: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Edom kideutu deudi.</char></note> gade penui reuga cuhlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Pa Paran Deutu gade baaha petgai,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">nah pa kemci medung cang kerei de ngngwa gwang.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:2">Pe ba zetle ga miheu kebaa ge la.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:4">Jhn. 1:4</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 33:3" />Kesang, pa minadung de ku la;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">kemci mina pelane de n ba ga bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">nah penui n pi ga keumie;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:3">penui n samdung ngaulu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EPH 1:8">Eph. 1:8</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 33:4" />Moses anuide hezai ge kai gaibeu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:4">Jacob maame ziemne mapwa.<verse eid="DEU 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 33:5" />Pecai Jeshurun<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Jeshurun: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Israel mena.</char></note> ga hegwangpei ge bam,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">mina peubedung ngkwa keludau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:5">Israel leuhme pelane ngngwa ncüt.<verse eid="DEU 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 33:6" />Reuben de peu lunghlu nah peu tsai diso,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:6">dede peu pe mina camlu.<verse eid="DEU 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 33:7" />Aide Judah ziemne samlam da. Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">RAMPAUBO, Judah kekie kingnei gailo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">nah pecu pe mina da ngngwa gwang dai beulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">Pe ziemne regi lo;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:7">pe ngauraume de regi nghalo.<verse eid="DEU 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 33:8" />Levi ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">Ngu Thummim nah ngu Urim<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ngu Thummim nah ngu Urim: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tinggwang lungning ci kerane cingkume teu kela ma kena ge (tangtsu lubui). Tet. 28:30, Lev. 8:8, Sam 14:41-42</char></note> de ngu kesamsangbe gu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">nang Massah gade kedakpie kecube de,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:8">nang Meribah dui gade ngngwa keherei kecube de.<verse eid="DEU 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 33:9" />Pe pei nah pe pui ha kerangbe pei de, “Ih penaide ngau ma.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Pa pe siname de de hetwa peu ma,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">mede pa pekatei pe name de de mapei ma.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">Kedanemene pa n sam de gumlu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:9">nah n samkak de mzai kelune.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mat. 10:37</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 33:10" />Pa Jacob de ledeu beu n zaisiedung</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">nah Israel de ngu hezai.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">Pa n dwa gage marim kehengui</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:10">nah n recabam gage keru ratak pelane kai zie.<verse eid="DEU 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 33:11" />RAMPAUBO, pe mabamdung samlam beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">nah pe batadung de luu lulo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">Pecu mmau eh cuh kecume kia tei takcai dilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:11">nah pecu ngau keraume de, ciude penuide peu cuh dai kelakne.<verse eid="DEU 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 33:12" />Benjamin ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">RAMPAUBE ne ku kelame petaiga kwak eh lunghbam;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">RAMPAUBE pecu tingba pelane gumla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:12">nah pa RAMPAUBE ba kakga lunghla.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">33:12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2TH 2:13">2 The. 2:13</ref></char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="DEU 33:13" />Joseph ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">RAMPAUBE de peu pe deu samlam beulo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">tinggim gu pemi kewhungdung, hezin le,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:13">nah dui kecuk pekang lebie de.<verse eid="DEU 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="DEU 33:14" />Peu pe deudi de tingnaimiak gade meitsi keyi le samlam beulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:14">pekei ramsang peu matsi yitube bui kera,<verse eid="DEU 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="DEU 33:15" />lamlwa kehegwadung de peu ma yitubedung le,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:15">nah kelungta kideutudung ga ma yitubedung le.<verse eid="DEU 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="DEU 33:16" />Peu pe deu de kideu ga ma keyidung le puih eh samlam beu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">nah pe keyi dele miheu tsinghum ga kelabe de.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">Peu samlam de Joseph reu ga gwang lulo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:16">nah pe sinamedung reu kedibe peurwa reu gade.<verse eid="DEU 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="DEU 33:17" />Hetum ngkak raitube, pa ngkieng,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">nah pe kiidung<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:17 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Kidung: </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Hebrew gade cai pekie kengking.</char></note> au renaam tum kidung.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Cide le pa minadung de, penui pelane de, kideu penli le ge niagai dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">Aidung de Ephraim gu cang kereidung;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:17">aidung de Manasseh gu cangcang.<verse eid="DEU 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="DEU 33:18" />Zebulun ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">Zebulun nang tet pet kecu ga nsuiyilu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:18">nah nang, Issachar, ngu ramzeukidung ga.<verse eid="DEU 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="DEU 33:19" />Penui lamlwa gage minadung de qugai zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Cika penui masang ratak tei gai zie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">Kedanemene penui jaaidi gade mahei kekiee ngaulu zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:19">nah duikung heciang gade.<verse eid="DEU 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="DEU 33:20" />Gad ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Gad tei mdi kebeube de peu samlam punglu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">Pa cika hingho nzwa lungh bamzie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:20">nah pa mi ba mede mipeu ramgi dizie.<verse eid="DEU 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="DEU 33:21" />Pa pekatei ziemne yitube peu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">cika muiteume ge kwa deu kai mzeu kecu ziemne.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Pa mina peuteume de ngngwa gwang.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">Pa RAMPAUBE kemzuibe de</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:21">nah pe zaisiedung de Israelme de ngngwa eh mzailu.<verse eid="DEU 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="DEU 33:22" />Dan ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">Dan au hingho na ge</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:22">Bashan gade nsau mpet.<verse eid="DEU 33:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="DEU 33:23" />Naphtali ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:23">Naphtali, suiyi le pui,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 33:23">nah RAMPAUBE samlam kepui tei eh,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 33:23">naimiak kenlwetle nah tingbangle kecang deu gumlu.<verse eid="DEU 33:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="DEU 33:24" />Asher ha, Moses rangdi:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 33:24">Asher de peu keda namedung swade samlam pung ki lulo;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 33:24">peu pecu pe siname de luu lulo,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 33:24">nah pecu peu pe pi olive ca ga npung lulo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33:24 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peu ngu olive bangdung de buikiee süt lulo.</char></note><verse eid="DEU 33:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="DEU 33:25" />Peu n namdi hegeu nah hetageu rieki lulo;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="DEU 33:25">n tingbazie pelane de, peu kwak lulo.<verse eid="DEU 33:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="DEU 33:26" />Jeshurun, kesamsangbe, migede Tinggwang nzwa gah,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">tinggim ga cwa bam la nnuide ngha kerane,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:26">nah hemwa ga ndu eh.<verse eid="DEU 33:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="DEU 33:27" />Kelungta Tinggwang au mide gumla,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">nah kelungta ba de pekangga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">Pa ngauraume de n dwa gwa mpet dila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:27">nah pa ranggai, “Tei msia di!”<verse eid="DEU 33:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="DEU 33:28" />Israel lungciep teu eh lunghlu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">Jacob kelung bamde kwaklu</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">mei nah zau keheci deu ga;</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:28">kesang, peu tinggim gade hezin peda keimie lo.<verse eid="DEU 33:28" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="DEU 33:29" />N samlam au kiee, Israel!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Cau nang nzwa no, RAMPAUBE ne keli kelume,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nnuide ngha kela geu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nah nnui kendu kiengtie?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">Nnui ngauraume mbeu eh nnuida gwang zie,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="DEU 33:29">nnui penui bam kehudung daucim dizie.<verse eid="DEU 33:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="DEU 34" />
  <para style="s">Moses Tsit</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="DEU 34:1" />Pecai Moses Moab langkiedung gade Nebo Deutu ga, Jericho ncwa kebam, Pisgah hutu ga hangdi. Cika de RAMPAUBE pecu hangdeu pelane pwa liagai Gilead tingdeu gade Dan namdi ga kecang, <verse eid="DEU 34:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="DEU 34:2" />nah Naphtali deu pelane, nah Ephraim penai Manasseh deu, nah Judah deu pelane, Mediterranean jaaidi lütle kecang, <verse eid="DEU 34:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="DEU 34:3" />nah Negev, nah Jericho langkam langkie ga, Palm Namdi, Zoar ga kecang. <verse eid="DEU 34:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="DEU 34:4" />RAMPAUBE Moses dage rangdi, “Ih Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob dage sampet kegai aipau deu de da, rang eh, ‘Ih nnui leuhme de peu zie lie.’ Ih ncu peu cide n miak gade ngau gaida, dede nang cika lütlak.” <verse eid="DEU 34:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="DEU 34:5" />Cine Moses RAMPAUBE kilabe, Moab deu cika de tsaidi, RAMPAUBE sam ga sampet kebeu nzwa. <verse eid="DEU 34:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="DEU 34:6" />RAMPAUBE pecu Moab deu langkam ge gage kungdi Beth Peor nam kemcwa gage, dede henai kecang de migede pecu kung kecu bam de daiga bi cima. <verse eid="DEU 34:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="DEU 34:7" />Moses tsai kedidau pa mmi hai ge ngkai di; pe miak de sia mereu, mede pa au pedwale nzwa ngkiengla cangsiak. <verse eid="DEU 34:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="DEU 34:8" />Israelme Moses ziemne zie camrei ge Moab langkiedung gade hap, nah cidau Moses ziemne kehap tingba cangdi. <verse eid="DEU 34:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="DEU 34:9" />Nun napei Joshua de rabe maci ne puilu, kedanemene Moses pereu gage pe ba kai kegai ne. Israel minadung Joshua kwa kingneilu nah RAMPAUBE Moses dage kepeu ajadung de mneilu. <verse eid="DEU 34:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="DEU 34:10" />Cika Israel ga Moses kenzwa caihakeci migede cuh mereu; RAMPAUBE kezumok eh ci kelabe. <verse eid="DEU 34:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="DEU 34:11" />Cika caihakeci migede RAMPAUBE Moses de Egyptme deu ga Pharaoh nah pe kilame pelane dage, nah pe hangdeu pelane ga lang kebeu marengeidung nah miswakegah batadung pelane ga pa kenzwa madauge de tei ma. <verse eid="DEU 34:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="DEU 34:12" />Cika caihakeci migede pa kenzwa bam ma Israelme pelane miakngau gade ma kedi leune, ngau kehing tadung tei kegai.<verse eid="DEU 34:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="DEU 34" />
</usx>